(495123, 47739, 10170, '<td valign="top">Good choice of blacj &amp; white, oh hang on, it''s a zebra, not much choice ;)  Great shot :)</td>', 'Good choice of blacj & white, oh hang on, it''s a zebra, not much choice ;)  Great shot :)', '2003-11-26 03:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(495125, 48154, 10170, '<td valign="top">Love it.  This has a very 3D feel to it with the sticks (or whateever they are called) and powder so crisply done.</td>', 'Love it.  This has a very 3D feel to it with the sticks (or whateever they are called) and powder so crisply done.', '2003-11-26 03:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(495134, 48585, 10170, '<td valign="top">Didn''t comment on this until I had seen everything else, but if this doesn\\\''t get first place I will be stunned (I have never been so certain that I have spotted the winner before, and I really hope I am right).  This is absolutely exceptional, a stunning photo.  The lighting is amazing, you''ve captured the spray perfectly.  I love that you lose the neck area and then the chin and lips appear again.  If I had to say anything less than "amazing\" I might suggest a lacy bra, or no bra (curves of breasts, no nipples), but that is being stupidly picky.  This rates as one of my very favourite shots on the site.  Can''t wait to see who took it ;)   I''d love to take something like this one day.  10+++++<br/> <br/>(I have no idea why the \\\\\\\\\\ keeps appearing here, sorry)</td>', 'Didn''t comment on this until I had seen everything else, but if this doesn\\\''t get first place I will be stunned (I have never been so certain that I have spotted the winner before, and I really hope I am right).  This is absolutely exceptional, a stunning photo.  The lighting is amazing, you''ve captured the spray perfectly.  I love that you lose the neck area and then the chin and lips appear again.  If I had to say anything less than "amazing\" I might suggest a lacy bra, or no bra (curves of breasts, no nipples), but that is being stupidly picky.  This rates as one of my very favourite shots on the site.  Can''t wait to see who took it ;)   I''d love to take something like this one day.  10+++++ (I have no idea why the \\\\\\\\\\ keeps appearing here, sorry)', '2003-11-26 03:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(495139, 47967, 13941, '<td valign="top">soft tone works great here</td>', 'soft tone works great here', '2003-11-26 03:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(495145, 48585, 6388, '<td valign="top">I''m not voting on this challenge, but at thumbnail glance, this is by far the best shot of the bunch.  the lighting is absolutely superb.  I might like to see a little more negative space on the right, but not much else would I change.  cangratulations on a fabulous image.<br/> <br/>Pedro</td>', 'I''m not voting on this challenge, but at thumbnail glance, this is by far the best shot of the bunch.  the lighting is absolutely superb.  I might like to see a little more negative space on the right, but not much else would I change.  cangratulations on a fabulous image. Pedro', '2003-11-26 04:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(495162, 48585, 8643, '<td valign="top">I wanted to try this one - I bottled out, too difficult - but this shows how it should be done - great photo, captures the challenge perfectly.  Very sensuous, superb focus and just enough detail, love the spray.</td>', 'I wanted to try this one - I bottled out, too difficult - but this shows how it should be done - great photo, captures the challenge perfectly.  Very sensuous, superb focus and just enough detail, love the spray.', '2003-11-26 05:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(495163, 47912, 8643, '<td valign="top">Great idea - you could double up for "Soft Focus"!  Nice moody shot.</td>', 'Great idea - you could double up for "Soft Focus"!  Nice moody shot.', '2003-11-26 05:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(495164, 48030, 8139, '<td valign="top">Nice moody portrait.I whish the smoke was more visible. One of my fav. so far.</td>', 'Nice moody portrait.I whish the smoke was more visible. One of my fav. so far.', '2003-11-26 05:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(495166, 48460, 8643, '<td valign="top">Top right hand quarter of this shot would make a very nice portrait.  As a complete picture it made me smile but it doesn''t "please".</td>', 'Top right hand quarter of this shot would make a very nice portrait.  As a complete picture it made me smile but it doesn''t "please".', '2003-11-26 05:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(495167, 47926, 10869, '<td valign="top">Nice idea; the cigar is too much on the bottom though</td>', 'Nice idea; the cigar is too much on the bottom though', '2003-11-26 05:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(495168, 48663, 10869, '<td valign="top">I currently have a few white freesia close to my desk at the moment, so I can clearly smell it :)</td>', 'I currently have a few white freesia close to my desk at the moment, so I can clearly smell it :)', '2003-11-26 05:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(495169, 48670, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like the wavy line pattern.  The bean itself seems to be out of focus, though, and I think I would have liked to have seen the bean in sharp detail, and the background out of focus.  I think the composition would have been more effective with several beans, or a small pile of beans,  rather than the one lonely little bean.</td>', 'I like the wavy line pattern.  The bean itself seems to be out of focus, though, and I think I would have liked to have seen the bean in sharp detail, and the background out of focus.  I think the composition would have been more effective with several beans, or a small pile of beans,  rather than the one lonely little bean.', '2003-11-26 05:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(495171, 48123, 2553, '<td valign="top">Unquestionably aromatic.  Would like to have seen enough light on the subject to  remove the distracting shadow on the right side.  Not terribly visually appealing, and not something I would hang on my wall, but it sure meets the challenge!</td>', 'Unquestionably aromatic.  Would like to have seen enough light on the subject to  remove the distracting shadow on the right side.  Not terribly visually appealing, and not something I would hang on my wall, but it sure meets the challenge!', '2003-11-26 05:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(495172, 48428, 2553, '<td valign="top">Nice color and detail, and there is kind of a "graininess" to the image that I  really like.  Composition is such that you have enough of a tonal range to make it interesting.</td>', 'Nice color and detail, and there is kind of a "graininess" to the image that I  really like.  Composition is such that you have enough of a tonal range to make it interesting.', '2003-11-26 05:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(495173, 48469, 14527, '<td valign="top">Is there a howling wolf?</td>', 'Is there a howling wolf?', '2003-11-26 05:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(495174, 48585, 2553, '<td valign="top">A beautiful shot.  I adore the black and white, and love the way you captured the spray from the perfume.  The lighting is absolutely sensational.  If I were going to change anything: Instead of cropping the rest of her face out of the shot, I would  love to have seen the top part of her face,  and also some of her hair with the light glinting off it.  But then that would be a different shot, wouldn''t it?!  Great shot, I do love it.  10</td>', 'A beautiful shot.  I adore the black and white, and love the way you captured the spray from the perfume.  The lighting is absolutely sensational.  If I were going to change anything: Instead of cropping the rest of her face out of the shot, I would  love to have seen the top part of her face,  and also some of her hair with the light glinting off it.  But then that would be a different shot, wouldn''t it?!  Great shot, I do love it.  10', '2003-11-26 05:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(495176, 48362, 10869, '<td valign="top">really too small</td>', 'really too small', '2003-11-26 05:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(495177, 47967, 10170, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done indeed.</td>', 'Very nicely done indeed.', '2003-11-26 05:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(495178, 48638, 10170, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Sensational shot for the technical aspects, but also the idea of the drop going into the bottle.  Ribbon winner I am certain.</td>', 'Wow.  Sensational shot for the technical aspects, but also the idea of the drop going into the bottle.  Ribbon winner I am certain.', '2003-11-26 05:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(495179, 48214, 2553, '<td valign="top">Yeah, I can get the "wintery smell" from this.  Wouldn''t matter though; I love this shot.  Lighting, color, composition and overall feel of this shot are wonderful.  Meets the challenge in a very subtle way, though I imagine many peeps won''t think so.  This gets a 10 from me strictly on the aesthetics.</td>', 'Yeah, I can get the "wintery smell" from this.  Wouldn''t matter though; I love this shot.  Lighting, color, composition and overall feel of this shot are wonderful.  Meets the challenge in a very subtle way, though I imagine many peeps won''t think so.  This gets a 10 from me strictly on the aesthetics.', '2003-11-26 05:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(495181, 48588, 2553, '<td valign="top">Quite a lovely shot.  I like the composition, and that I can see just the hint of the flower fading into the background.  Not crazy about the shadows in the flower itself, would like to have seen more light filling those shadows in.</td>', 'Quite a lovely shot.  I like the composition, and that I can see just the hint of the flower fading into the background.  Not crazy about the shadows in the flower itself, would like to have seen more light filling those shadows in.', '2003-11-26 05:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(495183, 48663, 11887, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2003-11-26 05:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(495185, 48479, 11887, '<td valign="top">I like the idea but it´s a bit dificult to see the candle.</td>', 'I like the idea but it´s a bit dificult to see the candle.', '2003-11-26 05:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(495186, 48153, 2553, '<td valign="top">Not entirely crazy about the incense burner in the shot, I think I might have preferred to see just the incense sticks, but it''s really the smoke in this shot that captured my attention - it has a nice soft "ephemeral" feel to it that is very appealing.  You  managed to perfectly capture the wonderful sinuous look of the smoke without giving it hard edges.  Very nicely done.  I do like your composition, and the border treatment.</td>', 'Not entirely crazy about the incense burner in the shot, I think I might have preferred to see just the incense sticks, but it''s really the smoke in this shot that captured my attention - it has a nice soft "ephemeral" feel to it that is very appealing.  You  managed to perfectly capture the wonderful sinuous look of the smoke without giving it hard edges.  Very nicely done.  I do like your composition, and the border treatment.', '2003-11-26 05:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(495187, 48593, 11887, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2003-11-26 05:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(495189, 48553, 2553, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition with a very abstract form.  Love the color, and the capture of the sinuous nature of smoke.  Great for the challenge.</td>', 'Lovely composition with a very abstract form.  Love the color, and the capture of the sinuous nature of smoke.  Great for the challenge.', '2003-11-26 05:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(495192, 48591, 2553, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture, and lovely composition, but it seems to be pointing down to the cigar mentioned in the title, and my eyes want to see it!  Wonderful lighting, and I do like the border treatment; overall a very visually appealing shot.</td>', 'Beautiful capture, and lovely composition, but it seems to be pointing down to the cigar mentioned in the title, and my eyes want to see it!  Wonderful lighting, and I do like the border treatment; overall a very visually appealing shot.', '2003-11-26 05:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(495193, 47982, 2553, '<td valign="top">Looks like an advertising shot, (which is a compliment, BTW!);  everything about it is stunning.  Very visually appealing, and I have nothing to offer you but praise.  Quite lovely.</td>', 'Looks like an advertising shot, (which is a compliment, BTW!);  everything about it is stunning.  Very visually appealing, and I have nothing to offer you but praise.  Quite lovely.', '2003-11-26 05:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(495194, 48206, 2553, '<td valign="top">Perfect for the challenge.  Absolutely love your DOF, and the shot in general.  Visually engaging, with beautiful color.  Have to say that I find the border a bit overwhelming.</td>', 'Perfect for the challenge.  Absolutely love your DOF, and the shot in general.  Visually engaging, with beautiful color.  Have to say that I find the border a bit overwhelming.', '2003-11-26 05:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(495197, 47967, 2553, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done.  I just love the soft focus, and the soft colors.  The only thing that I find distracting is what I can see of her facial expression and the way she has her mouth set.  I''m sorry, I can''t really put my finger on what it is, but it does detract from the overall sensuous feel of the shot, for me. 8</td>', 'Beautifully done.  I just love the soft focus, and the soft colors.  The only thing that I find distracting is what I can see of her facial expression and the way she has her mouth set.  I''m sorry, I can''t really put my finger on what it is, but it does detract from the overall sensuous feel of the shot, for me. 8', '2003-11-26 05:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(495198, 47912, 2553, '<td valign="top">Soft and sensuous, meets the challenge for me, but lacking in a good tonal range that would make it more visually appealing.</td>', 'Soft and sensuous, meets the challenge for me, but lacking in a good tonal range that would make it more visually appealing.', '2003-11-26 06:00:25.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(495201, 47777, 2553, '<td valign="top">Quite lovely.  I adore the soft focus on this, as well as the lighting and color. I would have preferred to be able to see the green of the stem to balance the bit of green on the right and at the top.</td>', 'Quite lovely.  I adore the soft focus on this, as well as the lighting and color. I would have preferred to be able to see the green of the stem to balance the bit of green on the right and at the top.', '2003-11-26 06:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(495202, 47927, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like this shot very much, but the wide white border quite overwhelms it for me.  The shadowing around the edges is nice though.</td>', 'I like this shot very much, but the wide white border quite overwhelms it for me.  The shadowing around the edges is nice though.', '2003-11-26 06:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(495203, 48237, 8139, '<td valign="top">Nice setup and mood. one of my favs as far.<br/></td>', 'Nice setup and mood. one of my favs as far.', '2003-11-26 06:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(495204, 48175, 14155, '<td valign="top">With those spices, i think that the cookies will taste those smeels. Myhaamm!</td>', 'With those spices, i think that the cookies will taste those smeels. Myhaamm!', '2003-11-26 06:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(495205, 48565, 2553, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what coriander smells like, bu this makes me want to go smell it!  Nice shot with pleasing composition.  Something about the lighting feels a little "off" to me - maybe the purplish-pink cast shadows, and the yellowish feel to the shot. I would love to see this on a nice stark white background.</td>', 'I have no idea what coriander smells like, bu this makes me want to go smell it!  Nice shot with pleasing composition.  Something about the lighting feels a little "off" to me - maybe the purplish-pink cast shadows, and the yellowish feel to the shot. I would love to see this on a nice stark white background.', '2003-11-26 06:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(495207, 47912, 8139, '<td valign="top">Tender mood. Blur and grain works fine here. Subtle tone gradation too.<br/>Why not use the 640 pixels allowed here?<br/>One of my favs so far.</td>', 'Tender mood. Blur and grain works fine here. Subtle tone gradation too.Why not use the 640 pixels allowed here?One of my favs so far.', '2003-11-26 06:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(495208, 48374, 8139, '<td valign="top">I like the abstract feeling and textures.</td>', 'I like the abstract feeling and textures.', '2003-11-26 06:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(495210, 48553, 8139, '<td valign="top">One of the best smoke captures so far. Well done .</td>', 'One of the best smoke captures so far. Well done .', '2003-11-26 06:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(495214, 48638, 8139, '<td valign="top">Good idea &amp; setup. <br/>IMO the contrast between black backgroung and the white flower is to hard for my eyes.</td>', 'Good idea & setup. IMO the contrast between black backgroung and the white flower is to hard for my eyes.', '2003-11-26 06:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(495216, 48660, 11693, '<td valign="top">Good shot, slightly overexposed in the area to the right.  I could smell this photo!! 6</td>', 'Good shot, slightly overexposed in the area to the right.  I could smell this photo!! 6', '2003-11-26 06:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(495217, 48039, 11693, '<td valign="top">It is vivid enough to smell.  I just can bring the scent to my mind from this lovely flower. 6</td>', 'It is vivid enough to smell.  I just can bring the scent to my mind from this lovely flower. 6', '2003-11-26 06:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(495218, 48591, 11693, '<td valign="top">I would have loved to see the cigar so that the title did not have to tell me the aroma.  5</td>', 'I would have loved to see the cigar so that the title did not have to tell me the aroma.  5', '2003-11-26 06:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(495219, 48125, 11693, '<td valign="top">The DOF was a little too narrow.  Foreground objects have too sof of focus for me.  Like the blue. 5</td>', 'The DOF was a little too narrow.  Foreground objects have too sof of focus for me.  Like the blue. 5', '2003-11-26 06:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(495220, 48123, 11693, '<td valign="top">Sometimes the intent of the challenge is not all there is to a photo.  I smelled it though. 5</td>', 'Sometimes the intent of the challenge is not all there is to a photo.  I smelled it though. 5', '2003-11-26 06:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(495222, 48407, 11693, '<td valign="top">You captured the smell of that fresh Christmas tree with the feel of the holidays.  Slightly too centered for my taste but good overall. 7</td>', 'You captured the smell of that fresh Christmas tree with the feel of the holidays.  Slightly too centered for my taste but good overall. 7', '2003-11-26 06:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(495223, 48562, 11693, '<td valign="top">Wow,  I nearly got tears in my eayes the aroma was so strong.  I liked the smell and I like the composition. 7</td>', 'Wow,  I nearly got tears in my eayes the aroma was so strong.  I liked the smell and I like the composition. 7', '2003-11-26 06:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(495224, 48609, 11693, '<td valign="top">Great detail I could smell the photo.6</td>', 'Great detail I could smell the photo.6', '2003-11-26 06:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(495225, 48628, 11693, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  I think it could use some steam rising and it was a bit graiy for my tasste. 5</td>', 'Interesting shot.  I think it could use some steam rising and it was a bit graiy for my tasste. 5', '2003-11-26 06:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(495227, 48593, 11693, '<td valign="top">I like the diagonal of the smoke.  We have all  smelled this odor.  Good detail.6</td>', 'I like the diagonal of the smoke.  We have all  smelled this odor.  Good detail.6', '2003-11-26 06:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(495228, 47739, 11693, '<td valign="top">Good B&amp;W, it just did not have a strong aroma to me. 5</td>', 'Good B&W, it just did not have a strong aroma to me. 5', '2003-11-26 06:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(495229, 48315, 11693, '<td valign="top">Good composition.  The left tilt of th candle might be corrected but I do like the scent I got from your shot. 6</td>', 'Good composition.  The left tilt of th candle might be corrected but I do like the scent I got from your shot. 6', '2003-11-26 06:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(495230, 48437, 11693, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, but I got not distict scent from the shot.  6</td>', 'Beautiful shot, but I got not distict scent from the shot.  6', '2003-11-26 06:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(495231, 47764, 11693, '<td valign="top">No I could not.  Sorry this is uninspired to me. 4</td>', 'No I could not.  Sorry this is uninspired to me. 4', '2003-11-26 06:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(495232, 48214, 11693, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I love the composition.  the mirrored reflections are great.  I can imaginal a scent but it is just not discreet and distinct.  7</td>', 'Great shot.  I love the composition.  the mirrored reflections are great.  I can imaginal a scent but it is just not discreet and distinct.  7', '2003-11-26 06:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(495233, 48541, 11693, '<td valign="top">Great shot if flight was the challenge.  NO ODOR. 4</td>', 'Great shot if flight was the challenge.  NO ODOR. 4', '2003-11-26 06:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(495234, 48594, 11693, '<td valign="top">I little to centered and focus to soft for my taste.</td>', 'I little to centered and focus to soft for my taste.', '2003-11-26 06:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(495235, 48601, 11693, '<td valign="top">Focus is too soft throughout.  4</td>', 'Focus is too soft throughout.  4', '2003-11-26 07:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(495236, 48655, 11693, '<td valign="top">I like the vertical aspect of the shot and I could really smell the burning leaves. 7</td>', 'I like the vertical aspect of the shot and I could really smell the burning leaves. 7', '2003-11-26 07:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(495237, 48440, 11693, '<td valign="top">Don''t know if I can remember that far back.  5</td>', 'Don''t know if I can remember that far back.  5', '2003-11-26 07:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(495239, 48585, 11693, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  Great Light.  Wonderful aroma.  Very sexy and soft.  I love the outline of her face.  8</td>', 'Good shot.  Great Light.  Wonderful aroma.  Very sexy and soft.  I love the outline of her face.  8', '2003-11-26 07:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(495240, 48541, 12194, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but what does it have to do with scents and aromas?</td>', 'Nice shot but what does it have to do with scents and aromas?', '2003-11-26 07:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(495243, 48165, 12194, '<td valign="top">very nice, I love the color</td>', 'very nice, I love the color', '2003-11-26 07:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(495244, 48311, 11693, '<td valign="top">A title does not an aroma make. 4</td>', 'A title does not an aroma make. 4', '2003-11-26 07:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(495245, 48600, 4008, '<td valign="top">For me the image is a bit to sterile to transfer the smell of coffee. The smell of coffee could be associated with the warm color of morning light, with the structure of the coffee beans or powder. I would not have turned it B&amp;W. Another tip  when including highly reflective surfaces, you can use a sheet to screen of the environment and avoid many reflections, which makes the image stronger.</td>', 'For me the image is a bit to sterile to transfer the smell of coffee. The smell of coffee could be associated with the warm color of morning light, with the structure of the coffee beans or powder. I would not have turned it B&W. Another tip  when including highly reflective surfaces, you can use a sheet to screen of the environment and avoid many reflections, which makes the image stronger.', '2003-11-26 07:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(495247, 48670, 11693, '<td valign="top">Good concept but your focus is off and soft.  4</td>', 'Good concept but your focus is off and soft.  4', '2003-11-26 07:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(495254, 48550, 11693, '<td valign="top">I had to go get a cup when I saw this photo.  I me the challenge and I got the smell!! 8</td>', 'I had to go get a cup when I saw this photo.  I me the challenge and I got the smell!! 8', '2003-11-26 07:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(495255, 48020, 12194, '<td valign="top">very original... i like the orange rectangle - it makes a good contrast</td>', 'very original... i like the orange rectangle - it makes a good contrast', '2003-11-26 07:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(495256, 48642, 11693, '<td valign="top">Got the smell.  Yuk.  6</td>', 'Got the smell.  Yuk.  6', '2003-11-26 07:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(495261, 48083, 11693, '<td valign="top">Good concept but you lost your focus completely.  4</td>', 'Good concept but you lost your focus completely.  4', '2003-11-26 07:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(495263, 48670, 10869, '<td valign="top">the coffee bean is out of focus</td>', 'the coffee bean is out of focus', '2003-11-26 07:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(495265, 48591, 10869, '<td valign="top">that white border is a bit inappropriate on the top right corner</td>', 'that white border is a bit inappropriate on the top right corner', '2003-11-26 07:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(495281, 48565, 4482, '<td valign="top">It looks more like Anis and cinamon.... but maybe you put that title to have people liek me write this. :-)</td>', 'It looks more like Anis and cinamon.... but maybe you put that title to have people liek me write this. :-)', '2003-11-26 07:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
