(495290, 48214, 13735, '<td valign="top">Very poetic! And a nice piece of straw (or something) in the water (front plan), showing that it''s all natural!<br/>High 8 or even 9...</td>', 'Very poetic! And a nice piece of straw (or something) in the water (front plan), showing that it''s all natural!High 8 or even 9...', '2003-11-26 08:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
