(495311, 48639, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good choice in sepia toning there. It has a real coffee flavour to it :) This could be used for a coffee advertisement but first I''d get rid of that harsh lighting glare on the cup. I recognise the face there don''t I? I bet this is a Yanik shot :)</td>', 'Good choice in sepia toning there. It has a real coffee flavour to it :) This could be used for a coffee advertisement but first I''d get rid of that harsh lighting glare on the cup. I recognise the face there don''t I? I bet this is a Yanik shot :)', '2003-11-26 08:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(495312, 48641, 6624, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting approach to the challenge, the sameness of the color tones is successful and the dog is wonderful, with a subtle emphasis on his/her nose</td>', 'This is an interesting approach to the challenge, the sameness of the color tones is successful and the dog is wonderful, with a subtle emphasis on his/her nose', '2003-11-26 08:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
