(495315, 47967, 6624, '<td valign="top">the soft focus and pastels make this  very pretty.  It lacks a little wow for me just for that reason but I think it might do very well as an advertising image.</td>', 'the soft focus and pastels make this  very pretty.  It lacks a little wow for me just for that reason but I think it might do very well as an advertising image.', '2003-11-26 08:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(495316, 47976, 6624, '<td valign="top">This is a nice macro but (in my opinion)  these flowers are not noted for their fragrance so that it does not meet the challenge for me.  We vote according to what we bring to the image as well as what the image gives us.</td>', 'This is a nice macro but (in my opinion)  these flowers are not noted for their fragrance so that it does not meet the challenge for me.  We vote according to what we bring to the image as well as what the image gives us.', '2003-11-26 08:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(495318, 48628, 13576, '<td valign="top">This photo is close to being really good.<br/>There are a couple of things that could be improved.<br/>The graininess is really going to hurt your score this time. There is a program called neat image that should help some.<br/>the reflection on the top of the lid is distracting. The food in the pot is not visually appealing. It took me a while to figure out what was going on there. Perhaps a creamy white soup with some green parsley or carrots or something with a bit more color if you where intending for the food to be seen.<br/>The wine bottle in the back is reflecting a lot of light. I understand the intention of it being there but, it is so much brighter than the rest of the photo, it pulls the eye away from the main subject.<br/>Over all the lighting is good, skin tones are good. If it were not so grainy I believe the focus would be good as well.<br/></td>', 'This photo is close to being really good.There are a couple of things that could be improved.The graininess is really going to hurt your score this time. There is a program called neat image that should help some.the reflection on the top of the lid is distracting. The food in the pot is not visually appealing. It took me a while to figure out what was going on there. Perhaps a creamy white soup with some green parsley or carrots or something with a bit more color if you where intending for the food to be seen.The wine bottle in the back is reflecting a lot of light. I understand the intention of it being there but, it is so much brighter than the rest of the photo, it pulls the eye away from the main subject.Over all the lighting is good, skin tones are good. If it were not so grainy I believe the focus would be good as well.', '2003-11-26 08:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
