(495503, 48630, 6025, '<td valign="top">Interesting? Maybe. Smell? Not really. THe berries are out of focus, and the background is disturbing (2)</td>', 'Interesting? Maybe. Smell? Not really. THe berries are out of focus, and the background is disturbing (2)', '2003-11-26 11:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(495505, 47739, 327, '<td valign="top">Beautiful animal. They make for good contrast and the b&amp;w works well here. I don''t think this is good but not ''strong'' for this challenge. Overall it''s a good shot and I like the crop but would of trimmed the left a bit more.</td>', 'Beautiful animal. They make for good contrast and the b&w works well here. I don''t think this is good but not ''strong'' for this challenge. Overall it''s a good shot and I like the crop but would of trimmed the left a bit more.', '2003-11-26 11:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(495506, 48444, 6025, '<td valign="top">I guess this is some form of incense, yes? But papier d''armenie means nothing to me, and the smoke is too blurred. Use more light or a higher ISO value to get a shorter shutter time. Nice lighting though. (4)</td>', 'I guess this is some form of incense, yes? But papier d''armenie means nothing to me, and the smoke is too blurred. Use more light or a higher ISO value to get a shorter shutter time. Nice lighting though. (4)', '2003-11-26 11:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(495507, 48311, 6025, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot, but I don''t get the title, and I don''t see what this has to do with smell. (3)</td>', 'Pretty shot, but I don''t get the title, and I don''t see what this has to do with smell. (3)', '2003-11-26 11:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(495508, 48620, 6667, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  My only coment is I would have like to see the entire picture in sharp focus.</td>', 'Nice idea.  My only coment is I would have like to see the entire picture in sharp focus.', '2003-11-26 11:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(495510, 48642, 11467, '<td valign="top">Pooh! <br/>Good idea! Seems a bit posed though as if each item was placed there carefully. (Though I can''t say I could do better)</td>', 'Pooh! Good idea! Seems a bit posed though as if each item was placed there carefully. (Though I can''t say I could do better)', '2003-11-26 11:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
