(495523, 48578, 327, '<td valign="top">Wonderful title, and creative idea. Very good. The tone is a funny color and the hand is a bit brighter then the rest of her. Still this has appeal and it''s bang on target for the challenge. Well done. You should do well in the challenge. Good luck to you. I like it. 8</td>', 'Wonderful title, and creative idea. Very good. The tone is a funny color and the hand is a bit brighter then the rest of her. Still this has appeal and it''s bang on target for the challenge. Well done. You should do well in the challenge. Good luck to you. I like it. 8', '2003-11-26 11:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(495524, 48460, 6025, '<td valign="top">Cool picture. But where does the scent come in?</td>', 'Cool picture. But where does the scent come in?', '2003-11-26 11:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(495527, 48566, 6025, '<td valign="top">so cute ;)</td>', 'so cute ;)', '2003-11-26 11:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(495528, 48362, 327, '<td valign="top">? I don''t see the creek, pretty dark back there. I don''t understand the relation to the challenge.</td>', '? I don''t see the creek, pretty dark back there. I don''t understand the relation to the challenge.', '2003-11-26 11:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(495529, 47780, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like how you''ve gotten close up to the cookies and yet still kept some depth to the image. Personally, I like the use of DOF used here, and I also like the tone. Very professional-looking image.</td>', 'I like how you''ve gotten close up to the cookies and yet still kept some depth to the image. Personally, I like the use of DOF used here, and I also like the tone. Very professional-looking image.', '2003-11-26 11:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(495530, 47869, 327, '<td valign="top">Very good idea and yes it''s the holiday smells. The only thing I would suggest is that one or two of the fruits be turned on their side or tilted. Your shot looks a bit stiff. The colors are also dulled by the lighting used. Maybe an odd number of fruit or candles would of added to the interest here.</td>', 'Very good idea and yes it''s the holiday smells. The only thing I would suggest is that one or two of the fruits be turned on their side or tilted. Your shot looks a bit stiff. The colors are also dulled by the lighting used. Maybe an odd number of fruit or candles would of added to the interest here.', '2003-11-26 11:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(495531, 48472, 327, '<td valign="top">Great looking bottle.</td>', 'Great looking bottle.', '2003-11-26 11:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(495533, 48609, 327, '<td valign="top">Excellent macro with wonderful lighting. Super nice shot. Good luck in the challenge.8</td>', 'Excellent macro with wonderful lighting. Super nice shot. Good luck in the challenge.8', '2003-11-26 11:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(495534, 48591, 6667, '<td valign="top">Love the shot but wish the source was included. An added thought: ithere is general rule in  photography that a shot should never go diagnol from  corner to corner.  However because of the weightof the shot on the left, you seem to have broken the rule very effectively.  Good luck</td>', 'Love the shot but wish the source was included. An added thought: ithere is general rule in  photography that a shot should never go diagnol from  corner to corner.  However because of the weightof the shot on the left, you seem to have broken the rule very effectively.  Good luck', '2003-11-26 11:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(495535, 48123, 11467, '<td valign="top">I thought of that one. Glad someone had the courage to do it!!</td>', 'I thought of that one. Glad someone had the courage to do it!!', '2003-11-26 11:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(495536, 48585, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, really nice. I think this is creative showing the spray. Sexy but not too much skin. Done well. I hope this scores well in the challenge. Nice b&amp;w.</td>', 'Nice lighting, really nice. I think this is creative showing the spray. Sexy but not too much skin. Done well. I hope this scores well in the challenge. Nice b&w.', '2003-11-26 11:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(495537, 48550, 11155, '<td valign="top">Love the blue background and the wonderful swirls in the steam.  Writing on the pot is a little distracting.  Image is a little too compressed (distortions in the top left) Other than that, great image.  Good luck!</td>', 'Love the blue background and the wonderful swirls in the steam.  Writing on the pot is a little distracting.  Image is a little too compressed (distortions in the top left) Other than that, great image.  Good luck!', '2003-11-26 11:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(495539, 47764, 11467, '<td valign="top">I think I missd that one??</td>', 'I think I missd that one??', '2003-11-26 11:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(495541, 48180, 11155, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully ''natural'' shot.  Like the texture - creative POV.  Good luck!</td>', 'Wonderfully ''natural'' shot.  Like the texture - creative POV.  Good luck!', '2003-11-26 11:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(495542, 48626, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice composition {would of left the light out on the left or shot more of it}. The lighting is nice and makes this shot. Good interesting shot.</td>', 'Nice composition {would of left the light out on the left or shot more of it}. The lighting is nice and makes this shot. Good interesting shot.', '2003-11-26 11:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
