(495559, 48641, 327, '<td valign="top">Wowww! Great capture, composition. The processing here has hurt your fantastic shot. Pixelation, compression? I''m not sure, but this is a good find!! Amazing. You and the dog got so close to this quail without it flying off.</td>', 'Wowww! Great capture, composition. The processing here has hurt your fantastic shot. Pixelation, compression? I''m not sure, but this is a good find!! Amazing. You and the dog got so close to this quail without it flying off.', '2003-11-26 11:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
