(495564, 48123, 327, '<td valign="top">Cow pies really don''t smell that strong...unless they are fresh of course. Was this a joke? I would guess so. It''s not really appealing, unless your looking for something to burn in the campfire. Light is a bit too bright also.</td>', 'Cow pies really don''t smell that strong...unless they are fresh of course. Was this a joke? I would guess so. It''s not really appealing, unless your looking for something to burn in the campfire. Light is a bit too bright also.', '2003-11-26 11:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
