(495567, 48467, 327, '<td valign="top">Beautifully lit. I love the light bounce here. Clean, crisp shot. Good. I don''t know that this will do well but I score it high. I like.</td>', 'Beautifully lit. I love the light bounce here. Clean, crisp shot. Good. I don''t know that this will do well but I score it high. I like.', '2003-11-26 11:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
