(495570, 47926, 327, '<td valign="top">Neat idea.....and wow yes, it''s a smell! The bottom crop is a wee bit too tight.</td>', 'Neat idea.....and wow yes, it''s a smell! The bottom crop is a wee bit too tight.', '2003-11-26 11:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
