(495589, 47854, 11155, '<td valign="top">Great idea, I love the smell of fresh apples.  Maybe a closer shot where the apples filled the frame, or a large bushel of apples would look beter.  You got the idea here, just a more interesting composition would help, I think.</td>', 'Great idea, I love the smell of fresh apples.  Maybe a closer shot where the apples filled the frame, or a large bushel of apples would look beter.  You got the idea here, just a more interesting composition would help, I think.', '2003-11-26 12:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
