(495755, 47982, 10643, '<td valign="top">Looks like an advertising shot! High praise. The light trick is great, the background and lighting are perfect, and the color is gorgeous. Nice job.</td>', 'Looks like an advertising shot! High praise. The light trick is great, the background and lighting are perfect, and the color is gorgeous. Nice job.', '2003-11-26 13:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(495757, 48638, 10643, '<td valign="top">Nice metaphorical take on perfumery. The black background is perfect and the water droplet is super sharp and clear. So this is technically gorgeous, yet for some reason lacks emotion for me.</td>', 'Nice metaphorical take on perfumery. The black background is perfect and the water droplet is super sharp and clear. So this is technically gorgeous, yet for some reason lacks emotion for me.', '2003-11-26 13:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(495759, 48553, 10643, '<td valign="top">beautiful light, love the blue</td>', 'beautiful light, love the blue', '2003-11-26 13:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(495761, 48554, 10643, '<td valign="top">The orange color of the container and the soft focus on the edges make this look more like a pot of dirt than a can of coffee. A deeper depth of field, with the entire surface of the coffee in focus, would help, and a different colored can, maybe black or metal, would help the setup. The composition is excellent.</td>', 'The orange color of the container and the soft focus on the edges make this look more like a pot of dirt than a can of coffee. A deeper depth of field, with the entire surface of the coffee in focus, would help, and a different colored can, maybe black or metal, would help the setup. The composition is excellent.', '2003-11-26 13:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(495763, 48541, 10643, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition and a great shot, but I don''t see how it fits the scents and aromas challenge.</td>', 'Lovely composition and a great shot, but I don''t see how it fits the scents and aromas challenge.', '2003-11-26 13:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(495764, 48480, 10643, '<td valign="top">Nice motion capture. Lighting and timing this must have been quite a trick. I wish there had been some way to do it with only the bottle and the perfume cloud, no hand.</td>', 'Nice motion capture. Lighting and timing this must have been quite a trick. I wish there had been some way to do it with only the bottle and the perfume cloud, no hand.', '2003-11-26 13:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(495766, 48214, 10643, '<td valign="top">A lovely landscape and great reflection, but doesn''t really shout "scent" to me.</td>', 'A lovely landscape and great reflection, but doesn''t really shout "scent" to me.', '2003-11-26 13:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(495767, 47886, 10643, '<td valign="top">I like this very much but wish the focus were sharper. I can''t tell what point in the image is focused. If the whole thing is intentionally soft, that''s fine, but it seems like the droplet and/or the bottle threads should be sharper to emphasize the strength of the scent. The base of the bottle also disappears into its reflection for the same reason, making it appear to be a taller, hourglass-shaped bottle.</td>', 'I like this very much but wish the focus were sharper. I can''t tell what point in the image is focused. If the whole thing is intentionally soft, that''s fine, but it seems like the droplet and/or the bottle threads should be sharper to emphasize the strength of the scent. The base of the bottle also disappears into its reflection for the same reason, making it appear to be a taller, hourglass-shaped bottle.', '2003-11-26 13:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(495770, 47886, 6008, '<td valign="top">What appears to be a soft focus works well to give a dreamy effect. The unusual angle helps give it some interest, and follows a commonly used advertising style. The color is good and there are no obvious light reflections in the glass. Very nicely shot.</td>', 'What appears to be a soft focus works well to give a dreamy effect. The unusual angle helps give it some interest, and follows a commonly used advertising style. The color is good and there are no obvious light reflections in the glass. Very nicely shot.', '2003-11-26 13:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(495773, 48526, 10643, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite scents. :)</td>', 'One of my favorite scents. :)', '2003-11-26 13:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
