(495776, 48578, 10643, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition and nice surreal (infrared?) color. The noise is a shame. This is the sort of shot that NeatImage makes a huge improvement to, because you already have an unreal tone to the skin.</td>', 'Lovely composition and nice surreal (infrared?) color. The noise is a shame. This is the sort of shot that NeatImage makes a huge improvement to, because you already have an unreal tone to the skin.', '2003-11-26 13:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
