(496037, 47777, 7628, '<td valign="top">nice use of soft focus.  colors and glow - a real atmosphere that begins to capture the intense aroma of the stargazer, wish the crop wasn;t in so close on the flower, i''d like to see more edges of petals.</td>', 'nice use of soft focus.  colors and glow - a real atmosphere that begins to capture the intense aroma of the stargazer, wish the crop wasn;t in so close on the flower, i''d like to see more edges of petals.', '2003-11-26 16:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
