(496097, 48628, 10858, '<td valign="top">Wonderful idea, composition and DOF, I like the face in the corner very much, and I also like that you partly show it: only the mouth and the nose. The reflection adds a nice visual element to the shot. But why didn''t you use noise reduction? I would simply love the shot without the noise, which is this way quite distracting to me. I guess you couldn''t help the white circle under the models hand, my camera also makes such things sometimes.</td>', 'Wonderful idea, composition and DOF, I like the face in the corner very much, and I also like that you partly show it: only the mouth and the nose. The reflection adds a nice visual element to the shot. But why didn''t you use noise reduction? I would simply love the shot without the noise, which is this way quite distracting to me. I guess you couldn''t help the white circle under the models hand, my camera also makes such things sometimes.', '2003-11-26 17:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(496098, 48626, 5792, '<td valign="top">A very high quality well composed image.</td>', 'A very high quality well composed image.', '2003-11-26 17:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
