(496276, 48467, 14552, '<td valign="top">No imagination at all.</td>', 'No imagination at all.', '2003-11-26 18:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(496283, 47967, 11843, '<td valign="top">NICE! This is exactly what I wanted to do.....but, I couldn''t find a willing participant.<br/>Things I like: the softness of the image is very appealing. the angle of the shot and how it shows the  area where the neck hits the shoulders.<br/>Things I don''t like: the mouth is distracting. the crop of the hand is too close and gives me the feeling of tension instead of ease. the softness of the image is just a little too much, I like the softness, but would have prefered a little less.  <br/>What I would have done differently: crop to just below the mouth showing just the chin. show more skin, as in no shirt what so ever. leave more room to the right of the hand. less soft.<br/></td>', 'NICE! This is exactly what I wanted to do.....but, I couldn''t find a willing participant.Things I like: the softness of the image is very appealing. the angle of the shot and how it shows the  area where the neck hits the shoulders.Things I don''t like: the mouth is distracting. the crop of the hand is too close and gives me the feeling of tension instead of ease. the softness of the image is just a little too much, I like the softness, but would have prefered a little less.  What I would have done differently: crop to just below the mouth showing just the chin. show more skin, as in no shirt what so ever. leave more room to the right of the hand. less soft.', '2003-11-26 19:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(496292, 48578, 11843, '<td valign="top">If I had a willing participant....this is what I would have done.<br/>Things I like: I like the angle of this shot, showing just where the neck hits the shoulders. I like the monocolor choice, it has a very cool feel to it.<br/>Things I don\''t like: I would like to have seen more of the neck and shoulder area. the crop on the hand is too tight, would like to see more of the hand. could be a knee we are looking at, well not really, but you get the idea.</td>', 'If I had a willing participant....this is what I would have done.Things I like: I like the angle of this shot, showing just where the neck hits the shoulders. I like the monocolor choice, it has a very cool feel to it.Things I don\''t like: I would like to have seen more of the neck and shoulder area. the crop on the hand is too tight, would like to see more of the hand. could be a knee we are looking at, well not really, but you get the idea.', '2003-11-26 19:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(496294, 48621, 6999, '<td valign="top">Slightly odd title, given those other roses in the picture. Colouring seems strange - a touch of over-saturation or something? I think it''s also missing the closeness that would be more expressive of the scent rather than the sight of a rose.</td>', 'Slightly odd title, given those other roses in the picture. Colouring seems strange - a touch of over-saturation or something? I think it''s also missing the closeness that would be more expressive of the scent rather than the sight of a rose.', '2003-11-26 19:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(496301, 48077, 6999, '<td valign="top">I thought it was bits of crayfish at first. Lavender? Focus seems to be dead centre; why did you keep the top section of the plate with that glare? I don''t know what this is, but it doesn''t look like anything I associate with Lavender. The light seems very harsh too - like a single over-head lamp - and some diffusion wouldn''t hurt it. Also the white plate makes the dark objects very dificult to keep well exposed, rather than under-exposed like this.</td>', 'I thought it was bits of crayfish at first. Lavender? Focus seems to be dead centre; why did you keep the top section of the plate with that glare? I don''t know what this is, but it doesn''t look like anything I associate with Lavender. The light seems very harsh too - like a single over-head lamp - and some diffusion wouldn''t hurt it. Also the white plate makes the dark objects very dificult to keep well exposed, rather than under-exposed like this.', '2003-11-26 19:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(496302, 48620, 12902, '<td valign="top">Very good concept, nicely meeting the challenge. Focus a bit too soft in my opinion. 8</td>', 'Very good concept, nicely meeting the challenge. Focus a bit too soft in my opinion. 8', '2003-11-26 19:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(496304, 48546, 6999, '<td valign="top">Decent lighting (a huge compliment in itself), and intriguing for the use of black and white. There''s something almost blatant about this composition - like you haven''t been distracted by any possible suggestions of ''boring'' and just gone for it. One point: in order to see all of the spray, I have to lighten my monitor so all the top five squres on the chart blow out - could curves have helped bring that out a bit more? Or perhaps more light in just that area?</td>', 'Decent lighting (a huge compliment in itself), and intriguing for the use of black and white. There''s something almost blatant about this composition - like you haven''t been distracted by any possible suggestions of ''boring'' and just gone for it. One point: in order to see all of the spray, I have to lighten my monitor so all the top five squres on the chart blow out - could curves have helped bring that out a bit more? Or perhaps more light in just that area?', '2003-11-26 19:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(496306, 48039, 2158, '<td valign="top">Nice flower, but I find the background really distracting.</td>', 'Nice flower, but I find the background really distracting.', '2003-11-26 19:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
