(496669, 47987, 12160, '<td valign="top">Really looks like fresh from the oven. I could almost smell it. Nice job.</td>', 'Really looks like fresh from the oven. I could almost smell it. Nice job.', '2003-11-27 04:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(496670, 48266, 12160, '<td valign="top">nice job, beautiful shot.!</td>', 'nice job, beautiful shot.!', '2003-11-27 04:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(496673, 47851, 10848, '<td valign="top">Aww my dad wore this too, brings back wonderful memories, this is a good shot,some may say the lighting is too dark, but I see that you are portraying a memory here so dim lighting IMHO is definitely called for.</td>', 'Aww my dad wore this too, brings back wonderful memories, this is a good shot,some may say the lighting is too dark, but I see that you are portraying a memory here so dim lighting IMHO is definitely called for.', '2003-11-27 04:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(496674, 47936, 10739, '<td valign="top">Framing is really bad</td>', 'Framing is really bad', '2003-11-27 04:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(496676, 48200, 11321, '<td valign="top">Nice conception! The background is too narrow tho..<br/>I would like to see more landscape...</td>', 'Nice conception! The background is too narrow tho..I would like to see more landscape...', '2003-11-27 05:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(496678, 48441, 11321, '<td valign="top">The smell-o-machine :)<br/>The two cups form a perfect landscape...<br/>There is symmetry but the picture is not symmetric.. don''t be bothered that there is some switches at the top-left of the picture.. try to show more in the right side.. so that the cups are perfectly in the middle..</td>', 'The smell-o-machine :)The two cups form a perfect landscape...There is symmetry but the picture is not symmetric.. don''t be bothered that there is some switches at the top-left of the picture.. try to show more in the right side.. so that the cups are perfectly in the middle..', '2003-11-27 05:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(496681, 48467, 13749, '<td valign="top">too much negative space for my taste, but i like the detail in the gel and overall idea.</td>', 'too much negative space for my taste, but i like the detail in the gel and overall idea.', '2003-11-27 05:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(496682, 48093, 11321, '<td valign="top">Like it is said: dog''s nose is about ten thousand times more sencitive than human nose (talking about smeling things)..<br/>Very good concept of the picture!<br/>The middle of the picture.. the floor is badly overexposured becouse the light reflects from that..  maybe if the light should come more form left or right then you don''t have this problem.</td>', 'Like it is said: dog''s nose is about ten thousand times more sencitive than human nose (talking about smeling things)..Very good concept of the picture!The middle of the picture.. the floor is badly overexposured becouse the light reflects from that..  maybe if the light should come more form left or right then you don''t have this problem.', '2003-11-27 05:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(496683, 48659, 11321, '<td valign="top">Oh yes.. i know how that smells.. grrr<br/></td>', 'Oh yes.. i know how that smells.. grrr', '2003-11-27 06:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(496693, 48168, 10739, '<td valign="top">The border is negative for the pic. You should sharpen the pic<br/></td>', 'The border is negative for the pic. You should sharpen the pic', '2003-11-27 06:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(496699, 48585, 10739, '<td valign="top">Great light, hot pic !</td>', 'Great light, hot pic !', '2003-11-27 06:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(496706, 48665, 10887, '<td valign="top">Very creative! And fun!</td>', 'Very creative! And fun!', '2003-11-27 07:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(496707, 48441, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the full frame composition and the positioning of the cup handles. The cups themselves don''t really work for me - the designs are so at odds with the elegance of the Krups coffee machine - it''s a bit jarring. Then again maybe that''s what you were aiming for. I''d like to see something similar with more elegant and modern cups, perhaps glass, metal or such.</td>', 'I like the full frame composition and the positioning of the cup handles. The cups themselves don''t really work for me - the designs are so at odds with the elegance of the Krups coffee machine - it''s a bit jarring. Then again maybe that''s what you were aiming for. I''d like to see something similar with more elegant and modern cups, perhaps glass, metal or such.', '2003-11-27 08:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(496708, 48550, 3087, '<td valign="top">Some of the shapes in the steam are lovely - I particularly like that little circular spiral towards the top left. Certainly conveys the smell of coffee to me. I like the choice of blue background.</td>', 'Some of the shapes in the steam are lovely - I particularly like that little circular spiral towards the top left. Certainly conveys the smell of coffee to me. I like the choice of blue background.', '2003-11-27 08:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(496709, 48480, 3087, '<td valign="top">Quite an intriguing image, and with the title to give guidance, tells a simple story in itself. I am sure many of us understand how certain smells can remind us of certain people, and have used that to feel closer to loved ones when separated from them.</td>', 'Quite an intriguing image, and with the title to give guidance, tells a simple story in itself. I am sure many of us understand how certain smells can remind us of certain people, and have used that to feel closer to loved ones when separated from them.', '2003-11-27 08:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(496710, 48597, 3087, '<td valign="top">I guess I can imagine the smell without too much trouble but the image itself lacks punch/ interest. It doesn''t (for me) stand alone as an interesting image. Focus also seems a little soft.</td>', 'I guess I can imagine the smell without too much trouble but the image itself lacks punch/ interest. It doesn''t (for me) stand alone as an interesting image. Focus also seems a little soft.', '2003-11-27 08:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(496712, 48466, 3087, '<td valign="top">Except that I can''t see the coffee itself, not even the surface!<br/>So instead it''s a (nicely taken) picture of a (nicely designed) mug with little about the image to make me think of any particular scent.<br/>I lke the background, though the horizon needs to be straight. Lighting could do with a little filling towards right of mug.<br/>I wonder if experimenting with different perspectives/ viewpoints would allow inclusion of the coffee itself in the image whilst still giving a strong composition?</td>', 'Except that I can''t see the coffee itself, not even the surface!So instead it''s a (nicely taken) picture of a (nicely designed) mug with little about the image to make me think of any particular scent.I lke the background, though the horizon needs to be straight. Lighting could do with a little filling towards right of mug.I wonder if experimenting with different perspectives/ viewpoints would allow inclusion of the coffee itself in the image whilst still giving a strong composition?', '2003-11-27 08:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(496714, 47775, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is a tough one. I like the composition and the inclusion of the insect to give a focal point.<br/>The image falls down for me because the honey itself looks too messy and hence, somewhat unappealing. That seems to interfere with my imagining the scent. I think this is where we can really see how manipulated magazine shoots of food items are - they might sift through bottles and bottles of honey and trays and trays of honeycomb pieces in order to find a neat and complete comb and honey of just the right colour.<br/>That perfection of presentation is what (for me) helps make the item look appealing and also allows my imagination to get going on the other senses such as smell.</td>', 'This is a tough one. I like the composition and the inclusion of the insect to give a focal point.The image falls down for me because the honey itself looks too messy and hence, somewhat unappealing. That seems to interfere with my imagining the scent. I think this is where we can really see how manipulated magazine shoots of food items are - they might sift through bottles and bottles of honey and trays and trays of honeycomb pieces in order to find a neat and complete comb and honey of just the right colour.That perfection of presentation is what (for me) helps make the item look appealing and also allows my imagination to get going on the other senses such as smell.', '2003-11-27 08:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(496715, 48575, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! I like the tight crop and the water and lighting work pretty well - I think it could be improved with just a touch more light bounced into that lower right hand corner. I want to smell this rose which means that it''s met the challenge better than most entries I''ve viewed so far!</td>', 'Beautiful! I like the tight crop and the water and lighting work pretty well - I think it could be improved with just a touch more light bounced into that lower right hand corner. I want to smell this rose which means that it''s met the challenge better than most entries I''ve viewed so far!', '2003-11-27 08:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(496716, 48169, 3087, '<td valign="top">An intriguing image, which, for me, is let down by focus and lighting on the rose head. I like the subtle incense smoke and the use of the black areas within the composition.</td>', 'An intriguing image, which, for me, is let down by focus and lighting on the rose head. I like the subtle incense smoke and the use of the black areas within the composition.', '2003-11-27 08:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(496717, 48511, 3087, '<td valign="top">Good and simple composition. Interesting lighting.</td>', 'Good and simple composition. Interesting lighting.', '2003-11-27 08:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(496718, 48437, 11321, '<td valign="top">wow.. it looks so unnatural..</td>', 'wow.. it looks so unnatural..', '2003-11-27 08:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(496719, 48175, 3087, '<td valign="top">Very festive, certainly the kind of image I can imagine being used in seasonal articles in weekly/ monthly magazines.</td>', 'Very festive, certainly the kind of image I can imagine being used in seasonal articles in weekly/ monthly magazines.', '2003-11-27 08:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(496720, 48311, 3087, '<td valign="top">Not sure what pooooot means and what the smell in question is - I''d guess at slightly seaweed laden stagnant water. I like the composition of this with the twig and green providing framing at the bottom and the frog off the one side. It looks like he''s walking on water though, which means I''m not quite "seeing" it right!!!</td>', 'Not sure what pooooot means and what the smell in question is - I''d guess at slightly seaweed laden stagnant water. I like the composition of this with the twig and green providing framing at the bottom and the frog off the one side. It looks like he''s walking on water though, which means I''m not quite "seeing" it right!!!', '2003-11-27 08:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(496721, 48123, 11321, '<td valign="top">I thougt someone will shoot s***.. looks like you are the only one.<br/>Some extra points being brave enogh to enter this picture.</td>', 'I thougt someone will shoot s***.. looks like you are the only one.Some extra points being brave enogh to enter this picture.', '2003-11-27 08:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(496723, 48210, 3087, '<td valign="top">Smell, yes. Image with visual interest, not overly.<br/>Background doesn''t add anything and harsh reflection of light in the liquid on the grey surface seems to attract my eye more than the oranges themselves.<br/></td>', 'Smell, yes. Image with visual interest, not overly.Background doesn''t add anything and harsh reflection of light in the liquid on the grey surface seems to attract my eye more than the oranges themselves.', '2003-11-27 08:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(496724, 48598, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like what you''re doing here.<br/>I''d like to suggest some very minor changes which might (in my opinion only) improve the image.<br/>The incense burner seems on a slight tilt within the frame. I think this may be because of viewpoint/ position of the camera since the tip seems to be fairly vertical but the whole item doesn''t quite seem straight.<br/>The incense cones on the right - I''d move the one that is partially hidden by the burner to the right just a touch and infact move all of them to the right just a touch - feels more balanced to me.<br/>I like the subtle shape and effect of the smoke - is it a long exposure?</td>', 'I like what you''re doing here.I''d like to suggest some very minor changes which might (in my opinion only) improve the image.The incense burner seems on a slight tilt within the frame. I think this may be because of viewpoint/ position of the camera since the tip seems to be fairly vertical but the whole item doesn''t quite seem straight.The incense cones on the right - I''d move the one that is partially hidden by the burner to the right just a touch and infact move all of them to the right just a touch - feels more balanced to me.I like the subtle shape and effect of the smoke - is it a long exposure?', '2003-11-27 08:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(496725, 48668, 11321, '<td valign="top">the bright bottom-left corner is distracting.. otherwise nice conception and idea!</td>', 'the bright bottom-left corner is distracting.. otherwise nice conception and idea!', '2003-11-27 08:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(496726, 48162, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and viewpoint and use of smoke to add interest at top of frame.<br/>Would allow just a small touch more of background at the right edge so that tip of holder isn''t quite so close to edge of frame. Just a touch though.<br/>Also curious as to how lower DOF would work - I think it could add further interest.</td>', 'Nice composition and viewpoint and use of smoke to add interest at top of frame.Would allow just a small touch more of background at the right edge so that tip of holder isn''t quite so close to edge of frame. Just a touch though.Also curious as to how lower DOF would work - I think it could add further interest.', '2003-11-27 08:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(496727, 48635, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lighting seems a little dull, composition and simplicity of composition works for me.</td>', 'Lighting seems a little dull, composition and simplicity of composition works for me.', '2003-11-27 08:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(496728, 48609, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice use of low DOF and good tight crop into the subject.</td>', 'Nice use of low DOF and good tight crop into the subject.', '2003-11-27 08:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(496729, 48639, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lighting seems harsh and brings out shiny nature of skin (could do with diffuse light source and powdered skin). But choice to go tight in on subject and to have model close her eyes, works well. I''d like to see more symmetry in the position of her fingers.</td>', 'Lighting seems harsh and brings out shiny nature of skin (could do with diffuse light source and powdered skin). But choice to go tight in on subject and to have model close her eyes, works well. I''d like to see more symmetry in the position of her fingers.', '2003-11-27 08:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(496730, 48152, 11321, '<td valign="top">pretty good smell is comeing out of there.. great capture!</td>', 'pretty good smell is comeing out of there.. great capture!', '2003-11-27 08:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(496731, 48180, 3087, '<td valign="top">This definitely conveys that slightly musty pine smell that is so evocative of the season. I like the use of shallow DOF to throw out foreground and background, and like choice of getting in close to subjects.</td>', 'This definitely conveys that slightly musty pine smell that is so evocative of the season. I like the use of shallow DOF to throw out foreground and background, and like choice of getting in close to subjects.', '2003-11-27 08:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(496734, 47927, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautifully cropped to really highlight the swirling pattern of the petals. Nice composition with the main curve from top to bottom (at the right hand side) formed by the two-three touching petals there. Yellow shadow detail adds depth. Good choie of border though not sure of choice of grey colour for the thicker smudged border element.</td>', 'Beautifully cropped to really highlight the swirling pattern of the petals. Nice composition with the main curve from top to bottom (at the right hand side) formed by the two-three touching petals there. Yellow shadow detail adds depth. Good choie of border though not sure of choice of grey colour for the thicker smudged border element.', '2003-11-27 08:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(496735, 48585, 3087, '<td valign="top">A beautiful image and great choice of low lighting overall with spots of light to bring out spray, cleavage and edge of face. Cropped absolutely superbly. Wouldn''t change a thing.</td>', 'A beautiful image and great choice of low lighting overall with spots of light to bring out spray, cleavage and edge of face. Cropped absolutely superbly. Wouldn''t change a thing.', '2003-11-27 08:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(496736, 48642, 3087, '<td valign="top">Yah - I get the smell!!! Lighting seems a touch low on background ball, and that tends to make left of frame a little duller. Just doesn''t quite feel balanced to me. That said, one of the better entries in the challenge, for me.</td>', 'Yah - I get the smell!!! Lighting seems a touch low on background ball, and that tends to make left of frame a little duller. Just doesn''t quite feel balanced to me. That said, one of the better entries in the challenge, for me.', '2003-11-27 08:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(496737, 48536, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, focus and lighting poor.</td>', 'Nice idea, focus and lighting poor.', '2003-11-27 08:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(496739, 48554, 3087, '<td valign="top">Less accurate it would be but I think coffee beans insteaf of ground might work better here - certainly it''s not immediately obvious that it''s coffee and if I saw this outside of this challenge I''d assume it was mud in a terracotta flowerpot. <br/>I like the composition very much, feels very balanced. DOF choice works well as does position of scoop.</td>', 'Less accurate it would be but I think coffee beans insteaf of ground might work better here - certainly it''s not immediately obvious that it''s coffee and if I saw this outside of this challenge I''d assume it was mud in a terracotta flowerpot. I like the composition very much, feels very balanced. DOF choice works well as does position of scoop.', '2003-11-27 08:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(496740, 48257, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lighting a little too harsh, but, on right hand side of frame, nice detail in the skins. Good composition, interesting choice of b/w.</td>', 'Lighting a little too harsh, but, on right hand side of frame, nice detail in the skins. Good composition, interesting choice of b/w.', '2003-11-27 08:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(496741, 48459, 3087, '<td valign="top">Mmmm! Nice lighting. Composition doesn''t quite work for me but certainly better at an angle than head on.</td>', 'Mmmm! Nice lighting. Composition doesn''t quite work for me but certainly better at an angle than head on.', '2003-11-27 08:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(496742, 48154, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!<br/>What a lot of black pepper you have!<br/>Nice colours, nice composition, lighting OK, border supportive rather than competing for attention.<br/>I like this very much.</td>', 'Beautiful!What a lot of black pepper you have!Nice colours, nice composition, lighting OK, border supportive rather than competing for attention.I like this very much.', '2003-11-27 08:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(496744, 48256, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great diagonal composition. Would love to see some smoke too.</td>', 'Great diagonal composition. Would love to see some smoke too.', '2003-11-27 08:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(496745, 48649, 3087, '<td valign="top">For some reason this doesn''t convey the smell to me - I think it''s because the colour palette is cold - very white and blue. I think if the popcorn were slightly more yellow or the bowl itself were a warmer colour I''d "see" the warmth that showed me this was freshly popped and be more able to imagine the smell.<br/>I do like the composition and use of black space.</td>', 'For some reason this doesn''t convey the smell to me - I think it''s because the colour palette is cold - very white and blue. I think if the popcorn were slightly more yellow or the bowl itself were a warmer colour I''d "see" the warmth that showed me this was freshly popped and be more able to imagine the smell.I do like the composition and use of black space.', '2003-11-27 08:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(496746, 48214, 3087, '<td valign="top">A stunning image, though one that just doesn''t convey any scent to me whatsoever. Beautiful capture of mist, slightly muted colours and beautifully balanced composition.</td>', 'A stunning image, though one that just doesn''t convey any scent to me whatsoever. Beautiful capture of mist, slightly muted colours and beautifully balanced composition.', '2003-11-27 08:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(496747, 48502, 3087, '<td valign="top">I loooove the smell of matches just after they''ve been blown out! I know I know it''s not good to inhale that!</td>', 'I loooove the smell of matches just after they''ve been blown out! I know I know it''s not good to inhale that!', '2003-11-27 08:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(496748, 48526, 3087, '<td valign="top">Not something I''d associate with smell though I appreciate they do have quite a strong odour when new. Nice picture.</td>', 'Not something I''d associate with smell though I appreciate they do have quite a strong odour when new. Nice picture.', '2003-11-27 08:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(496749, 48659, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice muted colours and off-centre composition.</td>', 'Nice muted colours and off-centre composition.', '2003-11-27 08:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(496750, 47982, 3087, '<td valign="top">Oooh is this a double exposure? With one exposure capturing the bottle and leaves and the other adding moving lights infront of a dark background? However you''ve done it it''s quite quirky!</td>', 'Oooh is this a double exposure? With one exposure capturing the bottle and leaves and the other adding moving lights infront of a dark background? However you''ve done it it''s quite quirky!', '2003-11-27 09:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(496751, 48056, 3087, '<td valign="top">This has the look and feel of a painting - the textures are so well detailed and it feels like a still life study. I like the cinammon against the wooden background too.</td>', 'This has the look and feel of a painting - the textures are so well detailed and it feels like a still life study. I like the cinammon against the wooden background too.', '2003-11-27 09:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(496753, 48030, 3087, '<td valign="top">I can see the smoke, just about, but would like to be able to see it more clearly.</td>', 'I can see the smoke, just about, but would like to be able to see it more clearly.', '2003-11-27 09:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(496754, 48593, 3087, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting on the smoke and the shape of it within the frame gives a very pleasing composition. This is one of my favourites.</td>', 'Very nice lighting on the smoke and the shape of it within the frame gives a very pleasing composition. This is one of my favourites.', '2003-11-27 09:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(496756, 48460, 3087, '<td valign="top">LOL How did you not fall off?<br/>Strange viewpoint and rotation makes this very intriquing and does add interest. It doesn''t actually make me think of the smell but it is the kind of quirky concept image I can see hanging in a gallery.</td>', 'LOL How did you not fall off?Strange viewpoint and rotation makes this very intriquing and does add interest. It doesn''t actually make me think of the smell but it is the kind of quirky concept image I can see hanging in a gallery.', '2003-11-27 09:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(496757, 48200, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the framing and low viewpoint and the inclusion of the winter treescape behind. Very strong, very artistic. I can''t see any of the actual coffee, or steam, which makes it harder to get a sense of smell. But I think this image is excellent.</td>', 'I like the framing and low viewpoint and the inclusion of the winter treescape behind. Very strong, very artistic. I can''t see any of the actual coffee, or steam, which makes it harder to get a sense of smell. But I think this image is excellent.', '2003-11-27 09:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(496760, 48553, 3087, '<td valign="top">What incredible lighting, colour and shape! Like this very much!</td>', 'What incredible lighting, colour and shape! Like this very much!', '2003-11-27 09:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(496761, 48638, 3087, '<td valign="top">How clever!</td>', 'How clever!', '2003-11-27 09:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(496762, 47739, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the image very much, though it conveys "taste" more than "smell" to me, personally.</td>', 'I like the image very much, though it conveys "taste" more than "smell" to me, personally.', '2003-11-27 09:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(496764, 48618, 3087, '<td valign="top">Microwave seems a touch tilted but other than that, the composition is great - I like the space left around the top edge and the wide expanse of work surface, exaggerated by the low viewpoint.</td>', 'Microwave seems a touch tilted but other than that, the composition is great - I like the space left around the top edge and the wide expanse of work surface, exaggerated by the low viewpoint.', '2003-11-27 09:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(496765, 47780, 3087, '<td valign="top">Fantastic use of low DOF. Would love to see this in colour, as can''t decide whether or not I like the choice for b/w. In purely image terms, I do but in terms of conveying smell, I am not so sure.</td>', 'Fantastic use of low DOF. Would love to see this in colour, as can''t decide whether or not I like the choice for b/w. In purely image terms, I do but in terms of conveying smell, I am not so sure.', '2003-11-27 09:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(496766, 47926, 3087, '<td valign="top">Interesting. <br/>I''d recommend looking at this image (//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=24140) for an idea of how lighting can improve the sense of warmth of the image. Also, the cigar actually touching the edge of the frame as it does seems a bit too harsh.</td>', 'Interesting. I''d recommend looking at this image (//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=24140) for an idea of how lighting can improve the sense of warmth of the image. Also, the cigar actually touching the edge of the frame as it does seems a bit too harsh.', '2003-11-27 09:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(496767, 48206, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice image, like how DOF choice throws background out of focus. Can smell the pine.</td>', 'Nice image, like how DOF choice throws background out of focus. Can smell the pine.', '2003-11-27 09:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(496768, 48628, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great use of high grain - was it deliberate? I like it, regardless.<br/>Love the tight crop - it''s often said one should include the subject''s eyes but this crop just works so well without them.</td>', 'Great use of high grain - was it deliberate? I like it, regardless.Love the tight crop - it''s often said one should include the subject''s eyes but this crop just works so well without them.', '2003-11-27 09:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
