(496902, 47875, 6667, '<td valign="top">Hey,  That looks like my wife''s dresser!!!!! Are you a collector? Wondering why you didn''t submit this in color.  I realize you were lookiing for the yesteryear look but I would imagine there was some beautiful color here.  Also, would have liked to have seen the top off of one bottle to suggest fragrance escaping.  Maybe the one at the left laid across the top of the bottle.  Just my opinion though. best of luck.</td>', 'Hey,  That looks like my wife''s dresser!!!!! Are you a collector? Wondering why you didn''t submit this in color.  I realize you were lookiing for the yesteryear look but I would imagine there was some beautiful color here.  Also, would have liked to have seen the top off of one bottle to suggest fragrance escaping.  Maybe the one at the left laid across the top of the bottle.  Just my opinion though. best of luck.', '2003-11-27 12:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
