(496912, 48585, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great idea and gorgeously lit. Amazed how you got the mist so perfectly with everything tack sharp. Only improvement I could think of would be to shift the light or model slightly such that the white outinle on her face continued down the neck. 9</td>', 'Great idea and gorgeously lit. Amazed how you got the mist so perfectly with everything tack sharp. Only improvement I could think of would be to shift the light or model slightly such that the white outinle on her face continued down the neck. 9', '2003-11-27 13:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(496914, 48169, 6667, '<td valign="top">While I found most shots with flowers and smoking scents to be just ordinary shots, yours was the exception to the rule.  The combination of subjects and the composition, along with the colors set yours apart.  You got a higher mark from me.  Best of luck.</td>', 'While I found most shots with flowers and smoking scents to be just ordinary shots, yours was the exception to the rule.  The combination of subjects and the composition, along with the colors set yours apart.  You got a higher mark from me.  Best of luck.', '2003-11-27 13:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
