(496918, 48462, 6667, '<td valign="top">This picture, while super, does not convey the message of the title. In my humble opinion, it would have been enhanced greatly if a title was included right in the picture which could be read.  For example: a cod liver oil label.</td>', 'This picture, while super, does not convey the message of the title. In my humble opinion, it would have been enhanced greatly if a title was included right in the picture which could be read.  For example: a cod liver oil label.', '2003-11-27 13:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
