(496920, 48214, 6667, '<td valign="top">While this was without a doubt one of the most fantastic pictures in this challenge, I could not rate it at its highest. . . simply because I could not make  a quick connection to the theme of the challenge.  I am sure there are scents and aromas that are here, but in my estimation too many. But then again, that is just me.  Best of luck</td>', 'While this was without a doubt one of the most fantastic pictures in this challenge, I could not rate it at its highest. . . simply because I could not make  a quick connection to the theme of the challenge.  I am sure there are scents and aromas that are here, but in my estimation too many. But then again, that is just me.  Best of luck', '2003-11-27 13:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(496922, 48597, 6667, '<td valign="top">I wanted so much to rate this even higher than what I did.  The clarity of the shot is great. But my mind kept saying there was something missing. . . LIVER!!!!  I know everytime I order liver and onions I see eyes roll and noses go up! At any rate, best of luck.</td>', 'I wanted so much to rate this even higher than what I did.  The clarity of the shot is great. But my mind kept saying there was something missing. . . LIVER!!!!  I know everytime I order liver and onions I see eyes roll and noses go up! At any rate, best of luck.', '2003-11-27 13:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(496924, 48643, 6667, '<td valign="top">I thought this was a very common, but at the same time unique, interpretation of the challenge.  Common in that almost everyone has experienced this smell. I wish that the hand (your hand? If so a model might have helped) came more out of the left and did not take up so much of the subject.  Also, it is under exposed somewhat and a little too grainnie. I realize I have made several criticisms but they are are offered in the most constructive of spirit.   Best of luck.</td>', 'I thought this was a very common, but at the same time unique, interpretation of the challenge.  Common in that almost everyone has experienced this smell. I wish that the hand (your hand? If so a model might have helped) came more out of the left and did not take up so much of the subject.  Also, it is under exposed somewhat and a little too grainnie. I realize I have made several criticisms but they are are offered in the most constructive of spirit.   Best of luck.', '2003-11-27 13:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(496925, 48032, 6667, '<td valign="top">This is one heck of a shot and a great interpretation of the challenge. A couple of things kept it from getting my highest mark.  Focus from front to back needs to be consistent.  It looks like it may have been over sharpened. The rim on the coffee cup and saucer are ragged (on my screen).  You evoked a sencse of smell in my nose immediately.  Steam riseing from the food would have tweaked an aditional sense of aroma.  You still got good marks from me. Is that scene off your deck?  Best of luck.</td>', 'This is one heck of a shot and a great interpretation of the challenge. A couple of things kept it from getting my highest mark.  Focus from front to back needs to be consistent.  It looks like it may have been over sharpened. The rim on the coffee cup and saucer are ragged (on my screen).  You evoked a sencse of smell in my nose immediately.  Steam riseing from the food would have tweaked an aditional sense of aroma.  You still got good marks from me. Is that scene off your deck?  Best of luck.', '2003-11-27 13:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(496926, 48175, 6667, '<td valign="top">You not only tweaked my sense of smell but taste as well. Best of luck.</td>', 'You not only tweaked my sense of smell but taste as well. Best of luck.', '2003-11-27 13:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
