(496954, 48030, 13937, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting with just a hint of the smoke rising fron the pipe.  Rethink this one with a verticle compostion and a slight tilt to the camera.  It seems a little static.</td>', 'Nice lighting with just a hint of the smoke rising fron the pipe.  Rethink this one with a verticle compostion and a slight tilt to the camera.  It seems a little static.', '2003-11-27 15:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(496955, 48642, 13937, '<td valign="top">Great idea, nicely lit and well executed.  I would have liked this better in color.  It would bring out the composition better, highlighting your diagonals and (probably) showing that the socks had been worn.</td>', 'Great idea, nicely lit and well executed.  I would have liked this better in color.  It would bring out the composition better, highlighting your diagonals and (probably) showing that the socks had been worn.', '2003-11-27 15:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(496959, 48628, 13937, '<td valign="top">I like this image.  The reflection in the lid really makes it work.  Very nice lighting.  The highlight in tha beckground tends to be a little distracting, though.</td>', 'I like this image.  The reflection in the lid really makes it work.  Very nice lighting.  The highlight in tha beckground tends to be a little distracting, though.', '2003-11-27 15:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(496961, 48566, 13937, '<td valign="top">Difficult at best to light.  I keep coming back to this one because it made me laugh.</td>', 'Difficult at best to light.  I keep coming back to this one because it made me laugh.', '2003-11-27 15:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(496963, 48514, 13937, '<td valign="top">This is nice, but I would like to see more harmony with the background.</td>', 'This is nice, but I would like to see more harmony with the background.', '2003-11-27 15:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(496967, 47982, 11467, '<td valign="top">Love the colours &amp; composition<br/>Looks very professional</td>', 'Love the colours & compositionLooks very professional', '2003-11-27 15:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(496968, 48550, 11467, '<td valign="top">Love how you managed to catch the steam from the coffee. How did you do that?? Hope it is in your photo description so I can read it when the challenge is closed.</td>', 'Love how you managed to catch the steam from the coffee. How did you do that?? Hope it is in your photo description so I can read it when the challenge is closed.', '2003-11-27 15:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(496969, 47927, 11467, '<td valign="top">Beautifull. I also like the frame</td>', 'Beautifull. I also like the frame', '2003-11-27 15:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(496971, 48585, 11467, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites. I like the atmosphere the picture portrays. Very sensual!</td>', 'One of my favourites. I like the atmosphere the picture portrays. Very sensual!', '2003-11-27 15:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(496972, 48526, 11467, '<td valign="top">I saw this &amp; it immediately brought the smell to mind. Nice.</td>', 'I saw this & it immediately brought the smell to mind. Nice.', '2003-11-27 15:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
