(497050, 48093, 11769, '<td valign="top">What are you feeding that dog. And he does not look to impressed, sorta like how I feel. Funny. :)    I realy like that dogs expression.:) I cant stop laughing...<br/>Your score just went up. The heck with it. Im giving you a 10.<br/>That poor doggy.</td>', 'What are you feeding that dog. And he does not look to impressed, sorta like how I feel. Funny. :)    I realy like that dogs expression.:) I cant stop laughing...Your score just went up. The heck with it. Im giving you a 10.That poor doggy.', '2003-11-27 18:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
