(497112, 47980, 10625, '<td valign="top">i''m sure this has been said to you already but increase the size of your pic to 640 by 480 or as close as you can.  then we can see it better</td>', 'i''m sure this has been said to you already but increase the size of your pic to 640 by 480 or as close as you can.  then we can see it better', '2003-11-27 20:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(497114, 48641, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like this. I can hear him sniffing out the trail. Oh wow. I can see the little phesant. Hope he didn''t kill him. Or you didn''t.  Too bad about the pixelation and artifacts.</td>', 'I like this. I can hear him sniffing out the trail. Oh wow. I can see the little phesant. Hope he didn''t kill him. Or you didn''t.  Too bad about the pixelation and artifacts.', '2003-11-27 20:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(497117, 48585, 10625, '<td valign="top">great use of light on your subject. the outline of the chin, lips and nose, provides that feminine element needed for this picture.  i''m sure it took several attempts to get your final choice.  well done, good luck. 10</td>', 'great use of light on your subject. the outline of the chin, lips and nose, provides that feminine element needed for this picture.  i''m sure it took several attempts to get your final choice.  well done, good luck. 10', '2003-11-27 20:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(497125, 48406, 11800, '<td valign="top">Coffee. If you buy a piece of plexi glass you can get the same type of reflections without the doubles.  The multiple reflections created by the mirror(?), cause this picture to "seem" to be out of focus.  I can see that it isn''t actually out of focus. You only have 5 seconds for someone to yes or no to your picture. Why make it easy for them to say no? Anyway, that''s my opinion.</td>', 'Coffee. If you buy a piece of plexi glass you can get the same type of reflections without the doubles.  The multiple reflections created by the mirror(?), cause this picture to "seem" to be out of focus.  I can see that it isn''t actually out of focus. You only have 5 seconds for someone to yes or no to your picture. Why make it easy for them to say no? Anyway, that''s my opinion.', '2003-11-27 20:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(497130, 48407, 11800, '<td valign="top">The colors are nice and strong. And you have made me experience the smell of pine. It makes me nervous because the pine looks like it''s right over the candle and, well, have you ever had a relative lose their house because the Christmas tree caught on fire?</td>', 'The colors are nice and strong. And you have made me experience the smell of pine. It makes me nervous because the pine looks like it''s right over the candle and, well, have you ever had a relative lose their house because the Christmas tree caught on fire?', '2003-11-27 20:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(497131, 48663, 11800, '<td valign="top">A flash at night? It looks good to me although it would would look better if the two buds beside the open flower were more visable. At least the light wasn''t harsh.</td>', 'A flash at night? It looks good to me although it would would look better if the two buds beside the open flower were more visable. At least the light wasn''t harsh.', '2003-11-27 20:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(497133, 48440, 11241, '<td valign="top">Hehe could have fooled me....</td>', 'Hehe could have fooled me....', '2003-11-27 20:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(497134, 47980, 11241, '<td valign="top">bit on the small side, I size my images 640 x 480 most of the time, that way you can see more detail.  Very smelly products...hehe</td>', 'bit on the small side, I size my images 640 x 480 most of the time, that way you can see more detail.  Very smelly products...hehe', '2003-11-27 20:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(497135, 48175, 11800, '<td valign="top">Nice. Did you use sunlight and incandascent lights? I think I would like it better without the blue overcast. You could maybe correct it by adjusting your color balance in your editing program and desaturating the blue and cyan channels a bit.</td>', 'Nice. Did you use sunlight and incandascent lights? I think I would like it better without the blue overcast. You could maybe correct it by adjusting your color balance in your editing program and desaturating the blue and cyan channels a bit.', '2003-11-27 20:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(497136, 48591, 11800, '<td valign="top">Nice. A bit overused lately but a decent representative picture.</td>', 'Nice. A bit overused lately but a decent representative picture.', '2003-11-27 20:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(497139, 48256, 3295, '<td valign="top">very nice.  I think it would have had more impact had the background been white, and colors punchier... but very nice.</td>', 'very nice.  I think it would have had more impact had the background been white, and colors punchier... but very nice.', '2003-11-27 20:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(497140, 48469, 11800, '<td valign="top">Cool wolf. The scene is too generic too illicit a feeling of smelling pines. Sorry.</td>', 'Cool wolf. The scene is too generic too illicit a feeling of smelling pines. Sorry.', '2003-11-27 20:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(497142, 48536, 3295, '<td valign="top">Looks washed out, Its interesting that he''s out of focus and the flowers are in focus - was this planned?</td>', 'Looks washed out, Its interesting that he''s out of focus and the flowers are in focus - was this planned?', '2003-11-27 20:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(497143, 47869, 6597, '<td valign="top">Good color, I like the arrangement 10</td>', 'Good color, I like the arrangement 10', '2003-11-27 20:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(497144, 48466, 3295, '<td valign="top">Nice cup and background, but wheres the Java??  This is a coffee mug shot, not an aroma of coffee shot.  Should have angled higher, focusing on coffe, and perhaps have that wiff of steam rising.</td>', 'Nice cup and background, but wheres the Java??  This is a coffee mug shot, not an aroma of coffee shot.  Should have angled higher, focusing on coffe, and perhaps have that wiff of steam rising.', '2003-11-27 20:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(497147, 48600, 3295, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I think more contrast, and low side lighting would have helped, as would having the backdrop further back, and a sheet or something in front of the camera to block all those reflection in the pot.  Nice arrangement.</td>', 'Nice shot, I think more contrast, and low side lighting would have helped, as would having the backdrop further back, and a sheet or something in front of the camera to block all those reflection in the pot.  Nice arrangement.', '2003-11-27 20:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(497148, 48440, 3295, '<td valign="top">what is it?  Nice detail caught, not clear what th rest is a tube or glass?  Certainly looks like it would smell though - some kind of weed?  Nice lighting.</td>', 'what is it?  Nice detail caught, not clear what th rest is a tube or glass?  Certainly looks like it would smell though - some kind of weed?  Nice lighting.', '2003-11-27 20:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(497151, 48628, 3295, '<td valign="top">I HATE GRAIN.  Usually but I quite like it here.  In fact I think I like everying in this photo.</td>', 'I HATE GRAIN.  Usually but I quite like it here.  In fact I think I like everying in this photo.', '2003-11-27 20:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(497154, 48032, 3295, '<td valign="top">YUCK!!!  The meat that is (as a vegitarian).  But a lovely breakfast shot, I think the shot would rank higher had there been a larger focus on one aspect of smell though. We''re simple people, give me one message. The white spoon on right of the plate is distacting.</td>', 'YUCK!!!  The meat that is (as a vegitarian).  But a lovely breakfast shot, I think the shot would rank higher had there been a larger focus on one aspect of smell though. We''re simple people, give me one message. The white spoon on right of the plate is distacting.', '2003-11-27 21:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
