(497198, 48206, 11800, '<td valign="top">The shades of green make this a very easy photograph to look at. Lovely. It can also be called the smell of spring. Very pleasing. I don''t know about the cones being full centered. Maybe a slight clockwise tilt of the camera to make the stem more diagonal and placing the cones on the lower 1/3 intersection?</td>', 'The shades of green make this a very easy photograph to look at. Lovely. It can also be called the smell of spring. Very pleasing. I don''t know about the cones being full centered. Maybe a slight clockwise tilt of the camera to make the stem more diagonal and placing the cones on the lower 1/3 intersection?', '2003-11-27 21:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
