(497266, 47976, 14522, '<td valign="top">Good image. The soft focus in the foreground leads in well without being over powering (which it may have been if in sharp focus) The centre of interest is in a strong position and the the back ground is soft again. Not overly sure on whether it evokes the olfactory senses for me though.</td>', 'Good image. The soft focus in the foreground leads in well without being over powering (which it may have been if in sharp focus) The centre of interest is in a strong position and the the back ground is soft again. Not overly sure on whether it evokes the olfactory senses for me though.', '2003-11-28 00:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(497267, 47765, 14522, '<td valign="top">Nice dog</td>', 'Nice dog', '2003-11-28 00:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(497269, 48123, 14522, '<td valign="top">Pee Yeew! You caught odour, stink, pong, smell, really well. Topic is scents and aromas which, to my understanding of the subtleties of English are pleasant. Not too much special in the image but I liked your title.</td>', 'Pee Yeew! You caught odour, stink, pong, smell, really well. Topic is scents and aromas which, to my understanding of the subtleties of English are pleasant. Not too much special in the image but I liked your title.', '2003-11-28 00:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(497270, 47985, 14522, '<td valign="top">It is difficult to not have a reason for perfect control when doing still life - not that I am saying it is easy. Far from it as this image shows. I think the lighting could be improved and I cannot say that the composition/positioning works for me.</td>', 'It is difficult to not have a reason for perfect control when doing still life - not that I am saying it is easy. Far from it as this image shows. I think the lighting could be improved and I cannot say that the composition/positioning works for me.', '2003-11-28 00:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(497271, 48525, 14522, '<td valign="top">Difficult to comment. I do pick up on the whole smell of the sea thing and I do think that you were going for some sort of mood and perhaps a bit of the sea spray action. Perhaps that''s where the photograph is - the right half of the picture?</td>', 'Difficult to comment. I do pick up on the whole smell of the sea thing and I do think that you were going for some sort of mood and perhaps a bit of the sea spray action. Perhaps that''s where the photograph is - the right half of the picture?', '2003-11-28 00:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(497272, 48175, 14522, '<td valign="top">Good try. There are some strange white marks in the lower left corner. Some of the cloves have lost out from your light source.</td>', 'Good try. There are some strange white marks in the lower left corner. Some of the cloves have lost out from your light source.', '2003-11-28 00:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(497273, 48241, 14522, '<td valign="top">The reflection of the flash in the faucet and the distracting refelction in the mirror behind bring this down.</td>', 'The reflection of the flash in the faucet and the distracting refelction in the mirror behind bring this down.', '2003-11-28 00:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(497274, 48407, 14522, '<td valign="top">I like this. Could you do it again with a bright red candle? I think the paler one has been burnt out a little.</td>', 'I like this. Could you do it again with a bright red candle? I think the paler one has been burnt out a little.', '2003-11-28 00:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(497278, 48153, 14522, '<td valign="top">DOF lets this image down. Personnally, I find the extension of the incense hold beyond the frame line a bit distracting. It could have been strong if you had created a balck base. Same hold true for the smoke.</td>', 'DOF lets this image down. Personnally, I find the extension of the incense hold beyond the frame line a bit distracting. It could have been strong if you had created a balck base. Same hold true for the smoke.', '2003-11-28 01:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(497279, 48440, 14522, '<td valign="top">Don''t get it. Focus is soft and the flash hot spot is distracting.</td>', 'Don''t get it. Focus is soft and the flash hot spot is distracting.', '2003-11-28 01:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(497280, 48472, 14522, '<td valign="top">I would suggest either more space to the right or closer cropping from the left. You have captured the delicacy in the bottle fairly well but I don''t think that the subject is strong enough, or easily identifiable enough, to convey the topic.</td>', 'I would suggest either more space to the right or closer cropping from the left. You have captured the delicacy in the bottle fairly well but I don''t think that the subject is strong enough, or easily identifiable enough, to convey the topic.', '2003-11-28 01:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(497281, 48611, 12902, '<td valign="top">Very well done. This one is worthed to stay on a magazine cover. I love the soft focus and the warm lighting. I wish I knew what is that white environement. It looks like feathers and like veil. A little bit of both, maybe? 10 from me. I am sure will do good.</td>', 'Very well done. This one is worthed to stay on a magazine cover. I love the soft focus and the warm lighting. I wish I knew what is that white environement. It looks like feathers and like veil. A little bit of both, maybe? 10 from me. I am sure will do good.', '2003-11-28 01:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(497283, 48460, 14522, '<td valign="top">Maybe you should have used "Oh the toilet" and hoped for a phonetic pun. As it is I fail to link the topic and the image.</td>', 'Maybe you should have used "Oh the toilet" and hoped for a phonetic pun. As it is I fail to link the topic and the image.', '2003-11-28 01:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(497285, 48169, 12902, '<td valign="top">Wonderful. It looks like an old painting to me. I love the composition and the colours. The smoke add mistery and character to the whole. Good light. It almost looks like you painted it with light. It just give me a nice feeling. 10</td>', 'Wonderful. It looks like an old painting to me. I love the composition and the colours. The smoke add mistery and character to the whole. Good light. It almost looks like you painted it with light. It just give me a nice feeling. 10', '2003-11-28 01:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(497286, 48315, 14522, '<td valign="top">Nice one. Just a pity that there is a slight DOF problem. I guess that most digital cameras suffer from this due to design.</td>', 'Nice one. Just a pity that there is a slight DOF problem. I guess that most digital cameras suffer from this due to design.', '2003-11-28 01:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(497288, 48646, 14522, '<td valign="top">It feels unbalanced to me. The purple liquid gives it a strong base but there isn''t enough contrast between the top of the bottle and the background. The shadows caused by the surface against the background are uneven and also pull the view to the bottom right corner.</td>', 'It feels unbalanced to me. The purple liquid gives it a strong base but there isn''t enough contrast between the top of the bottle and the background. The shadows caused by the surface against the background are uneven and also pull the view to the bottom right corner.', '2003-11-28 01:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(497290, 48462, 14522, '<td valign="top">Pity about the hot spot at the tip of the spoon. The soft focus on the medicine bottle make for a strong interest in the subject.</td>', 'Pity about the hot spot at the tip of the spoon. The soft focus on the medicine bottle make for a strong interest in the subject.', '2003-11-28 01:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(497291, 48659, 14522, '<td valign="top">Pretty good composition. Enough going on to tell a story without the need for detail and a clean unobstructed view. Just don''t see this as fitting in with the topic as I am sure none of the smells from this facility are pleasant.</td>', 'Pretty good composition. Enough going on to tell a story without the need for detail and a clean unobstructed view. Just don''t see this as fitting in with the topic as I am sure none of the smells from this facility are pleasant.', '2003-11-28 01:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(497294, 48628, 14522, '<td valign="top">Good attempt. Perhaps a bit more reflected light could have assisted. The little lens flare is distracting though.</td>', 'Good attempt. Perhaps a bit more reflected light could have assisted. The little lens flare is distracting though.', '2003-11-28 01:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(497295, 47869, 14522, '<td valign="top">A bit more light and you''d have a good christmas card picture. Not sure if I get the scents and aromas coming through.</td>', 'A bit more light and you''d have a good christmas card picture. Not sure if I get the scents and aromas coming through.', '2003-11-28 01:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(497296, 48451, 14522, '<td valign="top">Really good set up except the knife and fork the wrong war around. More detail in the cut onion would have been ideal.</td>', 'Really good set up except the knife and fork the wrong war around. More detail in the cut onion would have been ideal.', '2003-11-28 01:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(497297, 48655, 14522, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. I little too much glare coming off the leaf though.</td>', 'Nice composition. I little too much glare coming off the leaf though.', '2003-11-28 01:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(497298, 48502, 14522, '<td valign="top">Pretty good. Funny how burning sulphur can be aromatic.</td>', 'Pretty good. Funny how burning sulphur can be aromatic.', '2003-11-28 01:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(497300, 48380, 14522, '<td valign="top">Poor exposure and focus. Composition needs work and the doily has got to go.</td>', 'Poor exposure and focus. Composition needs work and the doily has got to go.', '2003-11-28 01:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(497310, 48154, 11800, '<td valign="top">Really masterful use of dof. The colors are inviting as is the composition and lighting. There''s something about the cinnamon that doesn''t look right. The shadows? The height? Maybe if they were laying down they would look better. I don''t usually notice the borders, but this one I did and I think, in my opinion, it detracts.</td>', 'Really masterful use of dof. The colors are inviting as is the composition and lighting. There''s something about the cinnamon that doesn''t look right. The shadows? The height? Maybe if they were laying down they would look better. I don''t usually notice the borders, but this one I did and I think, in my opinion, it detracts.', '2003-11-28 02:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(497311, 48020, 14522, '<td valign="top">Different. Perhaps a bit too much graphic design rather than traditional photograph but well seen and put together.</td>', 'Different. Perhaps a bit too much graphic design rather than traditional photograph but well seen and put together.', '2003-11-28 02:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(497312, 48162, 14522, '<td valign="top">Torn between trying to decide if the DOF limitation matter or not. I do like it and maybe am trying too hard to say something more.</td>', 'Torn between trying to decide if the DOF limitation matter or not. I do like it and maybe am trying too hard to say something more.', '2003-11-28 02:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(497314, 48641, 14522, '<td valign="top">Works well for the topic. Pity that the iamge is just too busy.</td>', 'Works well for the topic. Pity that the iamge is just too busy.', '2003-11-28 02:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(497315, 48461, 14522, '<td valign="top">I think that you could have done so much by incorporating the product name into the image.</td>', 'I think that you could have done so much by incorporating the product name into the image.', '2003-11-28 02:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(497316, 48545, 14522, '<td valign="top">Clever idea</td>', 'Clever idea', '2003-11-28 02:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(497317, 48642, 14522, '<td valign="top">Sure - evokes the sense of smell but as an odour, not an aroma. Pretty fair tonal range.</td>', 'Sure - evokes the sense of smell but as an odour, not an aroma. Pretty fair tonal range.', '2003-11-28 02:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(497319, 48371, 14522, '<td valign="top">No</td>', 'No', '2003-11-28 03:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(497321, 48578, 5822, '<td valign="top">Good concept that could have been carried out better. Lighting is too harsh and exposure seems off as you''ve lost detail in the hand and shoulder. I also find a lack of coherence between the graininess of the image and the refined and delicate features of the woman. More light shed on the glass applicator and maybe doing away with the shadow in the background would have improved the picture IMO. I''m a bit undecided about the blue-green-grey cast but do think it adds a feeling of sensuality</td>', 'Good concept that could have been carried out better. Lighting is too harsh and exposure seems off as you''ve lost detail in the hand and shoulder. I also find a lack of coherence between the graininess of the image and the refined and delicate features of the woman. More light shed on the glass applicator and maybe doing away with the shadow in the background would have improved the picture IMO. I''m a bit undecided about the blue-green-grey cast but do think it adds a feeling of sensuality', '2003-11-28 03:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(497322, 48554, 14522, '<td valign="top">DOF issue really lets down a wonderful opportunity. There is good texture in the coffee.</td>', 'DOF issue really lets down a wonderful opportunity. There is good texture in the coffee.', '2003-11-28 03:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(497326, 48093, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the humor in this photo but find the exposure lacking in that you have blown out highlights as well as lost detail in the shadows. Lighting is way too harsh and I wish that the bacon strip was also in focus.</td>', 'I like the humor in this photo but find the exposure lacking in that you have blown out highlights as well as lost detail in the shadows. Lighting is way too harsh and I wish that the bacon strip was also in focus.', '2003-11-28 03:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(497329, 48588, 14522, '<td valign="top">Good. Just watch out for the shadows.</td>', 'Good. Just watch out for the shadows.', '2003-11-28 03:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(497332, 48032, 14522, '<td valign="top">I think your eggs have just the right amount of runiness for me. Not too keen on tomato.</td>', 'I think your eggs have just the right amount of runiness for me. Not too keen on tomato.', '2003-11-28 03:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(497333, 48569, 5822, '<td valign="top">I love your use of negative space here. Very creative composition. Just wish the colors were more saturated and it would have been nice to see a vapor trail rising from the hot coco. As it is now, the image leaves me a bit cold.</td>', 'I love your use of negative space here. Very creative composition. Just wish the colors were more saturated and it would have been nice to see a vapor trail rising from the hot coco. As it is now, the image leaves me a bit cold.', '2003-11-28 03:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(497334, 48577, 14522, '<td valign="top">Clever. Good composition and well exposed</td>', 'Clever. Good composition and well exposed', '2003-11-28 03:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(497336, 48609, 14522, '<td valign="top">I know the main point of interest is the clove but the soft focus on the foreground part is disturbing. Good detail and exposure.</td>', 'I know the main point of interest is the clove but the soft focus on the foreground part is disturbing. Good detail and exposure.', '2003-11-28 03:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(497338, 48598, 14522, '<td valign="top">Pretty good. Perhaps a bit sharper focus on the white bits.</td>', 'Pretty good. Perhaps a bit sharper focus on the white bits.', '2003-11-28 03:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(497341, 48626, 14522, '<td valign="top">Awesome apart from the lamp infringing from the left.</td>', 'Awesome apart from the lamp infringing from the left.', '2003-11-28 03:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(497342, 48511, 14522, '<td valign="top">Good image.</td>', 'Good image.', '2003-11-28 03:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(497343, 48591, 14522, '<td valign="top">Not enough for me.</td>', 'Not enough for me.', '2003-11-28 03:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(497344, 47987, 14522, '<td valign="top">Yum. But that''s it.</td>', 'Yum. But that''s it.', '2003-11-28 03:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(497345, 48635, 14522, '<td valign="top">Not quite crisp enough. Could possibly do with some reflected light from the front.</td>', 'Not quite crisp enough. Could possibly do with some reflected light from the front.', '2003-11-28 03:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(497346, 47936, 14522, '<td valign="top">Composition lets it down. Sometimes less is more and you seems to have tried more.</td>', 'Composition lets it down. Sometimes less is more and you seems to have tried more.', '2003-11-28 03:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(497347, 47752, 14522, '<td valign="top">Good. Nice red saturation. Nice horizontal line on a third. Could be a fraction sharper.</td>', 'Good. Nice red saturation. Nice horizontal line on a third. Could be a fraction sharper.', '2003-11-28 03:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(497349, 48214, 14522, '<td valign="top">Pretty scene but strong line bisects in the middle. Not sure how you tie into the tpoic for the challenge but I don''t make the connection.</td>', 'Pretty scene but strong line bisects in the middle. Not sure how you tie into the tpoic for the challenge but I don''t make the connection.', '2003-11-28 03:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(497350, 48620, 14522, '<td valign="top">From the number of images that I have looked at for this challenge specifically I am coming to the conclusion that physical limitation of the equipment being used accounts for the DOF problems and this image is no exception. If there is a limit in the camera, surely the author ought to be aware and work to those limitations.</td>', 'From the number of images that I have looked at for this challenge specifically I am coming to the conclusion that physical limitation of the equipment being used accounts for the DOF problems and this image is no exception. If there is a limit in the camera, surely the author ought to be aware and work to those limitations.', '2003-11-28 03:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(497351, 48299, 14522, '<td valign="top">Well handled, good exposure.</td>', 'Well handled, good exposure.', '2003-11-28 03:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(497352, 48617, 14522, '<td valign="top">Exposure and lack of punctum are problems. Dogs and feet smell so I don''t know how this fits in with scent and aroma.</td>', 'Exposure and lack of punctum are problems. Dogs and feet smell so I don''t know how this fits in with scent and aroma.', '2003-11-28 03:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(497353, 48168, 14522, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t fit in the topic for me. I''d further venture that saturation and focus have been compromised.</td>', 'Doesn''t fit in the topic for me. I''d further venture that saturation and focus have been compromised.', '2003-11-28 03:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(497354, 48056, 14522, '<td valign="top">Good detail. Perhaps slightly, ever so slightly over lit.</td>', 'Good detail. Perhaps slightly, ever so slightly over lit.', '2003-11-28 04:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(497355, 47775, 14522, '<td valign="top">Too central</td>', 'Too central', '2003-11-28 04:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(497356, 48479, 14522, '<td valign="top">Sometimes a different POV makes for a good image. Sometimes.</td>', 'Sometimes a different POV makes for a good image. Sometimes.', '2003-11-28 04:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(497357, 48039, 14522, '<td valign="top">Lovely. A few slight distractions in the field of view that could have been cleared up though.</td>', 'Lovely. A few slight distractions in the field of view that could have been cleared up though.', '2003-11-28 04:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(497358, 48164, 14522, '<td valign="top">When photographing snow, or any other bright subject, your camera is fooled into thinking that things are brighter than they really are and it closes down the aperture. You need to compensate for this by a stop or two. On a digital camera you ought to be able set the white balance. Net result is you have an underexposed flower. Closer cropping of the left side would make for a stronger composition</td>', 'When photographing snow, or any other bright subject, your camera is fooled into thinking that things are brighter than they really are and it closes down the aperture. You need to compensate for this by a stop or two. On a digital camera you ought to be able set the white balance. Net result is you have an underexposed flower. Closer cropping of the left side would make for a stronger composition', '2003-11-28 04:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(497359, 48433, 14522, '<td valign="top">Very clever but your title does not tie in with the topic. Still I give your photographic skill the benefit over you naming skills.</td>', 'Very clever but your title does not tie in with the topic. Still I give your photographic skill the benefit over you naming skills.', '2003-11-28 04:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(497361, 48658, 14522, '<td valign="top">I suppose that some things should be kept out of reach of photogrpahers too. Sorry, it''s just too trite.</td>', 'I suppose that some things should be kept out of reach of photogrpahers too. Sorry, it''s just too trite.', '2003-11-28 04:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(497362, 48440, 7252, '<td valign="top">Personally, I think this could be much more powerful taken out of the container. Perhaps even closer so that we can really see the detail in the crystals and hairs.</td>', 'Personally, I think this could be much more powerful taken out of the container. Perhaps even closer so that we can really see the detail in the crystals and hairs.', '2003-11-28 04:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(497363, 48374, 7252, '<td valign="top">I know I should probably know what this is but I can''t identify it. Is this supposed to be mold? Barf? Without knowing what it is it is hard for me to say if it is really stinky.</td>', 'I know I should probably know what this is but I can''t identify it. Is this supposed to be mold? Barf? Without knowing what it is it is hard for me to say if it is really stinky.', '2003-11-28 04:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(497364, 48257, 14522, '<td valign="top">Great detail and texture. Love it.</td>', 'Great detail and texture. Love it.', '2003-11-28 04:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(497365, 48009, 7252, '<td valign="top">Would be nice to have a little smoke hanging in the air.</td>', 'Would be nice to have a little smoke hanging in the air.', '2003-11-28 04:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(497366, 47858, 14522, '<td valign="top">Slight over exposure on outer petals. Perhaps slightly soft.</td>', 'Slight over exposure on outer petals. Perhaps slightly soft.', '2003-11-28 04:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(497367, 47817, 14522, '<td valign="top">I''d consider cropping slightly on the left and the bottom to bring the core of the rose more to one of the golden intersections. Lovely though.</td>', 'I''d consider cropping slightly on the left and the bottom to bring the core of the rose more to one of the golden intersections. Lovely though.', '2003-11-28 04:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(497368, 48565, 14522, '<td valign="top">Good try. The DOF is an issue as too are the shadows caused by the light source.</td>', 'Good try. The DOF is an issue as too are the shadows caused by the light source.', '2003-11-28 04:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(497370, 48480, 7252, '<td valign="top">Taken a split second before and this would have been really cool.</td>', 'Taken a split second before and this would have been really cool.', '2003-11-28 04:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(497372, 48667, 7252, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured the one thing that truly disgusts me about working in an office. Why oh why do people eat so much of this stinky stuff.</td>', 'You''ve captured the one thing that truly disgusts me about working in an office. Why oh why do people eat so much of this stinky stuff.', '2003-11-28 04:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(497373, 48558, 14522, '<td valign="top">A glass with some liquid in it. Exposure and focus are fine but it is rather boring as presented. Without the title I have no means of relating to the aroma.</td>', 'A glass with some liquid in it. Exposure and focus are fine but it is rather boring as presented. Without the title I have no means of relating to the aroma.', '2003-11-28 04:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(497374, 48527, 14522, '<td valign="top">Just a record shot.</td>', 'Just a record shot.', '2003-11-28 04:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(497376, 48632, 14522, '<td valign="top">A little over cooked</td>', 'A little over cooked', '2003-11-28 04:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(497377, 47886, 14522, '<td valign="top">The soft focus on some parts does work well.</td>', 'The soft focus on some parts does work well.', '2003-11-28 04:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(497378, 48123, 7252, '<td valign="top">I applaud your efforts in finding something truly aromatic. I think this would work a little better if it seemed more "fresh". A little steam perhaps rising from its pungent folds or just a little less "baked" looking. The lighting seems a little harsh. A diffuser held over the ripple-back brown trout would even it out a bit and reduce some of the hot spots on the grass.</td>', 'I applaud your efforts in finding something truly aromatic. I think this would work a little better if it seemed more "fresh". A little steam perhaps rising from its pungent folds or just a little less "baked" looking. The lighting seems a little harsh. A diffuser held over the ripple-back brown trout would even it out a bit and reduce some of the hot spots on the grass.', '2003-11-28 04:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(497380, 48554, 7252, '<td valign="top">I feel a bit silly but... what is it? Dirt? Looks like dirt in a flower pot but the title confuses me.</td>', 'I feel a bit silly but... what is it? Dirt? Looks like dirt in a flower pot but the title confuses me.', '2003-11-28 04:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(497381, 48452, 14522, '<td valign="top">Pity the can is so busy because focus, composition and exposure have been handled well</td>', 'Pity the can is so busy because focus, composition and exposure have been handled well', '2003-11-28 04:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(497382, 48251, 14522, '<td valign="top">Perhaps too central and shot from too high an angle. Other than that pretty good.</td>', 'Perhaps too central and shot from too high an angle. Other than that pretty good.', '2003-11-28 04:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(497383, 48666, 7252, '<td valign="top">Really quite beautiful. Simple, clean, sharp, and perfectly lit. Very well done. 10</td>', 'Really quite beautiful. Simple, clean, sharp, and perfectly lit. Very well done. 10', '2003-11-28 04:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(497384, 48362, 14522, '<td valign="top">Not getting the tie in with the topic</td>', 'Not getting the tie in with the topic', '2003-11-28 04:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(497385, 48351, 14522, '<td valign="top">This one raises the issue of ethics. To me, and of course there is always doubt, this is a shot of a perfume display in a mall. Ethically, this is someone else''s art (the display) of which you have taken a picture.</td>', 'This one raises the issue of ethics. To me, and of course there is always doubt, this is a shot of a perfume display in a mall. Ethically, this is someone else''s art (the display) of which you have taken a picture.', '2003-11-28 04:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(497386, 48610, 14522, '<td valign="top">Focus and exposure let this down. Stink has to do with odour, not aroma.</td>', 'Focus and exposure let this down. Stink has to do with odour, not aroma.', '2003-11-28 04:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(497387, 48552, 7252, '<td valign="top">I''ll never forget the smell of kooties.</td>', 'I''ll never forget the smell of kooties.', '2003-11-28 04:56:03.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(497389, 48589, 14522, '<td valign="top">Without the smoke there is no smell. Just doesn''t convey the topic</td>', 'Without the smoke there is no smell. Just doesn''t convey the topic', '2003-11-28 05:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(497391, 47967, 14522, '<td valign="top">Nice and soft</td>', 'Nice and soft', '2003-11-28 05:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(497392, 48668, 14522, '<td valign="top">At least you''re seeing things</td>', 'At least you''re seeing things', '2003-11-28 05:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(497393, 48009, 14522, '<td valign="top">Good attempt at trying to capture the topic. I think the border and drop shadow hasn''t quite worked and the figures in the background are distracting.</td>', 'Good attempt at trying to capture the topic. I think the border and drop shadow hasn''t quite worked and the figures in the background are distracting.', '2003-11-28 05:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(497394, 48422, 14522, '<td valign="top">Focus is a bit out and the flame of the one candle escapes the picture.</td>', 'Focus is a bit out and the flame of the one candle escapes the picture.', '2003-11-28 05:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(497395, 48566, 14522, '<td valign="top">You are correct!</td>', 'You are correct!', '2003-11-28 05:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(497396, 48643, 14522, '<td valign="top">I think that the parts in focus aren''t the subject. I wouldn''t consider this a scent or an aroma.</td>', 'I think that the parts in focus aren''t the subject. I wouldn''t consider this a scent or an aroma.', '2003-11-28 05:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(497397, 47912, 14522, '<td valign="top">Captures the intimacy really well</td>', 'Captures the intimacy really well', '2003-11-28 05:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(497398, 48273, 14522, '<td valign="top">Good crisp focus, nice detail.</td>', 'Good crisp focus, nice detail.', '2003-11-28 05:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(497399, 48431, 14522, '<td valign="top">Cropping needs to be applied, or you ought to have had more space to the left</td>', 'Cropping needs to be applied, or you ought to have had more space to the left', '2003-11-28 05:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(497401, 48430, 14522, '<td valign="top">I was sure that I had rated and commented already. I think it is handled well but do have a problem smelling. It could just be two bottles. Well done, but just two bottles.</td>', 'I was sure that I had rated and commented already. I think it is handled well but do have a problem smelling. It could just be two bottles. Well done, but just two bottles.', '2003-11-28 05:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(497402, 48575, 14522, '<td valign="top">A tighter crop and this would be a winner.</td>', 'A tighter crop and this would be a winner.', '2003-11-28 05:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(497406, 48553, 11248, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting. Great execution. - 9</td>', 'Very nice lighting. Great execution. - 9', '2003-11-28 06:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(497407, 48585, 11248, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and  lighting. Very well done. One of my preferred  in this challenge. - 9</td>', 'Very nice composition and  lighting. Very well done. One of my preferred  in this challenge. - 9', '2003-11-28 06:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(497408, 48593, 11248, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and very good execution. One of the best.</td>', 'Nice idea and very good execution. One of the best.', '2003-11-28 06:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(497409, 48593, 5534, '<td valign="top">Great detail on the cigarette and smoke. You can almost smell the smoke.</td>', 'Great detail on the cigarette and smoke. You can almost smell the smoke.', '2003-11-28 06:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(497410, 48554, 5534, '<td valign="top">I really like this. Nice colors and texture, but my only complaint is the minor out of focus right corner.</td>', 'I really like this. Nice colors and texture, but my only complaint is the minor out of focus right corner.', '2003-11-28 06:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(497411, 48662, 11248, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture. You have to get there to really appreciate the incredible smell of the fresh bread ... and the wonderful atmosphere of St-Sauver I think. Very well done.</td>', 'Very nice picture. You have to get there to really appreciate the incredible smell of the fresh bread ... and the wonderful atmosphere of St-Sauver I think. Very well done.', '2003-11-28 06:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(497412, 48037, 11248, '<td valign="top">Simple and well done. 8</td>', 'Simple and well done. 8', '2003-11-28 06:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(497413, 48169, 11248, '<td valign="top">Very nice compostion. I would prefer a real rose but anyway that''s a good work.</td>', 'Very nice compostion. I would prefer a real rose but anyway that''s a good work.', '2003-11-28 06:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(497414, 48550, 11248, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, very well executed. 8</td>', 'Nice idea, very well executed. 8', '2003-11-28 06:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(497415, 48567, 11248, '<td valign="top">Very good preparation and lighting. The only thing that bothers me is the reddish aspect of the coffee ... unless it''s my monitor ...</td>', 'Very good preparation and lighting. The only thing that bothers me is the reddish aspect of the coffee ... unless it''s my monitor ...', '2003-11-28 06:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(497416, 47982, 11248, '<td valign="top">Wow. Great work here. You''ll get to explain how you''ve done that.</td>', 'Wow. Great work here. You''ll get to explain how you''ve done that.', '2003-11-28 06:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(497417, 48237, 11248, '<td valign="top">Very sharp and clear. Great lighting. Nice work.</td>', 'Very sharp and clear. Great lighting. Nice work.', '2003-11-28 06:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(497423, 47926, 92, '<td valign="top">Not only is this a AWESOME photo ... with great use of negative space btw...but it fits this challenge PERFECTLY !  The lighting and that little bit of reflection on the bottom really makes this a GREAT photo. This would do well as a print.  Good luck != 10</td>', 'Not only is this a AWESOME photo ... with great use of negative space btw...but it fits this challenge PERFECTLY !  The lighting and that little bit of reflection on the bottom really makes this a GREAT photo. This would do well as a print.  Good luck != 10', '2003-11-28 07:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(497425, 48585, 92, '<td valign="top">Wonderful use of light. Wonderful photo for this challenge. The composition, lighting, use of b/w tone and the spray mist make this a winner !</td>', 'Wonderful use of light. Wonderful photo for this challenge. The composition, lighting, use of b/w tone and the spray mist make this a winner !', '2003-11-28 07:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(497426, 48553, 92, '<td valign="top">Beautiful abstract ! I lighting and composition are perfect !</td>', 'Beautiful abstract ! I lighting and composition are perfect !', '2003-11-28 07:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(497430, 48433, 92, '<td valign="top">I really have never liked candle photos. They are always some red/orange blown out flame shot. This is beautiful and well done. I love the mix of smoke and that all the candles aren''t lit. Nice soft white candles and not too much light. This is GREAT !</td>', 'I really have never liked candle photos. They are always some red/orange blown out flame shot. This is beautiful and well done. I love the mix of smoke and that all the candles aren''t lit. Nice soft white candles and not too much light. This is GREAT !', '2003-11-28 07:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(497434, 48562, 3295, '<td valign="top">nice composition and shadows.</td>', 'nice composition and shadows.', '2003-11-28 08:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(497435, 48558, 3295, '<td valign="top">Its dull.  Consider how the lighting could have added to the rich mood, and perhaps a different - richer backdrop. I like the angle you shot it from, its interesting.</td>', 'Its dull.  Consider how the lighting could have added to the rich mood, and perhaps a different - richer backdrop. I like the angle you shot it from, its interesting.', '2003-11-28 08:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(497436, 47980, 3295, '<td valign="top">try to add mood, and interest with lighting.</td>', 'try to add mood, and interest with lighting.', '2003-11-28 08:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(497437, 48626, 3295, '<td valign="top">hate the object intruding on the left, love the photograph, maybe a little darker would have added to the "old" feel.</td>', 'hate the object intruding on the left, love the photograph, maybe a little darker would have added to the "old" feel.', '2003-11-28 08:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(497439, 48527, 3295, '<td valign="top">turning it sepia doesn''t make a snap shot art.</td>', 'turning it sepia doesn''t make a snap shot art.', '2003-11-28 08:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(497441, 48153, 3295, '<td valign="top">really high iso??  Lots of noise in the black would have been better with out it.  Nice composition, weird color cast.</td>', 'really high iso??  Lots of noise in the black would have been better with out it.  Nice composition, weird color cast.', '2003-11-28 08:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
