(497452, 48164, 3724, '<td valign="top">Composition is very pleasing.  I like the way random intermittent objects poke through the snow field background.</td>', 'Composition is very pleasing.  I like the way random intermittent objects poke through the snow field background.', '2003-11-28 08:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(497455, 48578, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like the close up personal aspect. It is a good picture.<br/>My opinion: <br/>Don''t know about the color. Blue ; emotionally it is for sadness, coldness and depression. Maybe a warmer color would have worked better? I don''t know about the grain either. It could enhance the feeling of the scent being in the air. I don''t think I like it.</td>', 'I like the close up personal aspect. It is a good picture.My opinion: Don''t know about the color. Blue ; emotionally it is for sadness, coldness and depression. Maybe a warmer color would have worked better? I don''t know about the grain either. It could enhance the feeling of the scent being in the air. I don''t think I like it.', '2003-11-28 09:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(497456, 48642, 11800, '<td valign="top">Well taken. It''s not in your face grungy or offensive, exposed properly and the composition isn''t bad. Only thing that could be improved is the cut off socks. One sock is darker than the other, maybe a little more light over on the right.</td>', 'Well taken. It''s not in your face grungy or offensive, exposed properly and the composition isn''t bad. Only thing that could be improved is the cut off socks. One sock is darker than the other, maybe a little more light over on the right.', '2003-11-28 09:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(497458, 47980, 11800, '<td valign="top">Well. This one is getting a bit small. Hmmm. Might have been better if there was a more flowing arrangment with a different background. I would have liked to see the tops of the bottles also. Did you consider resizing it upwards? Try bicubic 10% each step. Or maybe dpi 72 per inch?</td>', 'Well. This one is getting a bit small. Hmmm. Might have been better if there was a more flowing arrangment with a different background. I would have liked to see the tops of the bottles also. Did you consider resizing it upwards? Try bicubic 10% each step. Or maybe dpi 72 per inch?', '2003-11-28 09:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(497461, 48576, 11800, '<td valign="top">Very well done. I like the toning. Sharp. This is the second border I''ve actually noticed this challenge.  I''m thinking it''s out of place because this looks like an ad and they are usually not framed.</td>', 'Very well done. I like the toning. Sharp. This is the second border I''ve actually noticed this challenge.  I''m thinking it''s out of place because this looks like an ad and they are usually not framed.', '2003-11-28 09:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(497464, 48628, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like it. This is one that I had to look at for a while to "get". But now it makes me smile. I don''t know if I like it this grainy but I like the lighting and composition. The reflection in the lid is a really nice touch. This is one of the best cooking images I''ve seen on this site or elsewhere. Now that I''ve stayed a while, I can say I really don''t like that much grain.</td>', 'I like it. This is one that I had to look at for a while to "get". But now it makes me smile. I don''t know if I like it this grainy but I like the lighting and composition. The reflection in the lid is a really nice touch. This is one of the best cooking images I''ve seen on this site or elsewhere. Now that I''ve stayed a while, I can say I really don''t like that much grain.', '2003-11-28 09:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(497486, 48567, 772, '<td valign="top">I love the composition and the colors on this one.  I think there may be a bit of room for improvement with the lighting...</td>', 'I love the composition and the colors on this one.  I think there may be a bit of room for improvement with the lighting...', '2003-11-28 10:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
