(497503, 48575, 12674, '<td valign="top">Great shot of a beautiful flower. I''m a little distracted by the water. Does that somehow enhance the smell? I think it would''ve worked well...and maybe better...without the water. But I like it.</td>', 'Great shot of a beautiful flower. I''m a little distracted by the water. Does that somehow enhance the smell? I think it would''ve worked well...and maybe better...without the water. But I like it.', '2003-11-28 11:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(497505, 48039, 12674, '<td valign="top">Great focus on the spikes, beautiful color, and nice blur to background...makes you want to smell the flower.</td>', 'Great focus on the spikes, beautiful color, and nice blur to background...makes you want to smell the flower.', '2003-11-28 11:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(497506, 48406, 12674, '<td valign="top">I can smell the coffee for sure....image could maybe be a bit brighter. The mirror works well for the tea but seems less effective for the coffee. Good idea.</td>', 'I can smell the coffee for sure....image could maybe be a bit brighter. The mirror works well for the tea but seems less effective for the coffee. Good idea.', '2003-11-28 11:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(497509, 48558, 327, '<td valign="top">This looks a bit more like coffee in the wine glass then wine to me. The head on shot here is okay but I think off center would of had more appeal. I think the grain, or background noise is a bit too much. In other words with glass I think the environment should of been pristine through out the shot. I will say that your idea is good, and you did the light well.</td>', 'This looks a bit more like coffee in the wine glass then wine to me. The head on shot here is okay but I think off center would of had more appeal. I think the grain, or background noise is a bit too much. In other words with glass I think the environment should of been pristine through out the shot. I will say that your idea is good, and you did the light well.', '2003-11-28 11:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(497510, 48612, 327, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what I''m looking at here. I''m guessing..these are rings of a lemon, orange? I don''t recognize this. It''s not an unattractive shot.</td>', 'I don''t know what I''m looking at here. I''m guessing..these are rings of a lemon, orange? I don''t recognize this. It''s not an unattractive shot.', '2003-11-28 11:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(497521, 48541, 14509, '<td valign="top">Don''t see the connection with scent and aromas. Otherwise a really nice shot in motion.</td>', 'Don''t see the connection with scent and aromas. Otherwise a really nice shot in motion.', '2003-11-28 12:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(497522, 48374, 14509, '<td valign="top">Title very appropriate.</td>', 'Title very appropriate.', '2003-11-28 12:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(497530, 48315, 13025, '<td valign="top">Nice feeling and relaxing set-up! :) M.</td>', 'Nice feeling and relaxing set-up! :) M.', '2003-11-28 12:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(497560, 48598, 4049, '<td valign="top">you should have left out the stuff on the right, and just left the silver thing and smoke.</td>', 'you should have left out the stuff on the right, and just left the silver thing and smoke.', '2003-11-28 13:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(497562, 48660, 4049, '<td valign="top">love how bright and colorful it is. Nice</td>', 'love how bright and colorful it is. Nice', '2003-11-28 13:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(497565, 48154, 4049, '<td valign="top">well lit</td>', 'well lit', '2003-11-28 13:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(497571, 48214, 7778, '<td valign="top">A gorgeous capture with almost -bleached- hues (the near-turquoise foregound and sky above horizon). Very good contrast, given the fog, particularly in the reflection. The horizontally centered composition, of course, aids the staticity of the landscape. A photographer more passionate about his art, would have blown up the slim tower visible near the centre of the image prior to taking this shot. ;-)</td>', 'A gorgeous capture with almost -bleached- hues (the near-turquoise foregound and sky above horizon). Very good contrast, given the fog, particularly in the reflection. The horizontally centered composition, of course, aids the staticity of the landscape. A photographer more passionate about his art, would have blown up the slim tower visible near the centre of the image prior to taking this shot. ;-)', '2003-11-28 13:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(497579, 48057, 4049, '<td valign="top">needs more lighting in the center</td>', 'needs more lighting in the center', '2003-11-28 14:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(497580, 47982, 4049, '<td valign="top">I like how you created the scent waves with light, good idea</td>', 'I like how you created the scent waves with light, good idea', '2003-11-28 14:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(497581, 48180, 7778, '<td valign="top">The shallow depth of field carries and makes this shot. The single protuding needle at the left of the image is an unfortunate distraction. The colour and hues are rendered extremely natural in an apt composition. Not a spectacular capture, but a satisfying one.</td>', 'The shallow depth of field carries and makes this shot. The single protuding needle at the left of the image is an unfortunate distraction. The colour and hues are rendered extremely natural in an apt composition. Not a spectacular capture, but a satisfying one.', '2003-11-28 14:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(497582, 48569, 4049, '<td valign="top">mmm, i love hot chocolate with marshmellows!</td>', 'mmm, i love hot chocolate with marshmellows!', '2003-11-28 14:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(497592, 48646, 14253, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. Seems a bit flat to me.</td>', 'Nice photo. Seems a bit flat to me.', '2003-11-28 14:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(497594, 47980, 14253, '<td valign="top">I might like it better with a different angle and a different background.</td>', 'I might like it better with a different angle and a different background.', '2003-11-28 14:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(497595, 48009, 7778, '<td valign="top">I quite like this b &amp; w, and do not mind the drop shadow border, although the overall size of the image may have been somewhat diminished by it. What I would have liked to see, is a little (or big) puff of smoke - not just for topicality, but to add a lil visual jazz and, hopefully, blur the background further than it is. The savory expression on the subjects face is credible. The choice of a woman smoking a cigar, also, is more interesting than the stereotype.</td>', 'I quite like this b & w, and do not mind the drop shadow border, although the overall size of the image may have been somewhat diminished by it. What I would have liked to see, is a little (or big) puff of smoke - not just for topicality, but to add a lil visual jazz and, hopefully, blur the background further than it is. The savory expression on the subjects face is credible. The choice of a woman smoking a cigar, also, is more interesting than the stereotype.', '2003-11-28 14:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(497600, 47764, 14253, '<td valign="top">Sharpest focus actually seems to be a bit in front of the rock. I don''t care for the background, but then, I''m not really sure I know what you are trying to say here.</td>', 'Sharpest focus actually seems to be a bit in front of the rock. I don''t care for the background, but then, I''m not really sure I know what you are trying to say here.', '2003-11-28 14:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
