(497683, 48663, 10260, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, beautiful, beautiful!  Clarity and color of the flower are perfect.  I like the light reflection in the greenery with the black background.  Striking photo.   My vote: 10</td>', 'Beautiful, beautiful, beautiful!  Clarity and color of the flower are perfect.  I like the light reflection in the greenery with the black background.  Striking photo.   My vote: 10', '2003-11-28 16:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(497686, 47851, 10260, '<td valign="top">memories of my dad too. :)</td>', 'memories of my dad too. :)', '2003-11-28 16:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(497694, 48093, 11800, '<td valign="top">Good idea that wasn''t done 100 times! If the bacon was a little lower or if it was more in focus, it would have been more fun. It looks like you maybe adjusted the brightness/contrast too much. You might want to try histogram adjustments or levels. They are not as harsh.</td>', 'Good idea that wasn''t done 100 times! If the bacon was a little lower or if it was more in focus, it would have been more fun. It looks like you maybe adjusted the brightness/contrast too much. You might want to try histogram adjustments or levels. They are not as harsh.', '2003-11-28 16:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(497697, 48460, 11800, '<td valign="top">I have to say this is the most unique one of the bunch. I''ve been putting it off because I don''t know what to say or think. It has an appeal, but it''s so unusual. I like the diagonal that the wall forms and the b/w treatment. I guess it''s good because it certainly causes one to stop and consider, but instead of thinking about the picture, I''m thinking about the photographer. And the word is why?</td>', 'I have to say this is the most unique one of the bunch. I''ve been putting it off because I don''t know what to say or think. It has an appeal, but it''s so unusual. I like the diagonal that the wall forms and the b/w treatment. I guess it''s good because it certainly causes one to stop and consider, but instead of thinking about the picture, I''m thinking about the photographer. And the word is why?', '2003-11-28 16:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(497701, 48609, 11800, '<td valign="top">What happened to your red channel? It''s well set up and I like the composition and lighting, but the red, in my opinion, lowers the quailty of the shot.</td>', 'What happened to your red channel? It''s well set up and I like the composition and lighting, but the red, in my opinion, lowers the quailty of the shot.', '2003-11-28 17:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(497703, 48626, 4008, '<td valign="top">A beautiful collection of objects, high class, nicely arranged. Suggesting a subtle smell of perfume on paper. Nice soft light as well.  I am not so sure about the desk lamp on the left, it adds depth but also is disturbing. I think I would have chosen an view more from the right, but then it might be difficult to include the full lenght of the feather.</td>', 'A beautiful collection of objects, high class, nicely arranged. Suggesting a subtle smell of perfume on paper. Nice soft light as well.  I am not so sure about the desk lamp on the left, it adds depth but also is disturbing. I think I would have chosen an view more from the right, but then it might be difficult to include the full lenght of the feather.', '2003-11-28 17:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(497705, 48565, 4008, '<td valign="top">Lovely color, composition and clarity. Also I like the color in the shadows. Gorgeous image. To me it expresses more aroma in the sense of flavour, not so much scent.</td>', 'Lovely color, composition and clarity. Also I like the color in the shadows. Gorgeous image. To me it expresses more aroma in the sense of flavour, not so much scent.', '2003-11-28 17:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(497707, 47886, 4008, '<td valign="top">I like the limited number of colors, the simplicity. Also I like the shallow depth of field and the focus on the top of the bottle, it makes it special (you probably get a lot of complaints about it). Only disturbing are the darker streaks (caused by refractions?) in the bottle, is it caused by the label, or is the environment not shielded of for example by a white sheet ?</td>', 'I like the limited number of colors, the simplicity. Also I like the shallow depth of field and the focus on the top of the bottle, it makes it special (you probably get a lot of complaints about it). Only disturbing are the darker streaks (caused by refractions?) in the bottle, is it caused by the label, or is the environment not shielded of for example by a white sheet ?', '2003-11-28 17:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(497708, 48611, 4008, '<td valign="top">A gorgeous bottle, in nice soft surroundings. I think the light is a bit flat, try experimenting with some side or backlight, to add some more depth.</td>', 'A gorgeous bottle, in nice soft surroundings. I think the light is a bit flat, try experimenting with some side or backlight, to add some more depth.', '2003-11-28 17:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(497709, 48632, 4008, '<td valign="top">Yes it has a cool atmosphere, as your title suggest. I like the sparcles of light and the water on the mirror. I think the water plays and important role and therefore should have been totally sharp, also at the top. The reflection of the bottle shows a number of vertical lines, whereas the bootle itself shows hardly any structure. A different angle of light might have brought that more in balance. Without the full reflection it would also have been a strong image.</td>', 'Yes it has a cool atmosphere, as your title suggest. I like the sparcles of light and the water on the mirror. I think the water plays and important role and therefore should have been totally sharp, also at the top. The reflection of the bottle shows a number of vertical lines, whereas the bootle itself shows hardly any structure. A different angle of light might have brought that more in balance. Without the full reflection it would also have been a strong image.', '2003-11-28 17:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(497710, 47764, 3295, '<td valign="top">no I can''t</td>', 'no I can''t', '2003-11-28 17:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(497711, 48629, 4008, '<td valign="top">yes, gasoline has a strong smell, but a picture of an old gasoline pump does not express smell in a strong way to me. If I would not have the context of the challenge or the title I would not have guessed it was about scent, I would have thought it was about old equipment. T express the smell I would suggest a picture of a gasoline pistol filling a car, maybe someones nose close to it, something like that.</td>', 'yes, gasoline has a strong smell, but a picture of an old gasoline pump does not express smell in a strong way to me. If I would not have the context of the challenge or the title I would not have guessed it was about scent, I would have thought it was about old equipment. T express the smell I would suggest a picture of a gasoline pistol filling a car, maybe someones nose close to it, something like that.', '2003-11-28 17:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(497712, 47764, 4008, '<td valign="top">No I can''t, I don''t understand the title or the image. I see a picture of a stone, does not express smell to me. It is lit by the hard light of a flash, surrounded by strong shadows, try bouncing the flash against the ceiling for a softer effect.</td>', 'No I can''t, I don''t understand the title or the image. I see a picture of a stone, does not express smell to me. It is lit by the hard light of a flash, surrounded by strong shadows, try bouncing the flash against the ceiling for a softer effect.', '2003-11-28 17:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(497714, 48093, 4008, '<td valign="top">You have made it very difficult for yourself to get a good image out of this, a very black dog on a very white floor, and an object very close to the lens and also farther away, both intended to be sharp. Now the dog is underexposed, floor overexposed, it would need much softer light, to reduce contrast. Also bouncing back the light to lighten up the head of the dog would have helped, it is now in the shadow. Or take the same picture with the light coming from your back, instead of from the front (wathc youw onw shadow then!!).</td>', 'You have made it very difficult for yourself to get a good image out of this, a very black dog on a very white floor, and an object very close to the lens and also farther away, both intended to be sharp. Now the dog is underexposed, floor overexposed, it would need much softer light, to reduce contrast. Also bouncing back the light to lighten up the head of the dog would have helped, it is now in the shadow. Or take the same picture with the light coming from your back, instead of from the front (wathc youw onw shadow then!!).', '2003-11-28 17:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(497716, 48241, 4008, '<td valign="top">Your objects don''t match your title. You should have polished the tap. Shiny objects need to be really clean otherwise they bring down the whole image. The crop could have been closer so you remove the picture at the back, on the left. Also, the towel could have been taken away. Then use a different light, not this hard flash and the whole image would have become much stronger. it is a lot about reduction, remove things, make it simpler, more clean.</td>', 'Your objects don''t match your title. You should have polished the tap. Shiny objects need to be really clean otherwise they bring down the whole image. The crop could have been closer so you remove the picture at the back, on the left. Also, the towel could have been taken away. Then use a different light, not this hard flash and the whole image would have become much stronger. it is a lot about reduction, remove things, make it simpler, more clean.', '2003-11-28 17:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(497717, 48083, 3295, '<td valign="top">wonderful colors and textures, but not in focus.</td>', 'wonderful colors and textures, but not in focus.', '2003-11-28 17:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(497719, 48374, 3295, '<td valign="top">you with the rudest looking photo ever!  Yuck!</td>', 'you with the rudest looking photo ever!  Yuck!', '2003-11-28 17:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(497720, 48241, 3295, '<td valign="top">the on camera flash was not your friend here.</td>', 'the on camera flash was not your friend here.', '2003-11-28 17:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(497723, 48125, 4008, '<td valign="top">Blacklight ? I like the cool effect it gives. The reflection of the light in the middle at the back should have been avoided. Composition is fine, I would have move the bottle with the red cap slightly to the right so it is not lined up with the one behind it, but that is a small thing. Overall the image could use a bit more contrast, more life.</td>', 'Blacklight ? I like the cool effect it gives. The reflection of the light in the middle at the back should have been avoided. Composition is fine, I would have move the bottle with the red cap slightly to the right so it is not lined up with the one behind it, but that is a small thing. Overall the image could use a bit more contrast, more life.', '2003-11-28 17:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(497724, 48266, 3032, '<td valign="top">The composition is okish, perhaps a slightly lower angle could be better. I like the shallow dof and the capture of the bubbles. I don''t like how the glass is cut off by the frame and the black/greyish background (black paper?). Try to get the background behind the glass truly black, perhaps by using a black textile or by using reflectors to light up the front without covering the background.<br/>Colors are great and lifelike. 8</td>', 'The composition is okish, perhaps a slightly lower angle could be better. I like the shallow dof and the capture of the bubbles. I don''t like how the glass is cut off by the frame and the black/greyish background (black paper?). Try to get the background behind the glass truly black, perhaps by using a black textile or by using reflectors to light up the front without covering the background.Colors are great and lifelike. 8', '2003-11-28 17:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(497725, 48311, 12253, '<td valign="top">It''s eye catching, but I am not sure what the title means, nor the relationship to scents and aromas.  Thre seems to be a fair amount of noise, and the hi-key approach is a bit disorienting here.  I can''t tell if the frog is standing or jumping or what!</td>', 'It''s eye catching, but I am not sure what the title means, nor the relationship to scents and aromas.  Thre seems to be a fair amount of noise, and the hi-key approach is a bit disorienting here.  I can''t tell if the frog is standing or jumping or what!', '2003-11-28 17:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(497726, 48048, 3295, '<td valign="top">pretty.</td>', 'pretty.', '2003-11-28 17:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(497728, 48460, 3032, '<td valign="top">I like the technical quality of this photo. It is well composed, sharp troughout (wide aperture would probably not help this pose), excellent exposure, good b&amp;w toning.<br/>But I just don''t get her pose, too much upper leg area, it makes it look like she has fat upper legs. Perhaps that is true, but I don''t consider it very flattering.<br/>Difficult position I guess? :) <br/>Apart from the centre with all that upper leg in it, good photo. 8</td>', 'I like the technical quality of this photo. It is well composed, sharp troughout (wide aperture would probably not help this pose), excellent exposure, good b&w toning.But I just don''t get her pose, too much upper leg area, it makes it look like she has fat upper legs. Perhaps that is true, but I don''t consider it very flattering.Difficult position I guess? :) Apart from the centre with all that upper leg in it, good photo. 8', '2003-11-28 17:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(497729, 48550, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good job capturing my favorite beverage.  Having all the steam makes it that much better a photo (aesthetically) too.  I think it might have been good to have a bit more of the pot there, and maybe a cleaner background than this (I am not sure what the dark blue is here).</td>', 'Good job capturing my favorite beverage.  Having all the steam makes it that much better a photo (aesthetically) too.  I think it might have been good to have a bit more of the pot there, and maybe a cleaner background than this (I am not sure what the dark blue is here).', '2003-11-28 18:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(497730, 48154, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very good lighting and shot.  I like this in general, butit seems like it still needs something else for more pop.  I am not sure, maybe another contrasting color in there?</td>', 'Very good lighting and shot.  I like this in general, butit seems like it still needs something else for more pop.  I am not sure, maybe another contrasting color in there?', '2003-11-28 18:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(497731, 48626, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very nice still life.  I am mixed about the inclusion of the lamp at the upper left though.</td>', 'Very nice still life.  I am mixed about the inclusion of the lamp at the upper left though.', '2003-11-28 18:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(497732, 48569, 3032, '<td valign="top">The scarve and handgloves, plus that cup of chocolate(?) with cookie stand out perfectly against the other darker textile. Good idea and well captured. <br/>Perhaps I would like it even more without the scarve. The purple does not seem to belong here and the handgloves tell enough about the conditions.... Yes, I do believe that a landscape scene of just the lower part of the photo would be even better. 8</td>', 'The scarve and handgloves, plus that cup of chocolate(?) with cookie stand out perfectly against the other darker textile. Good idea and well captured. Perhaps I would like it even more without the scarve. The purple does not seem to belong here and the handgloves tell enough about the conditions.... Yes, I do believe that a landscape scene of just the lower part of the photo would be even better. 8', '2003-11-28 18:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(497734, 48594, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice rose and effort.  This has too much noise for some reason (perhaps too high a jpeg ratio?) and is a bit overexposed at the bottom of the rose.</td>', 'Nice rose and effort.  This has too much noise for some reason (perhaps too high a jpeg ratio?) and is a bit overexposed at the bottom of the rose.', '2003-11-28 18:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(497735, 48272, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good mix of the theme with the popcorn!  I did have trouble recognizing that as a movie reel until I read your title, so my advice for next time would be to include more contextual cues, or more of the reels shape.</td>', 'Good mix of the theme with the popcorn!  I did have trouble recognizing that as a movie reel until I read your title, so my advice for next time would be to include more contextual cues, or more of the reels shape.', '2003-11-28 18:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(497737, 48362, 12253, '<td valign="top">Looks like a good picture, but it''s so small, it''s hard to judge.  Next time I suggest trying to make it so the larger dimension is closer to 640 (the size limit).</td>', 'Looks like a good picture, but it''s so small, it''s hard to judge.  Next time I suggest trying to make it so the larger dimension is closer to 640 (the size limit).', '2003-11-28 18:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(497738, 48641, 12253, '<td valign="top">I like the shot here a lot, but the excessive noise (from using too much JPEG compression) spoils it''s beauty somewhat.  It''s especially distorted on his face.</td>', 'I like the shot here a lot, but the excessive noise (from using too much JPEG compression) spoils it''s beauty somewhat.  It''s especially distorted on his face.', '2003-11-28 18:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(497739, 47777, 3032, '<td valign="top">Wonderful. Would have done well in the soft focus challenge as well.<br/>I definitely like the soft effect, good composition and nice colors.<br/>You know, the lilly bulbs smell even better. I have worked four years in the lilly business. Taking their heads off (the rotting heads have a very distinctive smell), weeding, digging them up, cleaning (the bulbs are washed in a gigantic washer), sorting, peeling (the flakes of a lilly bulb can be grown to create a new one) etc... All stages have their own smell, I can recall them all, they were all good. It was hard work, but satisfying.</td>', 'Wonderful. Would have done well in the soft focus challenge as well.I definitely like the soft effect, good composition and nice colors.You know, the lilly bulbs smell even better. I have worked four years in the lilly business. Taking their heads off (the rotting heads have a very distinctive smell), weeding, digging them up, cleaning (the bulbs are washed in a gigantic washer), sorting, peeling (the flakes of a lilly bulb can be grown to create a new one) etc... All stages have their own smell, I can recall them all, they were all good. It was hard work, but satisfying.', '2003-11-28 18:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(497740, 47926, 12253, '<td valign="top">A novel shot.  I think it would have been improved by placing the cigar on a mirror and shooting from somewhat above.  I don''t think having the cigar on the edge, and a slice of it possibly even cropped, is the best composition.</td>', 'A novel shot.  I think it would have been improved by placing the cigar on a mirror and shooting from somewhat above.  I don''t think having the cigar on the edge, and a slice of it possibly even cropped, is the best composition.', '2003-11-28 18:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(497741, 48609, 3032, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo. Good aperture choice, good lighting, nice backgroundm wonderful color, nice composition. I think that it isn''t as sharp as it could be, but still a good photo.</td>', 'Excellent photo. Good aperture choice, good lighting, nice backgroundm wonderful color, nice composition. I think that it isn''t as sharp as it could be, but still a good photo.', '2003-11-28 18:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(497742, 48585, 12253, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, especially the choice of backlighting.  I think it might have been a bit better if the bottom were cropped to not show the bra or whatever it is.  The lighting works well with skin and the mist.</td>', 'I like this shot, especially the choice of backlighting.  I think it might have been a bit better if the bottom were cropped to not show the bra or whatever it is.  The lighting works well with skin and the mist.', '2003-11-28 18:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(497744, 48459, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good subject choice; The lighting is a bit harsh/overexposed on the tops of the loaves.  Also, I think it looks a bit unnatural as presented.  I think this would have been cooler "infinity like", if there were perhaps more loaves so that they filled the frame.</td>', 'Good subject choice; The lighting is a bit harsh/overexposed on the tops of the loaves.  Also, I think it looks a bit unnatural as presented.  I think this would have been cooler "infinity like", if there were perhaps more loaves so that they filled the frame.', '2003-11-28 18:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(497745, 48663, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great composition and lighting. I really like it how it stands out with powerful color from the black background. The focus point seems a bit off (towards the upper right, instead of the blossom petals)m but the soft effect does not really hurt this scene.</td>', 'Great composition and lighting. I really like it how it stands out with powerful color from the black background. The focus point seems a bit off (towards the upper right, instead of the blossom petals)m but the soft effect does not really hurt this scene.', '2003-11-28 18:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(497747, 48210, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good shot; lighting is a bit harsh, and I think it would have been better without the reflection of the lights at the bottom.  Actually, a nice black, velvet background would have really brought out the orange color.  Which by the way, it might be my laptop, but it looks a tad yellow rather than orange: when I first looked at it I thought it was a lemon.</td>', 'Good shot; lighting is a bit harsh, and I think it would have been better without the reflection of the lights at the bottom.  Actually, a nice black, velvet background would have really brought out the orange color.  Which by the way, it might be my laptop, but it looks a tad yellow rather than orange: when I first looked at it I thought it was a lemon.', '2003-11-28 18:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(497748, 48576, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, well worked out compositon.<br/>The only dislike is the way the background is refracted in the bottle, it takes the masculinity of the Eternity botlle away. It could do with a bit more saturation. Perhaps the Eternity bottle could be angled slightly more in a straight line to the lens.<br/> <br/>Overall a nice photo. 8</td>', 'Nice idea, well worked out compositon.The only dislike is the way the background is refracted in the bottle, it takes the masculinity of the Eternity botlle away. It could do with a bit more saturation. Perhaps the Eternity bottle could be angled slightly more in a straight line to the lens. Overall a nice photo. 8', '2003-11-28 18:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(497751, 48406, 3032, '<td valign="top">I like the setup and lighting here, but I feel that there are a couple of reflections to many in the mirror below it. That gives it a bit of a fuzzy, unsharp feeling. One reflection would be good, now there seems to be movement in a unmoving scene. But that''s just my feeling about this.<br/> <br/>Good job on the color and toning, it might benefit from a slightly narrower aperture.</td>', 'I like the setup and lighting here, but I feel that there are a couple of reflections to many in the mirror below it. That gives it a bit of a fuzzy, unsharp feeling. One reflection would be good, now there seems to be movement in a unmoving scene. But that''s just my feeling about this. Good job on the color and toning, it might benefit from a slightly narrower aperture.', '2003-11-28 18:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(497752, 48154, 3032, '<td valign="top">Good idea and setup. I like the setup and use of shallow dof. Good lighting, without highlight blowouts, yet I think that a slight underexposure might make it a bit better.<br/>I might also crop it a bit tighter, but your border choice already helps to get into the scene.<br/>Nice toning. 8</td>', 'Good idea and setup. I like the setup and use of shallow dof. Good lighting, without highlight blowouts, yet I think that a slight underexposure might make it a bit better.I might also crop it a bit tighter, but your border choice already helps to get into the scene.Nice toning. 8', '2003-11-28 18:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(497754, 48662, 3032, '<td valign="top">There is nothing like the smell of a bakery early in the morning. I used to drop off a girlfriend next to one when she got to work, the smell of the bakery nextdoors was worth getting up early. Wonderful low light capture, gets me into the december mood.<br/>Lots of angles and lines, lights and darks. Entertaining to the eye. Good job.</td>', 'There is nothing like the smell of a bakery early in the morning. I used to drop off a girlfriend next to one when she got to work, the smell of the bakery nextdoors was worth getting up early. Wonderful low light capture, gets me into the december mood.Lots of angles and lines, lights and darks. Entertaining to the eye. Good job.', '2003-11-28 18:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(497756, 47912, 3032, '<td valign="top">Wow, good photo of emotional links to scent.<br/>The soft focus works great to create the right mood for the viewer, it makes the scene steamy ~hot~sexy.<br/>I am not sure about the noise, I think it would be to ''sharp'' without it, destroying the mood. Good as it is.</td>', 'Wow, good photo of emotional links to scent.The soft focus works great to create the right mood for the viewer, it makes the scene steamy ~hot~sexy.I am not sure about the noise, I think it would be to ''sharp'' without it, destroying the mood. Good as it is.', '2003-11-28 18:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(497757, 48626, 6999, '<td valign="top">Interesting approach. Not convinced the near-ground lamp bowl adds a hell of a lot. There''s tonality and texture in the shot - but aroma? I don''t know. But then I haven''t ever seen a shot that reminded me of a smell yet.</td>', 'Interesting approach. Not convinced the near-ground lamp bowl adds a hell of a lot. There''s tonality and texture in the shot - but aroma? I don''t know. But then I haven''t ever seen a shot that reminded me of a smell yet.', '2003-11-28 18:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(497758, 48642, 6624, '<td valign="top">quite the trigger for sense of smell...this is a little dark overall but crisp and clear...</td>', 'quite the trigger for sense of smell...this is a little dark overall but crisp and clear...', '2003-11-28 18:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(497759, 48550, 6624, '<td valign="top">hot, black, and strong, just the way I like it<br/>this meets the challenge and steamy effect is particularly nice</td>', 'hot, black, and strong, just the way I like itthis meets the challenge and steamy effect is particularly nice', '2003-11-28 18:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(497760, 48620, 6624, '<td valign="top">this evokes taste and scent - light a little bouncy</td>', 'this evokes taste and scent - light a little bouncy', '2003-11-28 18:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(497761, 48662, 6999, '<td valign="top">Bakeries were one of my thoughts for this too: that yeast smell first thing in the morning :-) Can''t decide between liking and not liking the perspective distortion in this image though: it gives the right feeling of closeness, but also the wrong feeling of oddness.</td>', 'Bakeries were one of my thoughts for this too: that yeast smell first thing in the morning :-) Can''t decide between liking and not liking the perspective distortion in this image though: it gives the right feeling of closeness, but also the wrong feeling of oddness.', '2003-11-28 18:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(497762, 47987, 6624, '<td valign="top">evocative of one of the best smells there is...nice clean image</td>', 'evocative of one of the best smells there is...nice clean image', '2003-11-28 18:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(497763, 48162, 3032, '<td valign="top">The strong items of this image are:<br/>1) Great natural colors, yellowy wooden<br/>2) Leading lines, a reversed Z, enter at the lower left, to the right, up to the left corner and out again with the smoke.  The Zen of Aroma Therapy! :)<br/>3) Nice shallow dof tries to emphasize the tip of the smoking thingy ("wierrook" in Dutch, don''t have a dictionary at hand)<br/> <br/>The only dislike is the background. I would like it better if it were fully black instead of noisy bluegrey/ antraciet.<br/> <br/>Overall a good photo. 8</td>', 'The strong items of this image are:1) Great natural colors, yellowy wooden2) Leading lines, a reversed Z, enter at the lower left, to the right, up to the left corner and out again with the smoke.  The Zen of Aroma Therapy! :)3) Nice shallow dof tries to emphasize the tip of the smoking thingy ("wierrook" in Dutch, don''t have a dictionary at hand) The only dislike is the background. I would like it better if it were fully black instead of noisy bluegrey/ antraciet. Overall a good photo. 8', '2003-11-28 18:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(497764, 48272, 6624, '<td valign="top">very evocative of smell, intersting lines formed</td>', 'very evocative of smell, intersting lines formed', '2003-11-28 18:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(497765, 47817, 6624, '<td valign="top">certainly a lovely and familiar scent, nice rose</td>', 'certainly a lovely and familiar scent, nice rose', '2003-11-28 18:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(497766, 48664, 6624, '<td valign="top">this is one of my favorite scents and I like the composition</td>', 'this is one of my favorite scents and I like the composition', '2003-11-28 18:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(497767, 48575, 6999, '<td valign="top">Excellent flower shot - just a touch over-sharpened though - makes the edges seem a bit digital. The water is perhaps a little over-done for this kind of ''designer'' work perhaps. DOF is effective - real sense of three dimensionality.</td>', 'Excellent flower shot - just a touch over-sharpened though - makes the edges seem a bit digital. The water is perhaps a little over-done for this kind of ''designer'' work perhaps. DOF is effective - real sense of three dimensionality.', '2003-11-28 18:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(497773, 48223, 6999, '<td valign="top">Did you buy a baking tray just for this shot? And were those cookies really baked on it? It''s still very clean ... kind of points up the dirty look of the oven behind them I fear.</td>', 'Did you buy a baking tray just for this shot? And were those cookies really baked on it? It''s still very clean ... kind of points up the dirty look of the oven behind them I fear.', '2003-11-28 18:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(497775, 48609, 6999, '<td valign="top">Great light - though something odd is happening on the fringes of the shadws - looks almost like spilt blood, but follows the shadow line so much it almost has to be a processing artefact. I think the background garlic is unnecceary for such a simple image. Great work on the texture of the skins though.  One thing you have achieved is the closeness necessary to make me think of aroma: when one tries to smell something, one moves closer to it.</td>', 'Great light - though something odd is happening on the fringes of the shadws - looks almost like spilt blood, but follows the shadow line so much it almost has to be a processing artefact. I think the background garlic is unnecceary for such a simple image. Great work on the texture of the skins though.  One thing you have achieved is the closeness necessary to make me think of aroma: when one tries to smell something, one moves closer to it.', '2003-11-28 18:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(497783, 48617, 11800, '<td valign="top">Cute idea. I think I would have liked to see more details. The brightness/contrast is pumped too much for my tastes, but I can see that you might have wanted them  isolated to give more meaning to the title.</td>', 'Cute idea. I think I would have liked to see more details. The brightness/contrast is pumped too much for my tastes, but I can see that you might have wanted them  isolated to give more meaning to the title.', '2003-11-28 19:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(497784, 48554, 3032, '<td valign="top">Excellent compostition, lighting, color, aperture choice. I can just smell the coffee. The grinded beans smell much better compared to the end product.</td>', 'Excellent compostition, lighting, color, aperture choice. I can just smell the coffee. The grinded beans smell much better compared to the end product.', '2003-11-28 19:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(497785, 48589, 1379, '<td valign="top">Wow... This is the brand of matches I used when I lived in South Africa!  I brought a bunch back to the states as souvenirs of my life in a tiny village without electricity there...  Your photo is bringing back intense memories for me.  I love it!</td>', 'Wow... This is the brand of matches I used when I lived in South Africa!  I brought a bunch back to the states as souvenirs of my life in a tiny village without electricity there...  Your photo is bringing back intense memories for me.  I love it!', '2003-11-28 19:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(497787, 48525, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice seascape. I like all the action that is going on here in a kind of lightened dark mood. It seems like a bad day at the beach, rough sea, strong wind...... Yet a bright sky, possibly some light in the darkness. O yes, it certainly does smell of salt and sea on those days.<br/></td>', 'Nice seascape. I like all the action that is going on here in a kind of lightened dark mood. It seems like a bad day at the beach, rough sea, strong wind...... Yet a bright sky, possibly some light in the darkness. O yes, it certainly does smell of salt and sea on those days.', '2003-11-28 19:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(497788, 48643, 11800, '<td valign="top">A different smell, and a strong one at that. You made a good choice. I don''t know about the composition. The hand seems to take up more of the space than it needs to and the syringe might have been better placed somewhere more visable?</td>', 'A different smell, and a strong one at that. You made a good choice. I don''t know about the composition. The hand seems to take up more of the space than it needs to and the syringe might have been better placed somewhere more visable?', '2003-11-28 19:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(497790, 48639, 3032, '<td valign="top">Seems like a familiar face to me.......  (from previous challenges)<br/>This photo certainly expresses: "Aaaaaaaahhhhhh, Coffee!"<br/>Nice photo, good toning, but I''d drop the border. It is not necesarry here and it distracts becayse it is too light and in the same toning as the scene itself.</td>', 'Seems like a familiar face to me.......  (from previous challenges)This photo certainly expresses: "Aaaaaaaahhhhhh, Coffee!"Nice photo, good toning, but I''d drop the border. It is not necesarry here and it distracts becayse it is too light and in the same toning as the scene itself.', '2003-11-28 19:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(497792, 48462, 14605, '<td valign="top">Taste or Smell?</td>', 'Taste or Smell?', '2003-11-28 19:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(497793, 48466, 11800, '<td valign="top">Your exposure is good. Nice and clear with the right amount of light. I like the mug. I think it would be more effective if you had shown a hint of the contents of the mug or at least some steam rising to hint to the contents. I don''t know, but the two color background/table detracts? I don''t think I like it.</td>', 'Your exposure is good. Nice and clear with the right amount of light. I like the mug. I think it would be more effective if you had shown a hint of the contents of the mug or at least some steam rising to hint to the contents. I don''t know, but the two color background/table detracts? I don''t think I like it.', '2003-11-28 19:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(497795, 48437, 14605, '<td valign="top">I´m from a south american country soo i dont know the smell of this kind of place. Probably is very nice. I like the picture, the colors and the diference bettwen the trees and the leaves in earth.</td>', 'I´m from a south american country soo i dont know the smell of this kind of place. Probably is very nice. I like the picture, the colors and the diference bettwen the trees and the leaves in earth.', '2003-11-28 19:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(497796, 48668, 2158, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but I''m not sure that''s the background I would have chosen.</td>', 'Nice idea, but I''m not sure that''s the background I would have chosen.', '2003-11-28 19:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(497797, 47875, 2158, '<td valign="top">My preference would be to concentrate on  one or two of those bottles to show off their beauty.  Sometimes less is more.</td>', 'My preference would be to concentrate on  one or two of those bottles to show off their beauty.  Sometimes less is more.', '2003-11-28 19:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(497798, 48550, 13925, '<td valign="top">wow, I can smell the coffee!</td>', 'wow, I can smell the coffee!', '2003-11-28 19:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(497801, 47744, 3295, '<td valign="top">wonderful colors,</td>', 'wonderful colors,', '2003-11-28 19:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(497802, 48618, 3295, '<td valign="top">nice composition and lighting. but a little bland, on purpose?</td>', 'nice composition and lighting. but a little bland, on purpose?', '2003-11-28 19:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(497803, 48611, 11800, '<td valign="top">The title is a little too clever. Excellent shot. The feathers add such a nice soft touch to the photo and the high key approach reinforces the female theme. There is nothing not to like about this except the bead on top, I wish it was more defined to bring it out from the background, You have some heavy competition!</td>', 'The title is a little too clever. Excellent shot. The feathers add such a nice soft touch to the photo and the high key approach reinforces the female theme. There is nothing not to like about this except the bead on top, I wish it was more defined to bring it out from the background, You have some heavy competition!', '2003-11-28 19:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(497809, 48380, 11800, '<td valign="top">Your colors are bright. The pink and blue make a good color combination and the white baby''s breath adds to the arrangement. It''s really hard to get a decent flash shot to come out right. If you have ev control on your camera, you might want to lower it when using the flash. The point of view is a little high, did you see what it would like from a lower angle? The frame tricked me. I kept looking at the picture to see what was causing the dark shadow! You might want a solid frame in the future. Heck, I didn''t know we could do something like that.</td>', 'Your colors are bright. The pink and blue make a good color combination and the white baby''s breath adds to the arrangement. It''s really hard to get a decent flash shot to come out right. If you have ev control on your camera, you might want to lower it when using the flash. The point of view is a little high, did you see what it would like from a lower angle? The frame tricked me. I kept looking at the picture to see what was causing the dark shadow! You might want a solid frame in the future. Heck, I didn''t know we could do something like that.', '2003-11-28 19:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(497811, 48593, 7304, '<td valign="top">This is tops. DOF is right on and you have the smoke just perfect. Light is great and I love how the smoke flows through the composition. I gave it a 9.</td>', 'This is tops. DOF is right on and you have the smoke just perfect. Light is great and I love how the smoke flows through the composition. I gave it a 9.', '2003-11-28 19:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(497812, 48550, 7304, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the steam of the aroma of coffee. Not sure about the blue. Nice focus. 7</td>', 'Great capture of the steam of the aroma of coffee. Not sure about the blue. Nice focus. 7', '2003-11-28 19:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(497814, 48629, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like the colors. However your picture doesn''t convince me. It looks like an old abandoned something or other sitting out in a junk yard.  Maybe if it''s surroundings were shown, I could see that it is being used?</td>', 'I like the colors. However your picture doesn''t convince me. It looks like an old abandoned something or other sitting out in a junk yard.  Maybe if it''s surroundings were shown, I could see that it is being used?', '2003-11-28 19:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(497816, 48585, 7304, '<td valign="top">Nice black and white. Love the use of light and how it captures the spray from the perfume. 7</td>', 'Nice black and white. Love the use of light and how it captures the spray from the perfume. 7', '2003-11-28 19:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(497818, 48083, 11800, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement and composition. A tripod is a wise investment. The camera shake in this picture makes it less pleasing to view than it would have been if it was in sharp focus.</td>', 'Nice arrangement and composition. A tripod is a wise investment. The camera shake in this picture makes it less pleasing to view than it would have been if it was in sharp focus.', '2003-11-28 19:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(497819, 47926, 7304, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Wish you could have gotten the smoke just a bit more. Light is just right. I like how the smoke makes your eye go upward. 7</td>', 'Great shot. Wish you could have gotten the smoke just a bit more. Light is just right. I like how the smoke makes your eye go upward. 7', '2003-11-28 19:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(497820, 48526, 7304, '<td valign="top">Nice focus. Love the color. You can just smell the wax of the crayons. 7</td>', 'Nice focus. Love the color. You can just smell the wax of the crayons. 7', '2003-11-28 19:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(497824, 48638, 11800, '<td valign="top">Nice, with that little added something to make it outstanding. Arrangement and set-up are good. I guess if I would change anything, it would be to desaturate the blue channel to lessen the impact of those highlights on the lip and stopper. But that''s just my take on the photo.</td>', 'Nice, with that little added something to make it outstanding. Arrangement and set-up are good. I guess if I would change anything, it would be to desaturate the blue channel to lessen the impact of those highlights on the lip and stopper. But that''s just my take on the photo.', '2003-11-28 19:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(497825, 48567, 7304, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of backlighting. Makes the coffe glow. The steam is interesting. You can smell the coffee from here and the beans are an added edition that helps. 6</td>', 'Interesting use of backlighting. Makes the coffe glow. The steam is interesting. You can smell the coffee from here and the beans are an added edition that helps. 6', '2003-11-28 19:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(497827, 48660, 7304, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Great use of light in the studio. Love the touch of the peppermint leaves. Seasonal colors. Nice DOF. Small red border helps frame the image so the white doesn''t overpower it to much. 8</td>', 'Nice shot. Great use of light in the studio. Love the touch of the peppermint leaves. Seasonal colors. Nice DOF. Small red border helps frame the image so the white doesn''t overpower it to much. 8', '2003-11-28 19:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(497828, 47982, 7304, '<td valign="top">Love the yellow/gold/orange colors. Light is great. DOF is good. Image is sharp. I like the way you created the illusion of smell. 7</td>', 'Love the yellow/gold/orange colors. Light is great. DOF is good. Image is sharp. I like the way you created the illusion of smell. 7', '2003-11-28 20:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(497835, 48593, 9387, '<td valign="top">This photo is very well done.  I can smell the smoke already.  I like it a lot.  Good job.</td>', 'This photo is very well done.  I can smell the smoke already.  I like it a lot.  Good job.', '2003-11-28 20:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(497840, 48660, 14593, '<td valign="top">creative example of the scent of Christmas</td>', 'creative example of the scent of Christmas', '2003-11-28 20:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(497842, 48585, 14593, '<td valign="top">This photo is excellent.  I love the shadows....it captures the essence of a scent</td>', 'This photo is excellent.  I love the shadows....it captures the essence of a scent', '2003-11-28 20:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(497843, 48536, 14593, '<td valign="top">I like this photo.....colorful and " lots of scent"!!</td>', 'I like this photo.....colorful and " lots of scent"!!', '2003-11-28 20:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(497844, 48444, 14593, '<td valign="top">interesting photograph</td>', 'interesting photograph', '2003-11-28 20:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(497845, 48093, 14593, '<td valign="top">cute photo and it captures the scent of bacon.....I know the dog thinks so!!</td>', 'cute photo and it captures the scent of bacon.....I know the dog thinks so!!', '2003-11-28 20:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(497848, 48459, 9387, '<td valign="top">I can smell the bread already and it is making me hungry.  Very good shot and very good interpretation of the challenge.  10 for you.</td>', 'I can smell the bread already and it is making me hungry.  Very good shot and very good interpretation of the challenge.  10 for you.', '2003-11-28 20:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(497851, 48638, 9387, '<td valign="top">Some flowers fo not smell but I know that these do and I can smell it already.  You have great composition here and a wonderful idea.  The details are sharp, the glass is great with not much reflection from light source.  Excellent job.  A 10 for you!</td>', 'Some flowers fo not smell but I know that these do and I can smell it already.  You have great composition here and a wonderful idea.  The details are sharp, the glass is great with not much reflection from light source.  Excellent job.  A 10 for you!', '2003-11-28 20:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(497852, 47987, 9387, '<td valign="top">Great picture of the cookies and they still look hot.  Send some over here.  A 10 for you.</td>', 'Great picture of the cookies and they still look hot.  Send some over here.  A 10 for you.', '2003-11-28 20:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(497853, 48123, 14593, '<td valign="top">I may not like the subject matter, but it did leave me with a hint of scent.</td>', 'I may not like the subject matter, but it did leave me with a hint of scent.', '2003-11-28 20:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(497854, 47926, 9387, '<td valign="top">This is a great picture and I would consider it a 10 if there had been a little more smoke trail from the cigar.  It is there but not significantly to make an impact.  All in all a wonderful photo though.  9</td>', 'This is a great picture and I would consider it a 10 if there had been a little more smoke trail from the cigar.  It is there but not significantly to make an impact.  All in all a wonderful photo though.  9', '2003-11-28 20:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(497855, 48550, 9387, '<td valign="top">Very good depiction of your smell/odor.  It certainly reminds me of morning.  I am giving it a 9 because IMHO I think the stream of coffee could use some work as far as lighting is concerned.  It is distracting to see the diamonds of white from the lighting source you have used.  All in all a great photo though.  9</td>', 'Very good depiction of your smell/odor.  It certainly reminds me of morning.  I am giving it a 9 because IMHO I think the stream of coffee could use some work as far as lighting is concerned.  It is distracting to see the diamonds of white from the lighting source you have used.  All in all a great photo though.  9', '2003-11-28 20:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(497856, 47927, 9387, '<td valign="top">Love your photo and in this case the border helps the picture.  Wonderful photo. 10</td>', 'Love your photo and in this case the border helps the picture.  Wonderful photo. 10', '2003-11-28 20:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(497859, 48639, 9387, '<td valign="top">I like this photo a lot and it certainly makes me smell the coffee.  However, I am wondering how this would have looked in straight b&amp;w.   The only thing that is disturbing are the reflections from your light source.  9</td>', 'I like this photo a lot and it certainly makes me smell the coffee.  However, I am wondering how this would have looked in straight b&w.   The only thing that is disturbing are the reflections from your light source.  9', '2003-11-28 20:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(497862, 48440, 772, '<td valign="top">This is in poor taste.  Why didn''t you just photography yourself smoking it?  The burning aroma is much stronger and would meet the challenge a lot better.</td>', 'This is in poor taste.  Why didn''t you just photography yourself smoking it?  The burning aroma is much stronger and would meet the challenge a lot better.', '2003-11-28 20:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(497863, 48175, 14593, '<td valign="top">I like the composition</td>', 'I like the composition', '2003-11-28 20:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(497865, 48618, 9387, '<td valign="top">Great picture and I can smell the popcorn already.  In my case I can smell the burnt popcorn.  I like this photo a lot.  Good composition and good thought as to how to portray your thoughts.  I was just wondering if there was some way you could have triggered the microwave to think the door was closed and turn the light off.  It is a little disturbing to what otherwise is a great photo. 9</td>', 'Great picture and I can smell the popcorn already.  In my case I can smell the burnt popcorn.  I like this photo a lot.  Good composition and good thought as to how to portray your thoughts.  I was just wondering if there was some way you could have triggered the microwave to think the door was closed and turn the light off.  It is a little disturbing to what otherwise is a great photo. 9', '2003-11-28 20:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(497866, 48588, 9387, '<td valign="top">I think this is a very good photo.  I assume the soft look was intentional so I won''t say "it could be sharper."  However, I think I would like it a little better if you could have captured it without the shadows as the white between the flower and the stamen is a little blown out.  All in all I think this is a very good photo though.</td>', 'I think this is a very good photo.  I assume the soft look was intentional so I won''t say "it could be sharper."  However, I think I would like it a little better if you could have captured it without the shadows as the white between the flower and the stamen is a little blown out.  All in all I think this is a very good photo though.', '2003-11-28 20:59:04.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(497867, 48566, 9387, '<td valign="top">The kitten is adorable and since I own a cat I can smell that box right now (the real one and the photo one  LOL).  However, I would have tried for a different crop and try to shed some more light on the cute kitten.  Good job though.</td>', 'The kitten is adorable and since I own a cat I can smell that box right now (the real one and the photo one  LOL).  However, I would have tried for a different crop and try to shed some more light on the cute kitten.  Good job though.', '2003-11-28 21:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(497868, 48056, 9387, '<td valign="top">Very good photo.  Nice texture, good composition and meets the challenge well.  My only critique is the cut piece of garlic is a little out of focus and the reflection of the light source takes away from that part of the photo.  8</td>', 'Very good photo.  Nice texture, good composition and meets the challenge well.  My only critique is the cut piece of garlic is a little out of focus and the reflection of the light source takes away from that part of the photo.  8', '2003-11-28 21:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(497869, 48502, 9387, '<td valign="top">Great photo of the matches burning.  I can smell the sulphur already.  Excellent job. Good composition, good tones and excellent depiction of your topic for the challenge.  10</td>', 'Great photo of the matches burning.  I can smell the sulphur already.  Excellent job. Good composition, good tones and excellent depiction of your topic for the challenge.  10', '2003-11-28 21:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(497871, 48589, 9387, '<td valign="top">Good depiction of the challenge.  I can smell the sulphur already.  Nice composition and good tones.  I would have liked the matches in the box to be lit a little more evenly though.  9</td>', 'Good depiction of the challenge.  I can smell the sulphur already.  Nice composition and good tones.  I would have liked the matches in the box to be lit a little more evenly though.  9', '2003-11-28 21:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(497873, 48214, 9387, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.  Reflection in water is great.  Nice composition and good color tone.</td>', 'Very nice photo.  Reflection in water is great.  Nice composition and good color tone.', '2003-11-28 21:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(497874, 48223, 9387, '<td valign="top">I like your photo but I would have liked the angle of view a little higher.</td>', 'I like your photo but I would have liked the angle of view a little higher.', '2003-11-28 21:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(497876, 48643, 9387, '<td valign="top">Whew--I smelled this right away just from looking.  I work in a hospital.  Good job and good idea.  I don''t understand how the package can be crystal clear and the needle behind the pad but not the actual pad.  Did you accidentally move it?  LOL  Very well done anyway though.</td>', 'Whew--I smelled this right away just from looking.  I work in a hospital.  Good job and good idea.  I don''t understand how the package can be crystal clear and the needle behind the pad but not the actual pad.  Did you accidentally move it?  LOL  Very well done anyway though.', '2003-11-28 21:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(497907, 48206, 7778, '<td valign="top">A potentialy pleasing and compositionally satisfying capture of a somewhat common subject. The tri-cluster of cones adds interest as much as the star-burst needles. The natural colours also contribute to a positive overall impression.<br/> <br/>The focus, however, does not appear to be as crisp as one would expect, particularly within such a narrow depth of field. Although there is evidence of overexposure on parts of the cones, it is unlike to strike a casual viewer as a dominant flaw. Despite the almost central composition and because of the distant cone (near bottom left) and the curved branch intersecting the image, the distribution of available weights remains, indeed, reasonably balanced. <br/> <br/>The sheer size and colour/line intensity/weight of what I\''d consider a redundant border takes away potential image size and, IMHO, distracts from what is essentially a very humble capture.</td>', 'A potentialy pleasing and compositionally satisfying capture of a somewhat common subject. The tri-cluster of cones adds interest as much as the star-burst needles. The natural colours also contribute to a positive overall impression. The focus, however, does not appear to be as crisp as one would expect, particularly within such a narrow depth of field. Although there is evidence of overexposure on parts of the cones, it is unlike to strike a casual viewer as a dominant flaw. Despite the almost central composition and because of the distant cone (near bottom left) and the curved branch intersecting the image, the distribution of available weights remains, indeed, reasonably balanced.  The sheer size and colour/line intensity/weight of what I\''d consider a redundant border takes away potential image size and, IMHO, distracts from what is essentially a very humble capture.', '2003-11-28 22:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(497911, 47858, 6597, '<td valign="top">good arrangement 8</td>', 'good arrangement 8', '2003-11-28 22:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(497912, 48558, 11671, '<td valign="top">Simple, yet the sweet rich scent of aged sherry (or port?) is almost tangible.  The colour is marvelous.</td>', 'Simple, yet the sweet rich scent of aged sherry (or port?) is almost tangible.  The colour is marvelous.', '2003-11-28 22:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(497916, 48600, 11800, '<td valign="top">A very good attempt. You angled your lights down so the shadows don''t show much, your didn''t get any real bad highlights on the metal or glass, you used a decent background cover. All of this shows that you are interesting in doing more than an adequate job.  Now, work on your composition a little and you should do really well. <br/>If I was taking this, I would move the items away from the background.  With a lifestyle picture, it would be ok to see the wall as long as it''s not something really dirty or cracked or something. I''d put the coffee and the pot to one side and the cup with a saucer on the other and the spoon on the saucer. You want it to look natural, but perfect. Try it with to camera angled down on the scene also.</td>', 'A very good attempt. You angled your lights down so the shadows don''t show much, your didn''t get any real bad highlights on the metal or glass, you used a decent background cover. All of this shows that you are interesting in doing more than an adequate job.  Now, work on your composition a little and you should do really well. If I was taking this, I would move the items away from the background.  With a lifestyle picture, it would be ok to see the wall as long as it''s not something really dirty or cracked or something. I''d put the coffee and the pot to one side and the cup with a saucer on the other and the spoon on the saucer. You want it to look natural, but perfect. Try it with to camera angled down on the scene also.', '2003-11-28 22:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(497920, 48065, 11800, '<td valign="top">Funny. Very good detail and perfect focus with just the right amount of dof.  Sorta ugly looking, but cute at the same time. Only thing that could be added to this is a cr****.  Sorry. I had to say that. Hope you''re not a kid.</td>', 'Funny. Very good detail and perfect focus with just the right amount of dof.  Sorta ugly looking, but cute at the same time. Only thing that could be added to this is a cr****.  Sorry. I had to say that. Hope you''re not a kid.', '2003-11-28 22:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(497922, 47967, 11800, '<td valign="top">Just like an ad. Like the misty look you created. Lot''s of direct competition for this type of shot. I can see a 5 way tie.</td>', 'Just like an ad. Like the misty look you created. Lot''s of direct competition for this type of shot. I can see a 5 way tie.', '2003-11-28 22:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(497924, 47987, 11800, '<td valign="top">Good detail and I like the blue plate. I don''t like the black background. White or tan would have given it a more homey feel.</td>', 'Good detail and I like the blue plate. I don''t like the black background. White or tan would have given it a more homey feel.', '2003-11-28 22:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(497926, 48597, 6477, '<td valign="top">Yummie... I really can "smell" this shot :)<br/>good work</td>', 'Yummie... I really can "smell" this shot :)good work', '2003-11-28 22:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(497930, 48576, 13610, '<td valign="top">Excellent light, excellent depth of field... you could do an ad with this picture</td>', 'Excellent light, excellent depth of field... you could do an ad with this picture', '2003-11-28 22:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(497935, 48367, 11800, '<td valign="top">I worked on a burn ward and you are right, it has it''s own smell that is hard to forget. I wish you had been able to zoom into the scene so I could see more of what is going on. It''s too vague as it is now. There''s no context other than the man.</td>', 'I worked on a burn ward and you are right, it has it''s own smell that is hard to forget. I wish you had been able to zoom into the scene so I could see more of what is going on. It''s too vague as it is now. There''s no context other than the man.', '2003-11-28 23:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(497936, 48589, 10686, '<td valign="top">Nice clean shot, Great idea.</td>', 'Nice clean shot, Great idea.', '2003-11-28 23:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(497938, 48655, 10686, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, the light on the leaf is a bit harsh and I wish the smoke had more of s curl, but still overall, very good</td>', 'Nice idea, the light on the leaf is a bit harsh and I wish the smoke had more of s curl, but still overall, very good', '2003-11-28 23:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(497939, 47886, 10686, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, lovely colors</td>', 'Nice shot, lovely colors', '2003-11-28 23:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(497941, 48639, 10686, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but could use a bit of contrast. I think B&amp;W is the way to go here</td>', 'Good idea, but could use a bit of contrast. I think B&W is the way to go here', '2003-11-28 23:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(497942, 48569, 11800, '<td valign="top">The cocoa looks yummy and the exposure is perfect.<br/>A more elegant solution would have been to have the gloves and coat hanging over a chair or at least having the gloves on the table beside the mug. It looks awkward with her holding the cookie, like it might cause her to spill the hot chocolate at any moment. Do you think  there is too much black space between the scarf and the mug?</td>', 'The cocoa looks yummy and the exposure is perfect.A more elegant solution would have been to have the gloves and coat hanging over a chair or at least having the gloves on the table beside the mug. It looks awkward with her holding the cookie, like it might cause her to spill the hot chocolate at any moment. Do you think  there is too much black space between the scarf and the mug?', '2003-11-28 23:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(497945, 47976, 7778, '<td valign="top">A good macro which, IMO, could be somewhat improved upon by extending the shallow depth of field to the precise point(s) of interest. The composition is appropiately dynamic.<br/> <br/>The overly heavy border (somewhat reminiscent of an orbituary), however, diminishes the potential size of this capture while distracting from the subtlety of the subject. The black hairline applied here by default would, IMHO, been ideal.</td>', 'A good macro which, IMO, could be somewhat improved upon by extending the shallow depth of field to the precise point(s) of interest. The composition is appropiately dynamic. The overly heavy border (somewhat reminiscent of an orbituary), however, diminishes the potential size of this capture while distracting from the subtlety of the subject. The black hairline applied here by default would, IMHO, been ideal.', '2003-11-28 23:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(497946, 48125, 10686, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea, I just think the effect here overpowers anything else here.</td>', 'This is a good idea, I just think the effect here overpowers anything else here.', '2003-11-28 23:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(497948, 48659, 12733, '<td valign="top">The curves of the bridges make an attractive composition, and they contrast with the boxy shapes of the plant.This picture certainly conveys the feeling of the plant''s smell.  I''d like to see that factory a little clearer, and less dead black in the foreground.</td>', 'The curves of the bridges make an attractive composition, and they contrast with the boxy shapes of the plant.This picture certainly conveys the feeling of the plant''s smell.  I''d like to see that factory a little clearer, and less dead black in the foreground.', '2003-11-28 23:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(497949, 47886, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting of the yellow liquid and the shiny bottle.</td>', 'Nice lighting of the yellow liquid and the shiny bottle.', '2003-11-28 23:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(497950, 48175, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and composition. I''m kind of turned off by the blue against the brown cookies and cinnamon stidks; I would have chosen a different color.</td>', 'Nice idea and composition. I''m kind of turned off by the blue against the brown cookies and cinnamon stidks; I would have chosen a different color.', '2003-11-28 23:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(497952, 48610, 12733, '<td valign="top">I can almost taste the fish. Nice lighting and a simple arrangement.</td>', 'I can almost taste the fish. Nice lighting and a simple arrangement.', '2003-11-28 23:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(497953, 48663, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, but kind of disembodied. It seems that the flower has become cut off from the leaves.</td>', 'Very pretty, but kind of disembodied. It seems that the flower has become cut off from the leaves.', '2003-11-28 23:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
