(497961, 48210, 12733, '<td valign="top">The oranges look yummy - I can almost smell and taste them. The hot spot (water? juice?) in the foreground just looks messy.</td>', 'The oranges look yummy - I can almost smell and taste them. The hot spot (water? juice?) in the foreground just looks messy.', '2003-11-28 23:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
