(497988, 47987, 12733, '<td valign="top">I can''t say whether it''s the photography or the baking, but these cookies look deep fried, and the chips look like burned spots. I think some playing with levels, saturation and hue could make this a more effective shot.</td>', 'I can''t say whether it''s the photography or the baking, but these cookies look deep fried, and the chips look like burned spots. I think some playing with levels, saturation and hue could make this a more effective shot.', '2003-11-28 23:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(497990, 48529, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very effective lighting. I don''t know whether the loss of focus at the bottom adds to the shot or detracts - it probably takes too much attention away from the rest of the picture.</td>', 'Very effective lighting. I don''t know whether the loss of focus at the bottom adds to the shot or detracts - it probably takes too much attention away from the rest of the picture.', '2003-11-28 23:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(497993, 47927, 7778, '<td valign="top">A good macro in sublte and naturel tones which radiates from the centre. The near static composition benefits this effect.<br/> <br/>The excessively decorative border, unfortunately, diminished both the potential image size and the claim of the title.</td>', 'A good macro in sublte and naturel tones which radiates from the centre. The near static composition benefits this effect. The excessively decorative border, unfortunately, diminished both the potential image size and the claim of the title.', '2003-11-28 23:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(497994, 48214, 12733, '<td valign="top">A very pretty composition; I like the bare branches and the simple composition. Not that it affects my rating, but does winter have a distinct smell?</td>', 'A very pretty composition; I like the bare branches and the simple composition. Not that it affects my rating, but does winter have a distinct smell?', '2003-11-28 23:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(497996, 47817, 6597, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shows the detail of the rose</td>', 'Beautiful shows the detail of the rose', '2003-11-29 00:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(497998, 47873, 12733, '<td valign="top">... and the scent of coming rain is in the air. Nice shot.</td>', '... and the scent of coming rain is in the air. Nice shot.', '2003-11-29 00:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(497999, 48009, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like this one a lot because of the emotion within it. She looks like it is a sensual experience. It looks almost too personal and private to be happening out in public. Good capture. This might have been good in the propaganda challenge. It sure makes me want to light up, literally.<br/>Updating.. I''m bumping this up to 10. It''s her nostril that''s giving me the feeling that she is really enjoying that cigar. It looks like it''s flared.  Plus her eyes being closed. Good luck.</td>', 'I like this one a lot because of the emotion within it. She looks like it is a sensual experience. It looks almost too personal and private to be happening out in public. Good capture. This might have been good in the propaganda challenge. It sure makes me want to light up, literally.Updating.. I''m bumping this up to 10. It''s her nostril that''s giving me the feeling that she is really enjoying that cigar. It looks like it''s flared.  Plus her eyes being closed. Good luck.', '2003-11-29 00:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(498001, 48406, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast of textures.</td>', 'Nice contrast of textures.', '2003-11-29 00:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(498002, 48641, 12733, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, having the dog doing the smelling. He gave you a really nice pose.</td>', 'Cute idea, having the dog doing the smelling. He gave you a really nice pose.', '2003-11-29 00:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(498004, 48553, 12733, '<td valign="top">Smoke makes great patterns, and you''ve done a nice job of capturing it.</td>', 'Smoke makes great patterns, and you''ve done a nice job of capturing it.', '2003-11-29 00:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(498006, 47927, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice high-key shot.</td>', 'Nice high-key shot.', '2003-11-29 00:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(498007, 48460, 12733, '<td valign="top">What''s she doing way up there? Interesting shot, pretty model, but it doesn''t make much sense.</td>', 'What''s she doing way up there? Interesting shot, pretty model, but it doesn''t make much sense.', '2003-11-29 00:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(498009, 48668, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice use of selective focus to make your point.</td>', 'Nice use of selective focus to make your point.', '2003-11-29 00:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(498115, 48585, 12448, '<td valign="top">I love this shot and I have to wonder just how much perfume she put on before you got the shot you wanted.  :)  A 10</td>', 'I love this shot and I have to wonder just how much perfume she put on before you got the shot you wanted.  :)  A 10', '2003-11-29 01:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(498116, 48577, 12448, '<td valign="top">I love the way the little candy canes make little hearts and I can not only smell them but can almost taste them as well.  The snow is a very nice touch, wish I had some to play with!  A 10</td>', 'I love the way the little candy canes make little hearts and I can not only smell them but can almost taste them as well.  The snow is a very nice touch, wish I had some to play with!  A 10', '2003-11-29 01:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(498117, 48626, 12448, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful set up, so perfect and I almost missed the bottle on the left and the topper towards the right.  The shade in the upper left is a bit distracting but otherwise a perfect shot.  A 9</td>', 'What a beautiful set up, so perfect and I almost missed the bottle on the left and the topper towards the right.  The shade in the upper left is a bit distracting but otherwise a perfect shot.  A 9', '2003-11-29 01:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(498118, 48526, 12448, '<td valign="top">New Crayons!  I love new crayons!  I get to see them all the time because I have three kids who are constantly losing said crayons, LOL!  A great shot, the clarity, the color, the only thing that would make it perfect for me would be a more head on and lined up cropping.  A 9</td>', 'New Crayons!  I love new crayons!  I get to see them all the time because I have three kids who are constantly losing said crayons, LOL!  A great shot, the clarity, the color, the only thing that would make it perfect for me would be a more head on and lined up cropping.  A 9', '2003-11-29 01:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(498120, 48610, 12448, '<td valign="top">Yes they do stink, don''t they?  A good idea for the challenge but the shot leaves me wanting.  It''s too blurry and the border is a bit heavy for this shot.  A 3</td>', 'Yes they do stink, don''t they?  A good idea for the challenge but the shot leaves me wanting.  It''s too blurry and the border is a bit heavy for this shot.  A 3', '2003-11-29 01:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(498121, 47980, 12448, '<td valign="top">Lots of different odors to deal with here.  The combination could be deadly! ;)<br/> <br/>The shot is small, hard to define all the elements and the bottles getting cut off are very distracting.  A 3</td>', 'Lots of different odors to deal with here.  The combination could be deadly! ;) The shot is small, hard to define all the elements and the bottles getting cut off are very distracting.  A 3', '2003-11-29 01:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(498122, 48549, 12448, '<td valign="top">A nice idea and the idea of using the foam blocks that interlock is a good idea to provide some color but for some reason I just can''t understand why this doesn''t appeal to me more.  I think it''s a bit bright overall and the colors could pop a lot more and the popcorn looks rather plain, like it''s missing butter?  Started with  a 3, am moving to a 5</td>', 'A nice idea and the idea of using the foam blocks that interlock is a good idea to provide some color but for some reason I just can''t understand why this doesn''t appeal to me more.  I think it''s a bit bright overall and the colors could pop a lot more and the popcorn looks rather plain, like it''s missing butter?  Started with  a 3, am moving to a 5', '2003-11-29 01:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(498130, 48630, 8891, '<td valign="top">These are hard pictures to take in the fall, theirs nothing to mask the uninteresting background behind the tree.  Curious about your choice of subject. I''ve never the thought of berries on the tree as having any scent at all. Guess that''s just me, it might be!</td>', 'These are hard pictures to take in the fall, theirs nothing to mask the uninteresting background behind the tree.  Curious about your choice of subject. I''ve never the thought of berries on the tree as having any scent at all. Guess that''s just me, it might be!', '2003-11-29 02:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(498131, 48362, 8891, '<td valign="top">I''ll take your word for it....and it''s scent....so small I cannot tell what it is.</td>', 'I''ll take your word for it....and it''s scent....so small I cannot tell what it is.', '2003-11-29 02:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(498133, 48552, 8891, '<td valign="top">LOL. well sort of anyway...pretty passé if you ask me, but nice set up and shot anyway.</td>', 'LOL. well sort of anyway...pretty passé if you ask me, but nice set up and shot anyway.', '2003-11-29 02:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(498134, 48643, 8891, '<td valign="top">The subject is hidden by the hand? I guess...don''t know what you were going for....two hands might have been better and with better focus than on this.</td>', 'The subject is hidden by the hand? I guess...don''t know what you were going for....two hands might have been better and with better focus than on this.', '2003-11-29 02:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(498136, 48626, 8891, '<td valign="top">I''m thinking that you could have done away with the lampshade and the bit of the base of the lamp at the bottom corner on this.  The perfume bottle, which is a real interesting look piece could have been given better placement as well.  Good overall shot.</td>', 'I''m thinking that you could have done away with the lampshade and the bit of the base of the lamp at the bottom corner on this.  The perfume bottle, which is a real interesting look piece could have been given better placement as well.  Good overall shot.', '2003-11-29 02:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
