(498138, 48635, 8891, '<td valign="top">you don''t have a real pepper shaker or mill? the composition might have stronger with the container more on the diagonal.  Like the shadow.</td>', 'you don''t have a real pepper shaker or mill? the composition might have stronger with the container more on the diagonal.  Like the shadow.', '2003-11-29 02:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
