(498221, 48612, 12674, '<td valign="top">Took me awhile to figure out I was seeing onion rings...so it didn''t readily suggest a smell to me. Creative shot though.</td>', 'Took me awhile to figure out I was seeing onion rings...so it didn''t readily suggest a smell to me. Creative shot though.', '2003-11-29 09:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
