(498464, 48628, 7711, '<td valign="top">I''ve pondered this shot for a couple of minutes now, trying to decide if I  like the grain or not. I''ve decided I really like it. Its different, and I think it adds to the sense of the shot. I feel like I''m smelling the warm of whatever is reflected in that lid, and I love the lighting on the face of the cook. Its just beautiful.</td>', 'I''ve pondered this shot for a couple of minutes now, trying to decide if I  like the grain or not. I''ve decided I really like it. Its different, and I think it adds to the sense of the shot. I feel like I''m smelling the warm of whatever is reflected in that lid, and I love the lighting on the face of the cook. Its just beautiful.', '2003-11-29 12:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
