(498467, 48257, 7711, '<td valign="top">i think the skin of garlic has some good texture..if the lighting was a little less bright (or the shot was less exposed) and the highlights were not blown out as they are here (only some, mind you!) it would have improved this shot a lot. I love the full frame of it, and the subject matter is perfect. :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-12-30 21:06:15.</i></td>', 'i think the skin of garlic has some good texture..if the lighting was a little less bright (or the shot was less exposed) and the highlights were not blown out as they are here (only some, mind you!) it would have improved this shot a lot. I love the full frame of it, and the subject matter is perfect. :)', '2003-11-29 12:27:36.000000', '2003-12-30 21:06:15.000000', 1),
