(498655, 48039, 8891, '<td valign="top">Great definition on the flower and excellent DOF....not happy with either the composition or the crop.</td>', 'Great definition on the flower and excellent DOF....not happy with either the composition or the crop.', '2003-11-29 17:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(498656, 48257, 8891, '<td valign="top">excellent in in this light sepia and wonderful fram fil...lose the frame and let me think this pyle of dracula repellents goes on forever.</td>', 'excellent in in this light sepia and wonderful fram fil...lose the frame and let me think this pyle of dracula repellents goes on forever.', '2003-11-29 18:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(498660, 47967, 12809, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I really like how you cropped out her eyes.  I love the soft blur to this, too.  Only suggestion - I would''ve liked to have seen the bottle actually spraying.  Gave this a 10, though.</td>', 'Great shot.  I really like how you cropped out her eyes.  I love the soft blur to this, too.  Only suggestion - I would''ve liked to have seen the bottle actually spraying.  Gave this a 10, though.', '2003-11-29 18:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(498661, 48660, 12809, '<td valign="top">Clean, simple, nice diagonal, great colors, and sharp.  Although this is a relatively simple image it is well done right down to the crushed pieces and leaf.  I gave this a 10.  Nice work.</td>', 'Clean, simple, nice diagonal, great colors, and sharp.  Although this is a relatively simple image it is well done right down to the crushed pieces and leaf.  I gave this a 10.  Nice work.', '2003-11-29 18:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(498663, 48585, 12809, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Love the darkness of this image and how there''s just enough light to form the outline of her face.  I''m really glad you included the ''spray'', too.  Nice work.  Gave this a 10.</td>', 'Great shot!  Love the darkness of this image and how there''s just enough light to form the outline of her face.  I''m really glad you included the ''spray'', too.  Nice work.  Gave this a 10.', '2003-11-29 18:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(498664, 48550, 12809, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot here!  I love the blue background, the steam and the crop.  The upper left steam swirled so perfectly; it looks like a cinnamon roll!  Really cool.  Great job.  I gave this a 10.</td>', 'Excellent shot here!  I love the blue background, the steam and the crop.  The upper left steam swirled so perfectly; it looks like a cinnamon roll!  Really cool.  Great job.  I gave this a 10.', '2003-11-29 18:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(498666, 48020, 12809, '<td valign="top">Such a simple photo but a strong photo.  You took an everyday item and made an image that could easily be used in advertising.  I wish everyone could do this.  (I''m tired of snapshots!)  I love the use of black in this shot.  The purple and orange work well together as well as the border.  The only thing I''m disappointed about is the heavy blur on the ''a'' and ''p'' but I don''t think there was much you could do to prevent that.  Super shot.  I gave this a 9.</td>', 'Such a simple photo but a strong photo.  You took an everyday item and made an image that could easily be used in advertising.  I wish everyone could do this.  (I''m tired of snapshots!)  I love the use of black in this shot.  The purple and orange work well together as well as the border.  The only thing I''m disappointed about is the heavy blur on the ''a'' and ''p'' but I don''t think there was much you could do to prevent that.  Super shot.  I gave this a 9.', '2003-11-29 18:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(498668, 47982, 12809, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  The yellow-gold color is warm and gives this image of french perfume (or french named at least) a nice feeling.  I like the gold leaves for added detail.  I''m not sure what that is in the upper left (I see this has been validated).  It sort of looks cool but I keep dwelling on it because I can''t figure out what it is or why it''s there - it''s really distracting me because of that.  It was obviously added for a reason and I''ll try to remember to check back after the contest to see exactly what you did!  Nice job on this.  I gave this a 9.</td>', 'I really like this shot.  The yellow-gold color is warm and gives this image of french perfume (or french named at least) a nice feeling.  I like the gold leaves for added detail.  I''m not sure what that is in the upper left (I see this has been validated).  It sort of looks cool but I keep dwelling on it because I can''t figure out what it is or why it''s there - it''s really distracting me because of that.  It was obviously added for a reason and I''ll try to remember to check back after the contest to see exactly what you did!  Nice job on this.  I gave this a 9.', '2003-11-29 18:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(498669, 48576, 12809, '<td valign="top">I think this is such a cool shot.  I love the bottle in the background.  Obviously a ladies perfect bottle.  The look of the bottle is perfect for this.  I love how you''ve focused the attention on the ''man'' leaving ''her'' blurred in the background.  It''s almost like ''she'' is courting him or something.  I dunno, maybe I''m reading more into than you had intended, but I love this!  The only thing I see a little off with this is the aftershave bottle.  It looks tilted when you compare it to the verticle border on the right.  Very minor, though.  I gave this a 9!</td>', 'I think this is such a cool shot.  I love the bottle in the background.  Obviously a ladies perfect bottle.  The look of the bottle is perfect for this.  I love how you''ve focused the attention on the ''man'' leaving ''her'' blurred in the background.  It''s almost like ''she'' is courting him or something.  I dunno, maybe I''m reading more into than you had intended, but I love this!  The only thing I see a little off with this is the aftershave bottle.  It looks tilted when you compare it to the verticle border on the right.  Very minor, though.  I gave this a 9!', '2003-11-29 18:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(498670, 47927, 12809, '<td valign="top">This is very pretty.  Love the crop.  The flower is beautiful and I love way the petals are slowly opening with the center still tightly closed.  I gave this an 8.  Probably would have given it a 9 but there seems to be quite a bit of yellow in the shadows of the petals.  Nice job.</td>', 'This is very pretty.  Love the crop.  The flower is beautiful and I love way the petals are slowly opening with the center still tightly closed.  I gave this an 8.  Probably would have given it a 9 but there seems to be quite a bit of yellow in the shadows of the petals.  Nice job.', '2003-11-29 18:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(498672, 48589, 12809, '<td valign="top">Clean and simple.  Good, solid background.  Nice colors on the box and matches.  Like the angle of the box and the placement of the burnt matches.  Good work.  Gave this an 8.</td>', 'Clean and simple.  Good, solid background.  Nice colors on the box and matches.  Like the angle of the box and the placement of the burnt matches.  Good work.  Gave this an 8.', '2003-11-29 18:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(498674, 48638, 12809, '<td valign="top">Cool idea for a shot.  Love the white flower against the real black background.  The oil/water droplet dripping from the flower into the bottom tells me that it''s obviously a floral scented perfume.  Good work.  I gave this an 8.<br/></td>', 'Cool idea for a shot.  Love the white flower against the real black background.  The oil/water droplet dripping from the flower into the bottom tells me that it''s obviously a floral scented perfume.  Good work.  I gave this an 8.', '2003-11-29 18:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(498676, 48550, 13223, '<td valign="top">I love this photo, the colour, the ambiance, the steam, everything!</td>', 'I love this photo, the colour, the ambiance, the steam, everything!', '2003-11-29 18:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(498677, 48567, 12809, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  Great lighting here.  I also like the steam.   Wish the handle was a bit more focused though.  I gave this an 8.</td>', 'I like this shot.  Great lighting here.  I also like the steam.   Wish the handle was a bit more focused though.  I gave this an 8.', '2003-11-29 18:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(498680, 47912, 12809, '<td valign="top">I like how you cropped out his eyes and I like the angle of her head.  The look on her face (half closed eyes, partly opened mouth) gives this a very sensual feel.  I know the blur was intentional to give this a soft, sexy feeling but I think it''s over-blurred, imo.  Unless of course you''re going for that steamed up shower door look! ;-)  Really though, it''s a good shot.  I gave this an 8.</td>', 'I like how you cropped out his eyes and I like the angle of her head.  The look on her face (half closed eyes, partly opened mouth) gives this a very sensual feel.  I know the blur was intentional to give this a soft, sexy feeling but I think it''s over-blurred, imo.  Unless of course you''re going for that steamed up shower door look! ;-)  Really though, it''s a good shot.  I gave this an 8.', '2003-11-29 18:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(498683, 48569, 13223, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this, it''s a great cozy, wintry feel.</td>', 'I like the idea of this, it''s a great cozy, wintry feel.', '2003-11-29 18:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(498684, 48569, 12809, '<td valign="top">Great job here!  I love the perspective/crop of this.  I like all of the details; the cocoa, mittens, cookie and scarf.  I would have liked to see a bit of her neck/chin still in the shot with her eyes cropped out.  Maybe it wouldn''t look good?  I dunno...still trying to envision it. lol  Great job, I gave this an 8.</td>', 'Great job here!  I love the perspective/crop of this.  I like all of the details; the cocoa, mittens, cookie and scarf.  I would have liked to see a bit of her neck/chin still in the shot with her eyes cropped out.  Maybe it wouldn''t look good?  I dunno...still trying to envision it. lol  Great job, I gave this an 8.', '2003-11-29 18:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(498687, 48175, 12809, '<td valign="top">I like the layout and placement of the cookies and things.  This is a very nice photo.  I do see some neon-blue color around the right of the cinnamon sticks and cloves (?) that doesn''t seem to belong, though.  The upper left of the photo seems perfectly lit but as you go down and to the right it worsens.  It gets darker and darker and the blue colors show up more.<br/> <br/>Nice job, though.  I gave this an 8.</td>', 'I like the layout and placement of the cookies and things.  This is a very nice photo.  I do see some neon-blue color around the right of the cinnamon sticks and cloves (?) that doesn''t seem to belong, though.  The upper left of the photo seems perfectly lit but as you go down and to the right it worsens.  It gets darker and darker and the blue colors show up more. Nice job, though.  I gave this an 8.', '2003-11-29 18:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(498692, 48620, 7038, '<td valign="top">I love the contrasting green and yellow colours here</td>', 'I love the contrasting green and yellow colours here', '2003-11-29 19:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(498693, 48662, 12809, '<td valign="top">Since I don''t know french, I wouldn''t have known by looking at this that this is a bakery.  I''m assuming "Boulangerie" means bakery or something similar.  I''m glad your title mentioned bread because I probably would''ve scored this as a 7 for possibly "not meeting the challenge" as a building doesn''t really tell me anything about scents. :-)  Instead, I gave this a 10.  This has a very nice feel to it.  Love that this is a night-time shot.  The glowing trees and well lit sign work well.  Love the curvy railing too.  Super job. ;-)</td>', 'Since I don''t know french, I wouldn''t have known by looking at this that this is a bakery.  I''m assuming "Boulangerie" means bakery or something similar.  I''m glad your title mentioned bread because I probably would''ve scored this as a 7 for possibly "not meeting the challenge" as a building doesn''t really tell me anything about scents. :-)  Instead, I gave this a 10.  This has a very nice feel to it.  Love that this is a night-time shot.  The glowing trees and well lit sign work well.  Love the curvy railing too.  Super job. ;-)', '2003-11-29 19:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
