(499134, 48553, 13540, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea, not such a good smelt, but great lighting</td>', 'Excellent idea, not such a good smelt, but great lighting', '2003-11-30 13:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(499135, 48440, 10145, '<td valign="top">Damn! I can almost smell it from here!</td>', 'Damn! I can almost smell it from here!', '2003-11-30 13:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(499136, 48154, 13540, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, very simple composition and nice framing</td>', 'Nice lighting, very simple composition and nice framing', '2003-11-30 13:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(499137, 48214, 10145, '<td valign="top">Wow! This is an awesome shot!  Very subdued but sharp at the same time and the colors fit well. 9</td>', 'Wow! This is an awesome shot!  Very subdued but sharp at the same time and the colors fit well. 9', '2003-11-30 13:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(499138, 48237, 13540, '<td valign="top">Perfect composition, excellent lighting, very creatrive work !</td>', 'Perfect composition, excellent lighting, very creatrive work !', '2003-11-30 13:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(499139, 48299, 13540, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, interesting subject !</td>', 'Great lighting, interesting subject !', '2003-11-30 13:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(499140, 48065, 13540, '<td valign="top">Good idea !</td>', 'Good idea !', '2003-11-30 13:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(499141, 48428, 13540, '<td valign="top">Good idea !</td>', 'Good idea !', '2003-11-30 13:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(499142, 48123, 13540, '<td valign="top">Good idea !</td>', 'Good idea !', '2003-11-30 13:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(499144, 47987, 13540, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting, nice details</td>', 'Interesting lighting, nice details', '2003-11-30 13:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(499145, 48317, 13540, '<td valign="top">Very funny ;-)</td>', 'Very funny ;-)', '2003-11-30 13:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(499147, 48591, 13540, '<td valign="top">Interesting... good idea !</td>', 'Interesting... good idea !', '2003-11-30 13:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(499148, 48639, 13540, '<td valign="top">Nice toning, good idea !</td>', 'Nice toning, good idea !', '2003-11-30 13:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(499149, 48459, 13540, '<td valign="top">Lighting is a bit too strong, but I like the idea</td>', 'Lighting is a bit too strong, but I like the idea', '2003-11-30 13:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(499151, 48662, 14012, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture...I really like the lighting. However, without the title, I had no idea how this fit the challenge. - 5<br/> <br/>*Update* - It''s not your fault I can''t read what the sign says. The smell of a bakery DOES fit the challenge. Bumping to a 10. I really like this photo.</td>', 'Very nice picture...I really like the lighting. However, without the title, I had no idea how this fit the challenge. - 5 *Update* - It''s not your fault I can''t read what the sign says. The smell of a bakery DOES fit the challenge. Bumping to a 10. I really like this photo.', '2003-11-30 13:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(499154, 47869, 14012, '<td valign="top">Seems to be oversharpened. The lighting is a little strong for me as well. 4</td>', 'Seems to be oversharpened. The lighting is a little strong for me as well. 4', '2003-11-30 13:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(499155, 48165, 10145, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo</td>', 'Very nice photo', '2003-11-30 13:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(499157, 48380, 10145, '<td valign="top">Flash is way to harsh here...brightness of flowers detracts from the rest of the picture...</td>', 'Flash is way to harsh here...brightness of flowers detracts from the rest of the picture...', '2003-11-30 13:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(499158, 48649, 10145, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorite popcorn shots of the bunch. the perspective is good but think would have benefited from including the whole bowl in the shot (moved a little to the left)  6</td>', 'This is one of my favorite popcorn shots of the bunch. the perspective is good but think would have benefited from including the whole bowl in the shot (moved a little to the left)  6', '2003-11-30 13:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(499160, 47926, 10145, '<td valign="top">Nice shot! The space from the cigar to the top of the photo tends to isolate and give the cigar its perspective. Good work!</td>', 'Nice shot! The space from the cigar to the top of the photo tends to isolate and give the cigar its perspective. Good work!', '2003-11-30 13:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(499161, 48266, 14012, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of color. This is one of my highest rated of the challenge. Bumping to a 10.</td>', 'Very nice use of color. This is one of my highest rated of the challenge. Bumping to a 10.', '2003-11-30 13:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(499168, 48593, 63, '<td valign="top">Great photo of one of the worst scents on earth - 8</td>', 'Great photo of one of the worst scents on earth - 8', '2003-11-30 13:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(499169, 48597, 12179, '<td valign="top">I can almost smell em....reminds me of the state fair here, always cooking some onions and peppers and makes the air smell so good...</td>', 'I can almost smell em....reminds me of the state fair here, always cooking some onions and peppers and makes the air smell so good...', '2003-11-30 13:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(499170, 48214, 12179, '<td valign="top">OMG! Beautiful!</td>', 'OMG! Beautiful!', '2003-11-30 13:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(499171, 47926, 12179, '<td valign="top">Awwww yeah! Nothin finer than a sweet Cohiba! Nice shot of the stogie, smoke at the top leaves nice space and I can feel the energy of the shot.</td>', 'Awwww yeah! Nothin finer than a sweet Cohiba! Nice shot of the stogie, smoke at the top leaves nice space and I can feel the energy of the shot.', '2003-11-30 13:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(499172, 48585, 12179, '<td valign="top">Sexy, nice shot</td>', 'Sexy, nice shot', '2003-11-30 13:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(499174, 48621, 12179, '<td valign="top">Awesome! This is very pretty and powerful! I can almost smell the rose now! Good work!</td>', 'Awesome! This is very pretty and powerful! I can almost smell the rose now! Good work!', '2003-11-30 13:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(499175, 48123, 12179, '<td valign="top">Is that a cow pie?</td>', 'Is that a cow pie?', '2003-11-30 13:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(499176, 48552, 12179, '<td valign="top">Smells like teen spirit?</td>', 'Smells like teen spirit?', '2003-11-30 13:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(499177, 47817, 12179, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2003-11-30 13:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(499180, 48371, 63, '<td valign="top">Good photo of a mallard, hard to think of scents or aromas when looking at this.</td>', 'Good photo of a mallard, hard to think of scents or aromas when looking at this.', '2003-11-30 13:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(499186, 48407, 7628, '<td valign="top">I do love the smell of pine burning, but this looks accidental - yikes!  I''d rather see pine bows all golden in the fireplace. The green of the pine is a nice brightcolor. I don''t know where the funny pink cast to the cadle and smoke comes from.</td>', 'I do love the smell of pine burning, but this looks accidental - yikes!  I''d rather see pine bows all golden in the fireplace. The green of the pine is a nice brightcolor. I don''t know where the funny pink cast to the cadle and smoke comes from.', '2003-11-30 14:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(499187, 48548, 7628, '<td valign="top">I understand the contrast here, but it looks just like two photos set side by side - no relationship between them.  If they were all in the same frame you could give some meaning through the composition or the lighting.  Each photo is good - though small and hard too see if they are really sharp, and see the details of texture.</td>', 'I understand the contrast here, but it looks just like two photos set side by side - no relationship between them.  If they were all in the same frame you could give some meaning through the composition or the lighting.  Each photo is good - though small and hard too see if they are really sharp, and see the details of texture.', '2003-11-30 14:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(499188, 47985, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice soft lighting, wish it didn''t get so dark in the top corners.  I don''t get any feeling for why the bottles are arranged this way - random?  I wish there were more meaning to the photo - a woman''s arm with drops of perfume on the wrist?  Flowers to represent the scents?</td>', 'Nice soft lighting, wish it didn''t get so dark in the top corners.  I don''t get any feeling for why the bottles are arranged this way - random?  I wish there were more meaning to the photo - a woman''s arm with drops of perfume on the wrist?  Flowers to represent the scents?', '2003-11-30 14:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(499189, 48667, 7628, '<td valign="top">A stong smell, that brings forth many associations - afternoon snack, movie theatres, the circus...I wish this had a cleaner composition.  I like how you include the microwave, but maybe with the popcorn inside framed by the door would be more logical?  Less cluttered.  Here the empty wrapper and the various angles and lines of the counter distract.</td>', 'A stong smell, that brings forth many associations - afternoon snack, movie theatres, the circus...I wish this had a cleaner composition.  I like how you include the microwave, but maybe with the popcorn inside framed by the door would be more logical?  Less cluttered.  Here the empty wrapper and the various angles and lines of the counter distract.', '2003-11-30 14:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(499190, 47886, 7628, '<td valign="top">lovely glowing effect.  I like the diagonal from reflection to stopper with drop of perfume on it.  The atmosphere is full of aroma. 8</td>', 'lovely glowing effect.  I like the diagonal from reflection to stopper with drop of perfume on it.  The atmosphere is full of aroma. 8', '2003-11-30 14:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(499192, 48545, 7628, '<td valign="top">cute idea - contrasting scents all in one frame - two reactions.   Nicely lit, well done effect.  Wish the background were all black (I can see some blue and lines in the drape) and the table is a bit busy.  I love the cat t-shirt, but it distracts from the focus: the face and the reactions to the smell.</td>', 'cute idea - contrasting scents all in one frame - two reactions.   Nicely lit, well done effect.  Wish the background were all black (I can see some blue and lines in the drape) and the table is a bit busy.  I love the cat t-shirt, but it distracts from the focus: the face and the reactions to the smell.', '2003-11-30 14:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(499194, 48536, 7628, '<td valign="top">Great expression, inhaling smell, peaceful.  however the light is too blue and flat.  The picture to dark and flat.  perhaps taking this at a time with more sunlight.</td>', 'Great expression, inhaling smell, peaceful.  however the light is too blue and flat.  The picture to dark and flat.  perhaps taking this at a time with more sunlight.', '2003-11-30 14:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(499198, 47739, 7628, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this.  I like the b/w, I like the reach of the zebra''s neck from the bottom right corner.  The curves of the zebra''s head and neck are mirrored i the wall behind.  I might crop some of the top off, make it a little less busy. 8</td>', 'I keep coming back to this.  I like the b/w, I like the reach of the zebra''s neck from the bottom right corner.  The curves of the zebra''s head and neck are mirrored i the wall behind.  I might crop some of the top off, make it a little less busy. 8', '2003-11-30 14:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(499201, 48165, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice color - golden straw.  Great composition - the woods and field cutting the picture not quite in half - the scattering of bales, and one big one to focus on in the forground. I like the light making dark circles on the ends of the bales. Could the big bale be a bit further into the frame?  More on the 3rds line?  8</td>', 'Nice color - golden straw.  Great composition - the woods and field cutting the picture not quite in half - the scattering of bales, and one big one to focus on in the forground. I like the light making dark circles on the ends of the bales. Could the big bale be a bit further into the frame?  More on the 3rds line?  8', '2003-11-30 15:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(499202, 48437, 7628, '<td valign="top">I love the golden diagonal light - especially how it contrasts with the cold gray trees.  I think you rcould crop out the top bit of sky, and add more of the ground in the foreground.  It would even up the two aspects of this photo that stand out.</td>', 'I love the golden diagonal light - especially how it contrasts with the cold gray trees.  I think you rcould crop out the top bit of sky, and add more of the ground in the foreground.  It would even up the two aspects of this photo that stand out.', '2003-11-30 15:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(499203, 48585, 7628, '<td valign="top">Really wonderful.  The light catches her body just right - wish there were a line of light to indicate her neck.  The spray is well captured.  wish it were darker in the bottom left corner - the detail of the bra/bikini top is a tiny bit distracting. 9</td>', 'Really wonderful.  The light catches her body just right - wish there were a line of light to indicate her neck.  The spray is well captured.  wish it were darker in the bottom left corner - the detail of the bra/bikini top is a tiny bit distracting. 9', '2003-11-30 15:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(499204, 47976, 7628, '<td valign="top">Lovely color and composition.  The narrow DOF makes the petals look like they are stretching to the edges of the picture - dynamic!  Wish the crop wasn''t quite so close on the right, just a little more breathing room for the center of the flower would be better.  Just a bit sharper focus o the flower center? 8</td>', 'Lovely color and composition.  The narrow DOF makes the petals look like they are stretching to the edges of the picture - dynamic!  Wish the crop wasn''t quite so close on the right, just a little more breathing room for the center of the flower would be better.  Just a bit sharper focus o the flower center? 8', '2003-11-30 15:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(499210, 48525, 13223, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo, I can smell the salty air and taste it on my lips</td>', 'Beautiful photo, I can smell the salty air and taste it on my lips', '2003-11-30 15:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(499218, 48578, 2553, '<td valign="top">I am a huge fan of black and white, but am not crazy about it for this shot.  For me, it gives the shot kind of a cold feel, and since, overall, this shot has a somewhat sensuous feel to it, I would prefer the warm skin tones of color.  I love the composition; the negative space aspect is emphasized by some lovely sensuous curves.  I think the appeal of the composition overall is why I am giving you an 8.</td>', 'I am a huge fan of black and white, but am not crazy about it for this shot.  For me, it gives the shot kind of a cold feel, and since, overall, this shot has a somewhat sensuous feel to it, I would prefer the warm skin tones of color.  I love the composition; the negative space aspect is emphasized by some lovely sensuous curves.  I think the appeal of the composition overall is why I am giving you an 8.', '2003-11-30 15:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(499220, 48200, 2553, '<td valign="top">I am a big fan of black and white, coffee, and the wonderful peace that seems to be conveyed by the landscape in your shot.  With all of that, this photo has a lot of appeal to me on many levels!  I would love to have seen a more dynamic composition with the placement of the mug and the spoon, but overall it has a nice tonal range and I like this shot very much.</td>', 'I am a big fan of black and white, coffee, and the wonderful peace that seems to be conveyed by the landscape in your shot.  With all of that, this photo has a lot of appeal to me on many levels!  I would love to have seen a more dynamic composition with the placement of the mug and the spoon, but overall it has a nice tonal range and I like this shot very much.', '2003-11-30 15:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(499221, 48459, 2553, '<td valign="top">You sure hit the nail on the head for an aroma challenge!  This shot is well done and looks like an advertisement.  Love the composition with the bread against a dark backgound instead of shooting it sitting on a table in full light, it really creates a warm, "intimate" shot with no doubt as to what the aroma is.</td>', 'You sure hit the nail on the head for an aroma challenge!  This shot is well done and looks like an advertisement.  Love the composition with the bread against a dark backgound instead of shooting it sitting on a table in full light, it really creates a warm, "intimate" shot with no doubt as to what the aroma is.', '2003-11-30 16:07:26.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(499222, 48550, 2553, '<td valign="top">I figured that there would be lots of coffee shots, and must say that this is nice!  Love the rich colors, and the lovely steam, I can just smell it!  Hmm.. it''s actually making me want a cup of coffee!    Pleasing composition, good lighting, and you conveyed the challenge subject quite well.</td>', 'I figured that there would be lots of coffee shots, and must say that this is nice!  Love the rich colors, and the lovely steam, I can just smell it!  Hmm.. it''s actually making me want a cup of coffee!    Pleasing composition, good lighting, and you conveyed the challenge subject quite well.', '2003-11-30 16:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(499228, 48009, 2553, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot, gets the point of the challenge across exceptionally well, love the black and white and the composition is pleasing, but I would love to have seen some smoke curling all around on the left side to balance the shot a little more.  Not crazy about the drop shadow on the border.</td>', 'Really nice shot, gets the point of the challenge across exceptionally well, love the black and white and the composition is pleasing, but I would love to have seen some smoke curling all around on the left side to balance the shot a little more.  Not crazy about the drop shadow on the border.', '2003-11-30 16:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(499235, 48567, 11295, '<td valign="top">Fantastic capture. I''d like to know how you lit this shot.</td>', 'Fantastic capture. I''d like to know how you lit this shot.', '2003-11-30 16:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(499238, 48550, 11295, '<td valign="top">I love the swirls in the smoke, and the way you''ve captured this mid-pour. The ligting seems a bit harsh in that the glass reflects all sources.</td>', 'I love the swirls in the smoke, and the way you''ve captured this mid-pour. The ligting seems a bit harsh in that the glass reflects all sources.', '2003-11-30 16:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(499239, 47780, 11295, '<td valign="top">I like your use of sepia here. I''d have used a deeper DOF for this, though.</td>', 'I like your use of sepia here. I''d have used a deeper DOF for this, though.', '2003-11-30 16:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(499241, 48440, 11295, '<td valign="top">Cute. :) I think it might have been a better shot if you''d taken it out of the glass though.</td>', 'Cute. :) I think it might have been a better shot if you''d taken it out of the glass though.', '2003-11-30 16:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(499245, 48153, 11295, '<td valign="top">Nice composition on this one, and you nailed the lighting. Great shot.</td>', 'Nice composition on this one, and you nailed the lighting. Great shot.', '2003-11-30 16:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(499248, 47987, 11295, '<td valign="top">Mmmmm... more tate than aroma, I think, but yes, it meets the challenge, and I like your use of colour. I don''t think I''d have had the plate bisect the frame straight down the middle. Less negative space would have been better, I think.</td>', 'Mmmmm... more tate than aroma, I think, but yes, it meets the challenge, and I like your use of colour. I don''t think I''d have had the plate bisect the frame straight down the middle. Less negative space would have been better, I think.', '2003-11-30 16:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(499251, 48437, 11295, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot. The colour is just perfect. Almost has a black and white feel to it, but not. Not sure the smell aspect comes out as much as visuals though, but that''s the only criticism I have.</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot. The colour is just perfect. Almost has a black and white feel to it, but not. Not sure the smell aspect comes out as much as visuals though, but that''s the only criticism I have.', '2003-11-30 16:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(499256, 48541, 11295, '<td valign="top">Although this is a stunning capture, it would have fit better in the "in flight" challenge.</td>', 'Although this is a stunning capture, it would have fit better in the "in flight" challenge.', '2003-11-30 16:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(499257, 48422, 11295, '<td valign="top">I love the angle on this shot. Nicely done.</td>', 'I love the angle on this shot. Nicely done.', '2003-11-30 16:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(499260, 48459, 11295, '<td valign="top">Yum! I would have preferred a different backdrop... something less neutral, like perhaps wood. It would have set this off nicely.</td>', 'Yum! I would have preferred a different backdrop... something less neutral, like perhaps wood. It would have set this off nicely.', '2003-11-30 16:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(499261, 48585, 11295, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture! This really turned out beautifully. Light, composition, the timing of the shot, all great. You get my 10.</td>', 'Excellent capture! This really turned out beautifully. Light, composition, the timing of the shot, all great. You get my 10.', '2003-11-30 16:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(499264, 48083, 11295, '<td valign="top">Blurry, and as a result, hard to look at. Good idea thought and the composition was also well done.</td>', 'Blurry, and as a result, hard to look at. Good idea thought and the composition was also well done.', '2003-11-30 16:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(499270, 48200, 11295, '<td valign="top">Very cool composition, and the black and white really works. Good DOF too. Only criticism is I would have liked to have seen loess of the top boarder, and more of the trees...</td>', 'Very cool composition, and the black and white really works. Good DOF too. Only criticism is I would have liked to have seen loess of the top boarder, and more of the trees...', '2003-11-30 16:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(499275, 47782, 7038, '<td valign="top">This picture would have had more of an impact without the fence which acts as a distraction in my opinion, maybe you oculd have held the camera up over it?  Also there is no clear focal point here what draws my eye, the foreground seems to blend into the background.  Nice shade of green however. 5</td>', 'This picture would have had more of an impact without the fence which acts as a distraction in my opinion, maybe you oculd have held the camera up over it?  Also there is no clear focal point here what draws my eye, the foreground seems to blend into the background.  Nice shade of green however. 5', '2003-11-30 16:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(499276, 48642, 11895, '<td valign="top">well done image but why B/W?</td>', 'well done image but why B/W?', '2003-11-30 16:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(499277, 48663, 11895, '<td valign="top">cropped too tight on the bottom, the light spot on the background on the right just below the green bud is a distraction</td>', 'cropped too tight on the bottom, the light spot on the background on the right just below the green bud is a distraction', '2003-11-30 16:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(499279, 48549, 11895, '<td valign="top">I think I would have cropped this closer to put more emphasis on the popcorn</td>', 'I think I would have cropped this closer to put more emphasis on the popcorn', '2003-11-30 17:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(499280, 48299, 11895, '<td valign="top">just a bit oversharpened</td>', 'just a bit oversharpened', '2003-11-30 17:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(499284, 48600, 13282, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  After the challenge is over, I would see if there is any way to avoid some of the glare on the cannister so that the beans are clearer.</td>', 'Nice shot.  After the challenge is over, I would see if there is any way to avoid some of the glare on the cannister so that the beans are clearer.', '2003-11-30 17:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(499285, 48659, 13282, '<td valign="top">This is unfortunately a true depiction of our environment.  The haze that prevents clarity of the factory makes a strong statement.  I like the contrast between that and the green of nature in the front.</td>', 'This is unfortunately a true depiction of our environment.  The haze that prevents clarity of the factory makes a strong statement.  I like the contrast between that and the green of nature in the front.', '2003-11-30 17:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(499287, 48437, 13282, '<td valign="top">The colours are amazing.  The trees look so stark.  Very nice. However, I am not sure if you were trying to focus on just one or the whole lot.  They are a bit blurry.</td>', 'The colours are amazing.  The trees look so stark.  Very nice. However, I am not sure if you were trying to focus on just one or the whole lot.  They are a bit blurry.', '2003-11-30 17:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(499289, 47777, 13282, '<td valign="top">I like the glowing effect you put in this shot.  It''s almost like you can see the aroma.</td>', 'I like the glowing effect you put in this shot.  It''s almost like you can see the aroma.', '2003-11-30 17:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(499290, 48567, 13282, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!  I love the steam coming from the top.  The colours are very nice, and the way the light is shining onto the picture is great.  The only little thing that I would change is the drop at the top of the mug.  Great job!</td>', 'Gorgeous!  I love the steam coming from the top.  The colours are very nice, and the way the light is shining onto the picture is great.  The only little thing that I would change is the drop at the top of the mug.  Great job!', '2003-11-30 17:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(499292, 48462, 13282, '<td valign="top">Very scary...reminders of childhood Buckley''s experiences.  The angle you took it at is a reminder of the way the dreaded spoon looks as it is coming towards one''s mouth.  It brings anticipation.  Good job!</td>', 'Very scary...reminders of childhood Buckley''s experiences.  The angle you took it at is a reminder of the way the dreaded spoon looks as it is coming towards one''s mouth.  It brings anticipation.  Good job!', '2003-11-30 17:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(499293, 48056, 3295, '<td valign="top">I love the table, love the cinnamon, but yuck - that is the ugliest, saddest, knarliest garlic I''ve ever seen and I think it hurts the photo, also the reflections and hot spots are harsh.  But Love that cinnamon!  Good Photo though nice DOF</td>', 'I love the table, love the cinnamon, but yuck - that is the ugliest, saddest, knarliest garlic I''ve ever seen and I think it hurts the photo, also the reflections and hot spots are harsh.  But Love that cinnamon!  Good Photo though nice DOF', '2003-11-30 17:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(499296, 48526, 13282, '<td valign="top">Who doesn''t like the smell of new crayons?  I like the one broken one.  It adds a bit of something different.  I am unsure as to whether you wanted the shadows in there, but perhaps you could shine the light from a different angle to get truer colours.</td>', 'Who doesn''t like the smell of new crayons?  I like the one broken one.  It adds a bit of something different.  I am unsure as to whether you wanted the shadows in there, but perhaps you could shine the light from a different angle to get truer colours.', '2003-11-30 17:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
