(499670, 48549, 7711, '<td valign="top">why the coloured background? I think the shape and texture of the popcorn is interesting enough to have gotten in close to it and really put that in our face without any extraneous features to the shot, like the coloured mats.</td>', 'why the coloured background? I think the shape and texture of the popcorn is interesting enough to have gotten in close to it and really put that in our face without any extraneous features to the shot, like the coloured mats.', '2003-12-01 02:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
