(500173, 48585, 8530, '<td valign="top">Wow, nice shot. Okay, a little gratuitous on the cleavage there maybe (I mean, your lighting could have been a little further up) but I can live with that. Very much looks like commercial art, even if I suspect commercial art would tend to focus a bit more on the bottle than the model. Although you never know. I really like the lighting overall, despite the cleavage comment.</td>', 'Wow, nice shot. Okay, a little gratuitous on the cleavage there maybe (I mean, your lighting could have been a little further up) but I can live with that. Very much looks like commercial art, even if I suspect commercial art would tend to focus a bit more on the bottle than the model. Although you never know. I really like the lighting overall, despite the cleavage comment.', '2003-12-01 14:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(500174, 47764, 8530, '<td valign="top">No, I''m afraid I can''t smell that.<br/> <br/>I''m presuming this may be one of those pun thingies?</td>', 'No, I''m afraid I can''t smell that. I''m presuming this may be one of those pun thingies?', '2003-12-01 14:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
