(500209, 48083, 8530, '<td valign="top">Really, uncut onions don''t have that much of a scent.<br/> <br/>I''m going to assume the apparent blur is deliberate, a soft focus sort of thing, seeing as how challenge overlapped this one and all. It''s sort of interesting, although I suspect I would find it more so if the onions were on a somewhat more kitcheny or cuisine-related background; I don''t normally find onions on velvet. A basket, maybe (possibly atop the current backdrop), or even if the onions had been strung together as they sometimse are... as is, it''s sort of unsatisfyingly overly arty.</td>', 'Really, uncut onions don''t have that much of a scent. I''m going to assume the apparent blur is deliberate, a soft focus sort of thing, seeing as how challenge overlapped this one and all. It''s sort of interesting, although I suspect I would find it more so if the onions were on a somewhat more kitcheny or cuisine-related background; I don''t normally find onions on velvet. A basket, maybe (possibly atop the current backdrop), or even if the onions had been strung together as they sometimse are... as is, it''s sort of unsatisfyingly overly arty.', '2003-12-01 14:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
