(500527, 48562, 5158, '<td valign="top">Of all garlic images I like yours most: technically very well done and of the red color it is very dynamic. Cropping and framing are well made too. Good luck!</td>', 'Of all garlic images I like yours most: technically very well done and of the red color it is very dynamic. Cropping and framing are well made too. Good luck!', '2003-12-01 18:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(500528, 47912, 5158, '<td valign="top">A very strong image! Like a painting! The eyes and half-opened mouth of the women as-well-as the man''s absent expression are simply great. Also the cropping is very well done. However, somehow something is missing technically to make this picture a winner image IMO. But I have to admitt that I don\''t know what. Maybe it\''s just a frame so the image does not get lost on the browser page.</td>', 'A very strong image! Like a painting! The eyes and half-opened mouth of the women as-well-as the man''s absent expression are simply great. Also the cropping is very well done. However, somehow something is missing technically to make this picture a winner image IMO. But I have to admitt that I don\''t know what. Maybe it\''s just a frame so the image does not get lost on the browser page.', '2003-12-01 18:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(500555, 48433, 12151, '<td valign="top">This would have looked cooler if your cropped out the upper portion of smoke, I think.</td>', 'This would have looked cooler if your cropped out the upper portion of smoke, I think.', '2003-12-01 18:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
