(500902, 48663, 14404, '<td valign="top">Great Shot-just the right amount of light</td>', 'Great Shot-just the right amount of light', '2003-12-02 05:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(500931, 48576, 8125, '<td valign="top">Composition and lighting are good.  This looks almost like an ad in a magazine.  Definately applies to a scents and aromas challenge.  The frame / border is good - I think it adds to the image.  I like the ''woman shaped'' bottle in the background - excellent idea.  My only pick is that the Calvin Klein bottle appears ever so slightly tilted in the frame.  Nice Work  :-)</td>', 'Composition and lighting are good.  This looks almost like an ad in a magazine.  Definately applies to a scents and aromas challenge.  The frame / border is good - I think it adds to the image.  I like the ''woman shaped'' bottle in the background - excellent idea.  My only pick is that the Calvin Klein bottle appears ever so slightly tilted in the frame.  Nice Work  :-)', '2003-12-02 07:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(500932, 48248, 8125, '<td valign="top">The glare from the glasses is distracting... you might try bouncing the light next time - it looks like it might be pointing right at the glasses from the side or above?  Since you have a glass lying down in the background, it might have helped to shoot this at a bit higher of an angle.  There is a bit of grain as well, that might have been from adjusting the color balances too much?  Over all nice idea, but I think if you play with the lighting a bit, you might find better results.  Since it appears to be breakfast food, how about trying this in some natural light...</td>', 'The glare from the glasses is distracting... you might try bouncing the light next time - it looks like it might be pointing right at the glasses from the side or above?  Since you have a glass lying down in the background, it might have helped to shoot this at a bit higher of an angle.  There is a bit of grain as well, that might have been from adjusting the color balances too much?  Over all nice idea, but I think if you play with the lighting a bit, you might find better results.  Since it appears to be breakfast food, how about trying this in some natural light...', '2003-12-02 07:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(500935, 48665, 8125, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept for the challenge.  I can make out lemon, lime, red onion - but if there is any other type of food, I can''t determine what it is.  You have some distracting glares on the bowl.</td>', 'Interesting concept for the challenge.  I can make out lemon, lime, red onion - but if there is any other type of food, I can''t determine what it is.  You have some distracting glares on the bowl.', '2003-12-02 07:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(500939, 48566, 8125, '<td valign="top">An adorable kitten - and he does have a look on his face like it stinks.  You might have tried cropping a bit tighter on the left to take out that carpet.  It seems a tad bit of detail is lost in the kittens face, maybe a slight sharpen would have helped? This isn''t a shot that can easily be redone and capture that look though.  :-)</td>', 'An adorable kitten - and he does have a look on his face like it stinks.  You might have tried cropping a bit tighter on the left to take out that carpet.  It seems a tad bit of detail is lost in the kittens face, maybe a slight sharpen would have helped? This isn''t a shot that can easily be redone and capture that look though.  :-)', '2003-12-02 07:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(500943, 47851, 8125, '<td valign="top">I still remember this scent from my Grandfather.  I like your subject, but it would be better if the slight line of glare could have been eliminated.  I wonder if it would have helped to bounce the light?  I like the shadow the bottle casts.</td>', 'I still remember this scent from my Grandfather.  I like your subject, but it would be better if the slight line of glare could have been eliminated.  I wonder if it would have helped to bounce the light?  I like the shadow the bottle casts.', '2003-12-02 07:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(500945, 48083, 8125, '<td valign="top">These definately have a strong scent!  I think this shot could have been improved by better focus, possibly a sharpen.  It would have been better on a solid surface or in a basket maybe.... Lighting seems good.</td>', 'These definately have a strong scent!  I think this shot could have been improved by better focus, possibly a sharpen.  It would have been better on a solid surface or in a basket maybe.... Lighting seems good.', '2003-12-02 07:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(500948, 48630, 8125, '<td valign="top">I''m sure these berries are aromatic - what do they smell like when on the plant?  What kind of berries are they?  I can''t ''imagine'' a scent with this shot.  Your depth of field is bit off, I think it would be better with the clump of berries in the center as your clear focus and all sides around it fading back.  You might try a slight sharpen as well.</td>', 'I''m sure these berries are aromatic - what do they smell like when on the plant?  What kind of berries are they?  I can''t ''imagine'' a scent with this shot.  Your depth of field is bit off, I think it would be better with the clump of berries in the center as your clear focus and all sides around it fading back.  You might try a slight sharpen as well.', '2003-12-02 08:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(500953, 48153, 8125, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture of the smoke, with all the recent forum discussion about it, it doesn''t seem easy.  Your coloring seems off, there appears to be some grain that results from a lot of hue/saturation or color adjusting.</td>', 'Excellent capture of the smoke, with all the recent forum discussion about it, it doesn''t seem easy.  Your coloring seems off, there appears to be some grain that results from a lot of hue/saturation or color adjusting.', '2003-12-02 08:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(500958, 48637, 8125, '<td valign="top">Candles are tough for a scents/aromas challenge - especially since I don''t know the scent... looking at this image, I can''t imagine what I should be smelling.  I like the Pine branches around it, and the way they are highlighted by the candle glow.  There just isn''t a lot holding my interest.</td>', 'Candles are tough for a scents/aromas challenge - especially since I don''t know the scent... looking at this image, I can''t imagine what I should be smelling.  I like the Pine branches around it, and the way they are highlighted by the candle glow.  There just isn''t a lot holding my interest.', '2003-12-02 08:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(500963, 48610, 8125, '<td valign="top">yuck, I\''m glad breakfast is still a few hours away... <br/> <br/>This image is plagued by some focus issues, it might have helped to sharpen it.  I like your composition and lighting is good.</td>', 'yuck, I\''m glad breakfast is still a few hours away...  This image is plagued by some focus issues, it might have helped to sharpen it.  I like your composition and lighting is good.', '2003-12-02 08:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(500967, 48549, 8125, '<td valign="top">I do love popcorn - I like your background, the colors really add interest.  Nice composition...</td>', 'I do love popcorn - I like your background, the colors really add interest.  Nice composition...', '2003-12-02 08:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(500973, 48548, 8125, '<td valign="top">I really had to look at this for a long time to figure out how you did it - but I think I''ve got it - one side is a picture placed next to the other?  Your lighting is different on each one.  The perfume one seems like a little too much light and the onion/garlic seems like not quite enough when right next to the other.  I''m not a big fan of either background.  Interesting idea for the challenge though!</td>', 'I really had to look at this for a long time to figure out how you did it - but I think I''ve got it - one side is a picture placed next to the other?  Your lighting is different on each one.  The perfume one seems like a little too much light and the onion/garlic seems like not quite enough when right next to the other.  I''m not a big fan of either background.  Interesting idea for the challenge though!', '2003-12-02 08:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(500976, 47764, 8125, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry - but this doesn''t work for me - there isn''t much holding my interest.  Not a fan of your background, and you might have tried cropping so the light doesn''t fade as much on the sides.</td>', 'I''m sorry - but this doesn''t work for me - there isn''t much holding my interest.  Not a fan of your background, and you might have tried cropping so the light doesn''t fade as much on the sides.', '2003-12-02 08:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(500979, 48617, 8125, '<td valign="top">I am a big fan of dogs, so when they fit the challenge - way cool!  In this case it does fit the challenge, but your lighting (seems it is a post processing issue to remove something in the background?) is so harsh it blows out any bit of detail and interest in this shot.</td>', 'I am a big fan of dogs, so when they fit the challenge - way cool!  In this case it does fit the challenge, but your lighting (seems it is a post processing issue to remove something in the background?) is so harsh it blows out any bit of detail and interest in this shot.', '2003-12-02 08:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(500984, 47936, 8125, '<td valign="top">This shot might have been better had you used a dark background and tried to capture the smoke from the incense stick.  Also, I think you should have concentrated on just showing the incense, the image seems a bit ''cluttered'' to me.</td>', 'This shot might have been better had you used a dark background and tried to capture the smoke from the incense stick.  Also, I think you should have concentrated on just showing the incense, the image seems a bit ''cluttered'' to me.', '2003-12-02 08:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(500986, 48670, 8125, '<td valign="top">A bit flat on interest - not a big fan of the background and it looks like it could be sharpened a bit...</td>', 'A bit flat on interest - not a big fan of the background and it looks like it could be sharpened a bit...', '2003-12-02 08:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(500987, 48480, 8125, '<td valign="top">So far my favorite of the challenge.  Composition, lighting - excellent!  Love the capture of the spray - I can almost feel the mist on my skin.  I see a ribbon for this one.  :-)</td>', 'So far my favorite of the challenge.  Composition, lighting - excellent!  Love the capture of the spray - I can almost feel the mist on my skin.  I see a ribbon for this one.  :-)', '2003-12-02 08:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(500989, 48642, 8125, '<td valign="top">A well captured shot.  Really like your composition and use of black and white.  Lighting seems good as well.  Nice job!!  :-)</td>', 'A well captured shot.  Really like your composition and use of black and white.  Lighting seems good as well.  Nice job!!  :-)', '2003-12-02 08:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(500995, 47780, 8125, '<td valign="top">Good idea to use cookies.  I think this would be better with the focus on the whole cookie at the bottom left side.  The frame is a bit too much and it seems like there is more on the right side than the left.</td>', 'Good idea to use cookies.  I think this would be better with the focus on the whole cookie at the bottom left side.  The frame is a bit too much and it seems like there is more on the right side than the left.', '2003-12-02 08:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(500998, 48448, 8125, '<td valign="top">A very good idea, and a great looking red pepper!  Your lighting is too harsh though, especially with a white background and white garlic.  It might have been better with a black background?  The white, red and silver would have stood out more I think.</td>', 'A very good idea, and a great looking red pepper!  Your lighting is too harsh though, especially with a white background and white garlic.  It might have been better with a black background?  The white, red and silver would have stood out more I think.', '2003-12-02 08:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(501001, 48367, 8231, '<td valign="top">powerful imagery...   I like the way the soldier stands out against the shadows...  the image could possibly be a tad sharper, but perhaps that would change the effect...  great photo!</td>', 'powerful imagery...   I like the way the soldier stands out against the shadows...  the image could possibly be a tad sharper, but perhaps that would change the effect...  great photo!', '2003-12-02 08:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(501002, 48037, 8125, '<td valign="top">Great image...  Nice lighting and composition, my only pick is that I wish the whole ring were in the shot...</td>', 'Great image...  Nice lighting and composition, my only pick is that I wish the whole ring were in the shot...', '2003-12-02 08:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(501005, 48546, 8231, '<td valign="top">I suspect this shot may not score as high as some others, but I think it captures the theme very well.  The shot is technically well-done and no one ever said a photograph had to be "pretty" to be "good".   Very nice!</td>', 'I suspect this shot may not score as high as some others, but I think it captures the theme very well.  The shot is technically well-done and no one ever said a photograph had to be "pretty" to be "good".   Very nice!', '2003-12-02 08:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(501006, 47982, 8125, '<td valign="top">Wow - very nicely done!  Love the lighting, composition, color... excellent!</td>', 'Wow - very nicely done!  Love the lighting, composition, color... excellent!', '2003-12-02 08:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(501007, 47927, 8125, '<td valign="top">I love this rose shot.  One of the best I''ve seen so far in the challenges here.  I''m not a big fan of the border/framing, but that''s more of a personal choice  :-)  Nice work!</td>', 'I love this rose shot.  One of the best I''ve seen so far in the challenges here.  I''m not a big fan of the border/framing, but that''s more of a personal choice  :-)  Nice work!', '2003-12-02 08:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(501008, 48655, 8125, '<td valign="top">I imagine the smell of burning leaves is what this image portrays.  In the Phoenix area we don''t really have falling leaves or the need to get rid of them... is that what you do?  I always pictured lots of garbage bags full of leaves  :-)  Your light is a bit harsh on the leaves and takes out some detail of the color.  I do like the capture of smoke.</td>', 'I imagine the smell of burning leaves is what this image portrays.  In the Phoenix area we don''t really have falling leaves or the need to get rid of them... is that what you do?  I always pictured lots of garbage bags full of leaves  :-)  Your light is a bit harsh on the leaves and takes out some detail of the color.  I do like the capture of smoke.', '2003-12-02 08:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(501009, 48620, 8125, '<td valign="top">I really like your idea here.  The only thing I can suggest is maybe try this using a black background?  I think the yellow background blends too much with your subjects.</td>', 'I really like your idea here.  The only thing I can suggest is maybe try this using a black background?  I think the yellow background blends too much with your subjects.', '2003-12-02 08:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(501011, 48585, 8125, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Love the lighting, composition and use of black and white.  Excellent work  :-)</td>', 'Beautiful!  Love the lighting, composition and use of black and white.  Excellent work  :-)', '2003-12-02 08:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(501013, 48428, 8125, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what kind of scent or aroma the leaves have... I wish the leaves had more color....</td>', 'I''m not sure what kind of scent or aroma the leaves have... I wish the leaves had more color....', '2003-12-02 08:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(501014, 47818, 8125, '<td valign="top">I can see what the subject is ''supposed'' to be, but the towel(?) has ended up being the focus of my attention in this shot.</td>', 'I can see what the subject is ''supposed'' to be, but the towel(?) has ended up being the focus of my attention in this shot.', '2003-12-02 08:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(501017, 48660, 8125, '<td valign="top">I really like this image and idea for the challenge.  I only wish it was on a darker background so the whites of the candy didn''t get washed out.  I love the sprig of peppermint also.  Excellent composition.</td>', 'I really like this image and idea for the challenge.  I only wish it was on a darker background so the whites of the candy didn''t get washed out.  I love the sprig of peppermint also.  Excellent composition.', '2003-12-02 08:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(501027, 48541, 12733, '<td valign="top">Is the bird smelling something, or does the bird smell? I''m not sure of the relevance, but it''s a great shot, and that''s what really counts.</td>', 'Is the bird smelling something, or does the bird smell? I''m not sure of the relevance, but it''s a great shot, and that''s what really counts.', '2003-12-02 09:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(501029, 47982, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very interesting effects. I hope you''ll share how it was done after the challenge is over.</td>', 'Very interesting effects. I hope you''ll share how it was done after the challenge is over.', '2003-12-02 09:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(501031, 48575, 12733, '<td valign="top">What a gorgeous closeup. Is the water natural or sprayed?</td>', 'What a gorgeous closeup. Is the water natural or sprayed?', '2003-12-02 09:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(501038, 48618, 12733, '<td valign="top">As this image gardually appeared on the screen, I really liked the  tight shot of popcorn. Then the long expanse of table appeared, and the popcorn really seemed dimineshed. I would have liked a very tight corp on the edges of the microwave and the front kernel of popcorn, without the empty sides or foreground.</td>', 'As this image gardually appeared on the screen, I really liked the  tight shot of popcorn. Then the long expanse of table appeared, and the popcorn really seemed dimineshed. I would have liked a very tight corp on the edges of the microwave and the front kernel of popcorn, without the empty sides or foreground.', '2003-12-02 09:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(501041, 48248, 12733, '<td valign="top">I think the candles tend to dominate the picture too much, leaving the food without detail and hard to see.</td>', 'I think the candles tend to dominate the picture too much, leaving the food without detail and hard to see.', '2003-12-02 09:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(501044, 48639, 12733, '<td valign="top">This really gets the feeling of the smell of coffee across well.</td>', 'This really gets the feeling of the smell of coffee across well.', '2003-12-02 09:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(501054, 47976, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very pretty closeup. Maybe a bit more depth of field to bring the forward petals into focus would improve it.</td>', 'Very pretty closeup. Maybe a bit more depth of field to bring the forward petals into focus would improve it.', '2003-12-02 09:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(501058, 48315, 12733, '<td valign="top">The candle implies warm light; the blue and green elements deny it. I like the composition a lot, though.</td>', 'The candle implies warm light; the blue and green elements deny it. I like the composition a lot, though.', '2003-12-02 09:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(501064, 47854, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement, and very effective lighting.</td>', 'Nice arrangement, and very effective lighting.', '2003-12-02 09:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(501067, 47739, 12733, '<td valign="top">Beautiful clarity, very pretty shot.</td>', 'Beautiful clarity, very pretty shot.', '2003-12-02 09:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(501069, 47912, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice use of closeup and low contrast to make a point.</td>', 'Nice use of closeup and low contrast to make a point.', '2003-12-02 09:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(501070, 48569, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice use of props to suggest a person.</td>', 'Nice use of props to suggest a person.', '2003-12-02 09:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(501073, 48536, 13759, '<td valign="top">I saw it a little underexposed. But a great idea.</td>', 'I saw it a little underexposed. But a great idea.', '2003-12-02 09:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
