(501118, 47987, 8891, '<td valign="top">Made these with butter? tastes great but for photography it might have been better to use butter flavored crisco and they might be less glossy.</td>', 'Made these with butter? tastes great but for photography it might have been better to use butter flavored crisco and they might be less glossy.', '2003-12-02 10:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(501119, 48154, 8891, '<td valign="top">Jeez you went through a lot for this, but the composition is weak because of the centering of th curry powder....otherwise wonderful</td>', 'Jeez you went through a lot for this, but the composition is weak because of the centering of th curry powder....otherwise wonderful', '2003-12-02 10:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(501139, 48567, 13610, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot!!</td>', 'Excellent shot!!', '2003-12-02 11:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(501180, 48641, 5070, '<td valign="top">That''s a unique shot -- when I checked the full size I wasn''t expecting to actually SEE the quail.</td>', 'That''s a unique shot -- when I checked the full size I wasn''t expecting to actually SEE the quail.', '2003-12-02 12:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(501205, 48552, 5913, '<td valign="top">You''re so silly!  Imaginative...</td>', 'You''re so silly!  Imaginative...', '2003-12-02 13:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(501206, 48462, 5913, '<td valign="top">I would like to see the reaction of a person taking this...</td>', 'I would like to see the reaction of a person taking this...', '2003-12-02 13:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(501222, 48367, 6008, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming from the title that this is a soldier, perhaps. The image itself is a little small and so a lot of the details are lost. It is always good to use the full 640 pixels on the longest side. I''m not really sure what to make of it. I can tell it''s a person, but other than that not much. I do like the shadows on the floor. I also, thankfully, do not have a personal reference for the smell in the title.</td>', 'I''m assuming from the title that this is a soldier, perhaps. The image itself is a little small and so a lot of the details are lost. It is always good to use the full 640 pixels on the longest side. I''m not really sure what to make of it. I can tell it''s a person, but other than that not much. I do like the shadows on the floor. I also, thankfully, do not have a personal reference for the smell in the title.', '2003-12-02 13:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(501225, 48655, 6008, '<td valign="top">I havent seen this type of setup with fall leaves before (and there have been a lot of falls leaves recently), and so I think that adds a refreshing change and interest to the shot. The smoke is good, nicely thick, clearly seen, and with a nice texture, almost like silk. I feel the leaves are cropped a little too tightly and dont show the ''whole'' picture, as it were. The small pile is good and the crop on the sides to make it a vertical shot is good, but the big red leaf has lost the tip and that''s what I''m referring to concerning the crop. It''s different so I like it.</td>', 'I havent seen this type of setup with fall leaves before (and there have been a lot of falls leaves recently), and so I think that adds a refreshing change and interest to the shot. The smoke is good, nicely thick, clearly seen, and with a nice texture, almost like silk. I feel the leaves are cropped a little too tightly and dont show the ''whole'' picture, as it were. The small pile is good and the crop on the sides to make it a vertical shot is good, but the big red leaf has lost the tip and that''s what I''m referring to concerning the crop. It''s different so I like it.', '2003-12-02 13:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(501229, 48516, 6008, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what it is but it looks interesting. I like how the foreground bottle is well lit and the details can be seen clearly. The blue bottle adds some color and interest, not sure if they are connected or not, but they go well together. Not a fan of the flame, but they are so difficult to photograph well. I''m not sure what I dont like about it, probably because it looks like a big white blob. Even so, it''s a good image.</td>', 'I''m not sure what it is but it looks interesting. I like how the foreground bottle is well lit and the details can be seen clearly. The blue bottle adds some color and interest, not sure if they are connected or not, but they go well together. Not a fan of the flame, but they are so difficult to photograph well. I''m not sure what I dont like about it, probably because it looks like a big white blob. Even so, it''s a good image.', '2003-12-02 13:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(501236, 48442, 6008, '<td valign="top">This meets the challenge, sure, but I think the main focus of the flower/scent is kinda lost by the fact it seems it''s an image of two friends smiling at the camera. By that i mean when I look at this I dont immediately associate it with the flower or any scents/aromas. The shot itself is ok, it doesnt grab me but I dont dislike it either.</td>', 'This meets the challenge, sure, but I think the main focus of the flower/scent is kinda lost by the fact it seems it''s an image of two friends smiling at the camera. By that i mean when I look at this I dont immediately associate it with the flower or any scents/aromas. The shot itself is ok, it doesnt grab me but I dont dislike it either.', '2003-12-02 13:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(501239, 48266, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like the angle on this, it really lets the aroma float up as if I was about to sniff and taste the wine. At first I thought that it seemed an odd composition, but it has a great feeling of familiarity and a natural look, if that makes sense. The colors are good, the lighting is atmospheric with no obviously bad reflections. I was wanting the label facing rather than being away, but I think I prefer it this way now as it doesnt become a distraction. I like it.</td>', 'I like the angle on this, it really lets the aroma float up as if I was about to sniff and taste the wine. At first I thought that it seemed an odd composition, but it has a great feeling of familiarity and a natural look, if that makes sense. The colors are good, the lighting is atmospheric with no obviously bad reflections. I was wanting the label facing rather than being away, but I think I prefer it this way now as it doesnt become a distraction. I like it.', '2003-12-02 13:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(501246, 48609, 6008, '<td valign="top">Ewww garlic! The dof is good, as is the lighting. Exposure is excellent. Composition is wonderful, and I like the background bulb filling up the space in the background. The texture is good, and the image is nicely sharp where it needs to be. Professional-looking shot, well done.</td>', 'Ewww garlic! The dof is good, as is the lighting. Exposure is excellent. Composition is wonderful, and I like the background bulb filling up the space in the background. The texture is good, and the image is nicely sharp where it needs to be. Professional-looking shot, well done.', '2003-12-02 13:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(501254, 48621, 6008, '<td valign="top">The petal is a little close to the right edge and with your choice of border it actually overlaps and gives the same feeling as if it that been cropped out completely. The green gives it a sense of depth on the bush, but I think with it being slightly off center in a vertical shot that it may have been better to lose the green and get really close in on the rose. Another reason a closer angle would be better is because I think the greens are a little washed out color-wise. The petals are a little soft, but I think that adds a mood, and I do like the mix of colors of the rose itself.</td>', 'The petal is a little close to the right edge and with your choice of border it actually overlaps and gives the same feeling as if it that been cropped out completely. The green gives it a sense of depth on the bush, but I think with it being slightly off center in a vertical shot that it may have been better to lose the green and get really close in on the rose. Another reason a closer angle would be better is because I think the greens are a little washed out color-wise. The petals are a little soft, but I think that adds a mood, and I do like the mix of colors of the rose itself.', '2003-12-02 13:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(501259, 48320, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like the blue tone of the metal on the left wing, but underneath it appears so dark that I''m not sure what it is. Because it is so dark it only really adds as a distraction. The right wing has also disappeared at the bottom. The subject is an interesting one, and the area that is lit by the candle is good. Looking at the reflection on the votive I''m wondering if this was lit by a computer monitor hence the blue glow. A few things you could try - use another two candles on the left and right either behind or off to the sides of the holder to illuminate the wings and below. If you were going specifically for the blue glow, which I dont blame you as I like it, you could try two (or even one) small flashlight with blue cellophane or a gel on it. It''s a good shot, but I think if you play around with it you can get some really great images from it.</td>', 'I like the blue tone of the metal on the left wing, but underneath it appears so dark that I''m not sure what it is. Because it is so dark it only really adds as a distraction. The right wing has also disappeared at the bottom. The subject is an interesting one, and the area that is lit by the candle is good. Looking at the reflection on the votive I''m wondering if this was lit by a computer monitor hence the blue glow. A few things you could try - use another two candles on the left and right either behind or off to the sides of the holder to illuminate the wings and below. If you were going specifically for the blue glow, which I dont blame you as I like it, you could try two (or even one) small flashlight with blue cellophane or a gel on it. It''s a good shot, but I think if you play around with it you can get some really great images from it.', '2003-12-02 14:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(501270, 48628, 9906, '<td valign="top">I like what you are trying to do here but it''s very grainy and in this instance I don''t think it really helps.  Love the reflection in the lid!<br/>TC</td>', 'I like what you are trying to do here but it''s very grainy and in this instance I don''t think it really helps.  Love the reflection in the lid!TC', '2003-12-02 14:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(501271, 48169, 14627, '<td valign="top">nice subject,i like the contrast of the colours. i would use a real rose next time, but the light is very good</td>', 'nice subject,i like the contrast of the colours. i would use a real rose next time, but the light is very good', '2003-12-02 14:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(501272, 48030, 9906, '<td valign="top">If the smoke was a little more prominent this would be a GREAT shot!  Love the character of the character!<br/>TC</td>', 'If the smoke was a little more prominent this would be a GREAT shot!  Love the character of the character!TC', '2003-12-02 14:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(501276, 47982, 7758, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot..... not sure what you have done with the yellow streaks of light but it looks good and adds a sense of movement and flow to the image.</td>', 'Lovely shot..... not sure what you have done with the yellow streaks of light but it looks good and adds a sense of movement and flow to the image.', '2003-12-02 14:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(501277, 48639, 14627, '<td valign="top">really like black and white pictures.nice click with the smoke coming out of the cup.it reminds me every day''s wake up.</td>', 'really like black and white pictures.nice click with the smoke coming out of the cup.it reminds me every day''s wake up.', '2003-12-02 14:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(501278, 48567, 7758, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I can almost smell the coffee..... good work to get the steam rising from the cup too.</td>', 'Nice shot, I can almost smell the coffee..... good work to get the steam rising from the cup too.', '2003-12-02 14:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(501279, 48480, 7758, '<td valign="top">good work, I like this shot but there are a couple of things I would maybe consider for next time.... I think it would be worthwhile, if possible, to use a woman''s hand to hold the purfume. I know that the idea is that you are spraying the purfume to remind yourself of her.... in that case... clean your fingernails... it is quite distracting and takes something away from the shot (in my opinion of course).  Now this is nit-pick I know, but do something about the hangnail too..... it is only really minor things but I think they make the difference between a good and a great shot.....<br/>Good Luck, Todd.</td>', 'good work, I like this shot but there are a couple of things I would maybe consider for next time.... I think it would be worthwhile, if possible, to use a woman''s hand to hold the purfume. I know that the idea is that you are spraying the purfume to remind yourself of her.... in that case... clean your fingernails... it is quite distracting and takes something away from the shot (in my opinion of course).  Now this is nit-pick I know, but do something about the hangnail too..... it is only really minor things but I think they make the difference between a good and a great shot.....Good Luck, Todd.', '2003-12-02 14:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(501283, 48601, 6008, '<td valign="top">Not sure if you put the border at the bottom to eventually add some text but without the text (which isnt allowed on DPC) it looks kinda odd. The image itself is slightly blurry, possibly due to low lighting. The angle of the basket doesnt really add anything and so I think it would have been better straight. Cropping it so it has the same amount of space on either side would help with balancing up the image too. It does an ample job of depicting a scent/aroma.</td>', 'Not sure if you put the border at the bottom to eventually add some text but without the text (which isnt allowed on DPC) it looks kinda odd. The image itself is slightly blurry, possibly due to low lighting. The angle of the basket doesnt really add anything and so I think it would have been better straight. Cropping it so it has the same amount of space on either side would help with balancing up the image too. It does an ample job of depicting a scent/aroma.', '2003-12-02 14:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(501285, 48374, 6008, '<td valign="top">Never seen, used, or smelt a stink bomb so no personal reference here. The colors are interesting and it''s certainly very abstract. Within the context of a scent/aroma challenge I could envision a scent coming from this. I dont see any areas where you could improve on it.</td>', 'Never seen, used, or smelt a stink bomb so no personal reference here. The colors are interesting and it''s certainly very abstract. Within the context of a scent/aroma challenge I could envision a scent coming from this. I dont see any areas where you could improve on it.', '2003-12-02 15:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(501288, 48444, 6008, '<td valign="top">Not sure if there is a story there with the title and the type of paper that''s burning, but it sounds expensive. The composition is good, no bad reflections on the chrome/metal disk (which is good), although I think the edge may be cropped a little too close. The lighting is good, especially on the smoke, which I understand to be a difficult thing to photograph correctly. It''s a good shot.</td>', 'Not sure if there is a story there with the title and the type of paper that''s burning, but it sounds expensive. The composition is good, no bad reflections on the chrome/metal disk (which is good), although I think the edge may be cropped a little too close. The lighting is good, especially on the smoke, which I understand to be a difficult thing to photograph correctly. It''s a good shot.', '2003-12-02 15:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(501289, 48093, 9602, '<td valign="top">if the bacon is the subject, it needs to be in focus</td>', 'if the bacon is the subject, it needs to be in focus', '2003-12-02 15:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(501291, 48541, 9602, '<td valign="top">great picture, not sure how it fits the challenge?  But willing to give you bennifit of a doubt</td>', 'great picture, not sure how it fits the challenge?  But willing to give you bennifit of a doubt', '2003-12-02 15:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(501292, 48536, 6008, '<td valign="top">The kid''s face is a little soft (chocolate as a bribe perhaps?), and I personally would have cropped out the ear completely, but other than that the placement is good. Similiarly the leaves/flowers are a little dark and the buds seem to be closing so I assume it was fairly late at night. There is either a tree or a plant limb of some kind very near his forehead and it almost looks part of his features. The bottom right has a blank area of black that stops the flow/pattern of the leaves. It''s a good shot, but I think a different time of day would have helped it greatly.</td>', 'The kid''s face is a little soft (chocolate as a bribe perhaps?), and I personally would have cropped out the ear completely, but other than that the placement is good. Similiarly the leaves/flowers are a little dark and the buds seem to be closing so I assume it was fairly late at night. There is either a tree or a plant limb of some kind very near his forehead and it almost looks part of his features. The bottom right has a blank area of black that stops the flow/pattern of the leaves. It''s a good shot, but I think a different time of day would have helped it greatly.', '2003-12-02 15:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(501296, 48459, 14676, '<td valign="top">Some vapour coming out of them and a small piece chopped of would have made it more inspiring, yet it''s still not bad this way.</td>', 'Some vapour coming out of them and a small piece chopped of would have made it more inspiring, yet it''s still not bad this way.', '2003-12-02 15:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(501298, 48223, 14676, '<td valign="top">Perfect, a great definition for "scents and aromas"! Good work, really!</td>', 'Perfect, a great definition for "scents and aromas"! Good work, really!', '2003-12-02 15:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(501299, 48448, 6008, '<td valign="top">The right side just above the knife seems very blown out/overexposed/too bright. A lot of the details there have been lost. Because of that I''m not really sure about the composition, although the knife would be the leading diagonal line from the corner to the pepper that seems to be the main focus. With that in mind I wonder about the reasons for the garlic cloves. The red of the pepper is very vibrant.</td>', 'The right side just above the knife seems very blown out/overexposed/too bright. A lot of the details there have been lost. Because of that I''m not really sure about the composition, although the knife would be the leading diagonal line from the corner to the pepper that seems to be the main focus. With that in mind I wonder about the reasons for the garlic cloves. The red of the pepper is very vibrant.', '2003-12-02 15:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(501300, 48553, 14676, '<td valign="top">Interesting foto, yet not quite representative for "aromas".</td>', 'Interesting foto, yet not quite representative for "aromas".', '2003-12-02 15:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(501301, 48588, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like the mix of white and green, they are very contrasting and complimentary colors. Edges are a little soft but it''s quite an abstract image that I think it doesnt really matter. I would have liked to have seen a little more vibrant color, but white is so hard to get vivid without losing some details. The shadow on the petal is a little bit distracting, but not overly so. I like it.</td>', 'I like the mix of white and green, they are very contrasting and complimentary colors. Edges are a little soft but it''s quite an abstract image that I think it doesnt really matter. I would have liked to have seen a little more vibrant color, but white is so hard to get vivid without losing some details. The shadow on the petal is a little bit distracting, but not overly so. I like it.', '2003-12-02 15:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(501302, 48451, 14676, '<td valign="top">The idea of using onions is great, yet the photo is not that interesting. Why the smoke?</td>', 'The idea of using onions is great, yet the photo is not that interesting. Why the smoke?', '2003-12-02 15:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(501305, 48210, 14676, '<td valign="top">Tasty!</td>', 'Tasty!', '2003-12-02 15:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(501341, 48030, 5263, '<td valign="top">I don''t see any smoke- for me, the smoke is what visually represents scent.</td>', 'I don''t see any smoke- for me, the smoke is what visually represents scent.', '2003-12-02 17:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(501343, 48093, 5263, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of those funny commercials! I wish I could see more of the dog''s facial features better, though- the eyes especially</td>', 'Reminds me of those funny commercials! I wish I could see more of the dog''s facial features better, though- the eyes especially', '2003-12-02 17:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(501345, 48214, 5263, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition and subject! I''d love to see it in real life. However, to me it doesn''t seem to fit into this challenge very well.</td>', 'Beautiful composition and subject! I''d love to see it in real life. However, to me it doesn''t seem to fit into this challenge very well.', '2003-12-02 17:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(501346, 48223, 5263, '<td valign="top">What yummy cookies! I feel like the lighting could be changed to create more of a warm tone, though- this lighting makes it seem a little bit sterile.</td>', 'What yummy cookies! I feel like the lighting could be changed to create more of a warm tone, though- this lighting makes it seem a little bit sterile.', '2003-12-02 17:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(501347, 48576, 6008, '<td valign="top">Looks like an advertising campaign. The focus on the front bottle is good, lighting is wonderful, the cheeky bottle(?) in the background adds a sense of fun and sensuality. I even like the border on this. Cant really see anything I''d improve. Very professional-looking shot, well done.</td>', 'Looks like an advertising campaign. The focus on the front bottle is good, lighting is wonderful, the cheeky bottle(?) in the background adds a sense of fun and sensuality. I even like the border on this. Cant really see anything I''d improve. Very professional-looking shot, well done.', '2003-12-02 17:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(501353, 48541, 12115, '<td valign="top">Is this a photograph dealing with a scent or an aroma? NO.</td>', 'Is this a photograph dealing with a scent or an aroma? NO.', '2003-12-02 17:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(501360, 47851, 11895, '<td valign="top">a little too dark but otherwise very good</td>', 'a little too dark but otherwise very good', '2003-12-02 17:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(501362, 48311, 5436, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo but I cant rate very high because I dont believe it has to do with scent or aroma...</td>', 'Wonderful photo but I cant rate very high because I dont believe it has to do with scent or aroma...', '2003-12-02 17:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(501363, 48549, 5436, '<td valign="top">needs to be brightened up</td>', 'needs to be brightened up', '2003-12-02 17:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(501364, 48610, 5436, '<td valign="top">not focused</td>', 'not focused', '2003-12-02 17:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(501366, 48056, 5436, '<td valign="top">color seems unatural</td>', 'color seems unatural', '2003-12-02 17:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(501367, 48256, 5436, '<td valign="top">neat effect.</td>', 'neat effect.', '2003-12-02 17:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(501369, 48659, 11895, '<td valign="top">yuck, I know that smell</td>', 'yuck, I know that smell', '2003-12-02 17:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(501374, 48626, 5436, '<td valign="top">pretty picture but does not evoke scent or aroma to me</td>', 'pretty picture but does not evoke scent or aroma to me', '2003-12-02 17:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(501376, 48480, 13735, '<td valign="top">Intriguing, somehow (somewhat) suggesting shape of "the cloud". Well done!<br/> <br/>Hoewever, I''d maybe (only maybe) prefer upright direction and mushroom shape of it.</td>', 'Intriguing, somehow (somewhat) suggesting shape of "the cloud". Well done! Hoewever, I''d maybe (only maybe) prefer upright direction and mushroom shape of it.', '2003-12-02 17:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(501382, 48433, 13749, '<td valign="top">lovely image.  but, just as a matter of taste, i think that it might''ve looked better either without the single lit candle - or, if more were lit up.  1 out of 8 being lit up seems a bit out of place and throws off some of the balance of the photo (and the smoke)</td>', 'lovely image.  but, just as a matter of taste, i think that it might''ve looked better either without the single lit candle - or, if more were lit up.  1 out of 8 being lit up seems a bit out of place and throws off some of the balance of the photo (and the smoke)', '2003-12-02 18:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(501396, 48576, 7369, '<td valign="top">Great photo; almost like a commercial :D</td>', 'Great photo; almost like a commercial :D', '2003-12-02 18:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(501397, 48620, 7369, '<td valign="top">Nice background: it fits the citrons very well.</td>', 'Nice background: it fits the citrons very well.', '2003-12-02 18:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(501398, 48548, 7369, '<td valign="top">Hmmmz I''m wondering how you have made this. Please explain :D<br/></td>', 'Hmmmz I''m wondering how you have made this. Please explain :D', '2003-12-02 18:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(501400, 47926, 7369, '<td valign="top">Great use of negative space. I love this one (expect for the highlight on the label but that is just a very small distracting element). (9)</td>', 'Great use of negative space. I love this one (expect for the highlight on the label but that is just a very small distracting element). (9)', '2003-12-02 18:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(501403, 48032, 7369, '<td valign="top">The food in front is a little underexposed. It would have looked much better if you had added some (yellow?) light to it.</td>', 'The food in front is a little underexposed. It would have looked much better if you had added some (yellow?) light to it.', '2003-12-02 18:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(501412, 48567, 7369, '<td valign="top">Great use of light and excellent composition. A solid eight I reckon.</td>', 'Great use of light and excellent composition. A solid eight I reckon.', '2003-12-02 18:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(501415, 48154, 7369, '<td valign="top">The composition is wonderful but the light could be improved. Perhaps if the photo was a little darker with more shadows it would get more appeal.</td>', 'The composition is wonderful but the light could be improved. Perhaps if the photo was a little darker with more shadows it would get more appeal.', '2003-12-02 18:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(501417, 48467, 11241, '<td valign="top">great detail in this shot, and the blue really adds to the shot to.</td>', 'great detail in this shot, and the blue really adds to the shot to.', '2003-12-02 18:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(501437, 48591, 11241, '<td valign="top">nery nicely gone, and I like the border too.</td>', 'nery nicely gone, and I like the border too.', '2003-12-02 19:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(501439, 47976, 11241, '<td valign="top">great detail and great view point, Love that the background is not sharp....very well done.</td>', 'great detail and great view point, Love that the background is not sharp....very well done.', '2003-12-02 19:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(501465, 48593, 11241, '<td valign="top">very good detail and great subject...this does not smell very good...Well to a non-smoker anyways....9</td>', 'very good detail and great subject...this does not smell very good...Well to a non-smoker anyways....9', '2003-12-02 20:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
