(501624, 48154, 12733, '<td valign="top">I can almost taste (and smell) the cinnamon. What are the brown beans or berries that the spices are resting on?</td>', 'I can almost taste (and smell) the cinnamon. What are the brown beans or berries that the spices are resting on?', '2003-12-02 22:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(501625, 48462, 12733, '<td valign="top">I can understand wanting the focus on the spoon, but I think the out-of-focus bottle actually reduces the impact. Nice lighting for highlights on the metal.</td>', 'I can understand wanting the focus on the spoon, but I think the out-of-focus bottle actually reduces the impact. Nice lighting for highlights on the metal.', '2003-12-02 22:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(501626, 48639, 6008, '<td valign="top">I can certainly relate to this, and what a great smell it is. I like the tone and the border, it reminds me of coffee. The light reflection in the coffee mug is a little distracting but I understand some things can not be avoided. The image is a little soft, almost like it has been through neatimage but not quite as severe, but I suppose this could add to the dreamy mood. I like the idea of capturing the steam, but the placement is not the best- it is almost as if she is crying into the mug.</td>', 'I can certainly relate to this, and what a great smell it is. I like the tone and the border, it reminds me of coffee. The light reflection in the coffee mug is a little distracting but I understand some things can not be avoided. The image is a little soft, almost like it has been through neatimage but not quite as severe, but I suppose this could add to the dreamy mood. I like the idea of capturing the steam, but the placement is not the best- it is almost as if she is crying into the mug.', '2003-12-02 22:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(501628, 48153, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice catch on the smoke, but I''d like to see those incense sticks glow - possibly by reducing the artificial light level.</td>', 'Nice catch on the smoke, but I''d like to see those incense sticks glow - possibly by reducing the artificial light level.', '2003-12-02 22:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(501629, 48257, 6008, '<td valign="top">Ewww garlic! Composition is good and it''s nicely sharp and clear. A few of the bulbs near the top seem slightly overexposed and the detail has been lost somewhat. They are all very similar color/tone and so could probably have done with a little more contrast.</td>', 'Ewww garlic! Composition is good and it''s nicely sharp and clear. A few of the bulbs near the top seem slightly overexposed and the detail has been lost somewhat. They are all very similar color/tone and so could probably have done with a little more contrast.', '2003-12-02 22:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(501630, 48223, 12733, '<td valign="top">The cookies look great, but I think the shot cries out for cropping fairly close below the tray, and the hot pad looks out of place.</td>', 'The cookies look great, but I think the shot cries out for cropping fairly close below the tray, and the hot pad looks out of place.', '2003-12-02 22:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(501643, 48668, 6008, '<td valign="top">Cute idea! Lighting is good, composition is good, dof is good. I really cant see anything here that I would suggest changing. It''s different, I like it.</td>', 'Cute idea! Lighting is good, composition is good, dof is good. I really cant see anything here that I would suggest changing. It''s different, I like it.', '2003-12-02 23:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(501646, 48433, 6008, '<td valign="top">Not fond of the carpet although cant really say why. I like how you have one candle still lit. I''m leaning towards thinking that there is a little too much smoke, having less smoke would allow more individual plumes to stand out and add more interest, this way it seems a little chaotic. That said, I still think it''s a good image.</td>', 'Not fond of the carpet although cant really say why. I like how you have one candle still lit. I''m leaning towards thinking that there is a little too much smoke, having less smoke would allow more individual plumes to stand out and add more interest, this way it seems a little chaotic. That said, I still think it''s a good image.', '2003-12-02 23:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(501648, 48516, 12902, '<td valign="top">Very interesting and very warm. I would like to feel that scent.</td>', 'Very interesting and very warm. I would like to feel that scent.', '2003-12-02 23:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(501649, 48315, 12902, '<td valign="top">Nice and warm... I like the composition...</td>', 'Nice and warm... I like the composition...', '2003-12-02 23:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(501650, 48565, 12902, '<td valign="top">Excellent. This one it is running for a ribbon I think. But it is no coriander. 10 anyway<br/></td>', 'Excellent. This one it is running for a ribbon I think. But it is no coriander. 10 anyway', '2003-12-02 23:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(501651, 48241, 6008, '<td valign="top">There are certainly lots of smells in the image but to be honest there is very little there to make it stand out from just a snapshot of anyone''s bathroom. Some of the bottles are hidden behind others or the faucets/taps, there are reflections in the mirror and the main faucet/tap, and the space on the right is more than the left which unbalances it a little. Although you did avoid getting the camera and the photographer in the mirror, so that''s good!</td>', 'There are certainly lots of smells in the image but to be honest there is very little there to make it stand out from just a snapshot of anyone''s bathroom. Some of the bottles are hidden behind others or the faucets/taps, there are reflections in the mirror and the main faucet/tap, and the space on the right is more than the left which unbalances it a little. Although you did avoid getting the camera and the photographer in the mirror, so that''s good!', '2003-12-02 23:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(501653, 48237, 12902, '<td valign="top">Excellent realized. I can''t say that there is something I would like to change about it. Perfect. Deserves a 10.</td>', 'Excellent realized. I can''t say that there is something I would like to change about it. Perfect. Deserves a 10.', '2003-12-02 23:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(501654, 48567, 12902, '<td valign="top">One of the best around. I would predict a ribbon. 10 from me</td>', 'One of the best around. I would predict a ribbon. 10 from me', '2003-12-02 23:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(501656, 48153, 12902, '<td valign="top">Nice one... I like it. 8</td>', 'Nice one... I like it. 8', '2003-12-02 23:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(501657, 48553, 12902, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! I know how hard it is to photograph smoke. This one is so perfect... 10 from me</td>', 'Wonderful! I know how hard it is to photograph smoke. This one is so perfect... 10 from me', '2003-12-02 23:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(501660, 48666, 12902, '<td valign="top">Very simple and very nice.  The contrasting colours are wonderful. I also like the trace of smoke... Well done!</td>', 'Very simple and very nice.  The contrasting colours are wonderful. I also like the trace of smoke... Well done!', '2003-12-02 23:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(501662, 48467, 12902, '<td valign="top">The write bothers a bit. And I am not sure about the cropping. The negative space is too much I think. But I loooove the lighting!</td>', 'The write bothers a bit. And I am not sure about the cropping. The negative space is too much I think. But I loooove the lighting!', '2003-12-02 23:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(501663, 48585, 6008, '<td valign="top">I think I would have preferred some light on the neck area the same as the chin but otherwise this is an excellent photograph. The female neck can be a very sensual part of the body, but the lighting is clearly focused in other directions! The lighting/capture of the spritz really makes the shot. Very professional looking.</td>', 'I think I would have preferred some light on the neck area the same as the chin but otherwise this is an excellent photograph. The female neck can be a very sensual part of the body, but the lighting is clearly focused in other directions! The lighting/capture of the spritz really makes the shot. Very professional looking.', '2003-12-02 23:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(501666, 48663, 12902, '<td valign="top">This is perfect.... The texture of the petals and buds makes me feel the strong scent of the flower. The lighting is perfect. Have you painted it with light? Love the composition and the use of the diagonal. I am giving it a 10 but 10 sounds a poor mark for it. Deserves more.</td>', 'This is perfect.... The texture of the petals and buds makes me feel the strong scent of the flower. The lighting is perfect. Have you painted it with light? Love the composition and the use of the diagonal. I am giving it a 10 but 10 sounds a poor mark for it. Deserves more.', '2003-12-02 23:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(501667, 47927, 12902, '<td valign="top">So pure and beautiful and warm... I love it. 10</td>', 'So pure and beautiful and warm... I love it. 10', '2003-12-02 23:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(501668, 48533, 6008, '<td valign="top">The insect is so small that I think it actually detracts from the flower. The petals are soft and the colors are good, the yellow fuzzy bits are a nice contrast in color. I think moving the fuzzy bits a tad to the right would have made a slightly more dramatic composition, and omitting the insect would have made the colors and petal shapes be the more dominant features.</td>', 'The insect is so small that I think it actually detracts from the flower. The petals are soft and the colors are good, the yellow fuzzy bits are a nice contrast in color. I think moving the fuzzy bits a tad to the right would have made a slightly more dramatic composition, and omitting the insect would have made the colors and petal shapes be the more dominant features.', '2003-12-02 23:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(501669, 48032, 12902, '<td valign="top">Mmmmmm.... Now... this smell can drive someone crazy in the morning. I wish I didn''t see the green weeds in the background. It is distracting from the beauty of the arangement. Maybe you should have tried another angle. 8</td>', 'Mmmmmm.... Now... this smell can drive someone crazy in the morning. I wish I didn''t see the green weeds in the background. It is distracting from the beauty of the arangement. Maybe you should have tried another angle. 8', '2003-12-02 23:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(501670, 48462, 12902, '<td valign="top">Very good photo... One of the best. Good DOF and nice lighting. 10</td>', 'Very good photo... One of the best. Good DOF and nice lighting. 10', '2003-12-02 23:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(501672, 48550, 12902, '<td valign="top">I am sure this one is running for the blue. Wonderful  realized. Good lights, good cropping and clear picture. The steam looks great. I can smell it. 10 and I wish ribbon!</td>', 'I am sure this one is running for the blue. Wonderful  realized. Good lights, good cropping and clear picture. The steam looks great. I can smell it. 10 and I wish ribbon!', '2003-12-02 23:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(501673, 48466, 6008, '<td valign="top">The mug is good - it''s different, colorful, and interesting. The ears actually leave me wondering what it looks like inside, which is good. The lighting is ok, although slightly darker on the right hand side, which makes me wonder what it would look like with two light sources coming from either side. Unfortunately the very noticable background line/horizon is tilted.</td>', 'The mug is good - it''s different, colorful, and interesting. The ears actually leave me wondering what it looks like inside, which is good. The lighting is ok, although slightly darker on the right hand side, which makes me wonder what it would look like with two light sources coming from either side. Unfortunately the very noticable background line/horizon is tilted.', '2003-12-02 23:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(501674, 48598, 12902, '<td valign="top">Another picture running for a ribbon. It is so unreal beautiful.... Makes me wonder if I should stay and keep trying when there are photographers like you out there. 10! Congratulations!</td>', 'Another picture running for a ribbon. It is so unreal beautiful.... Makes me wonder if I should stay and keep trying when there are photographers like you out there. 10! Congratulations!', '2003-12-02 23:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(501675, 48039, 6008, '<td valign="top">I love the blue color, it is so vivid and vibrant. So many people say center compositions dont work well, but I think this one does. Nicely captured.</td>', 'I love the blue color, it is so vivid and vibrant. So many people say center compositions dont work well, but I think this one does. Nicely captured.', '2003-12-02 23:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(501677, 47875, 12902, '<td valign="top">Wow! What an impresive collection.... I like the warmth of it. Great choice the sepia. You probably had too many colours there. Well done. 9</td>', 'Wow! What an impresive collection.... I like the warmth of it. Great choice the sepia. You probably had too many colours there. Well done. 9', '2003-12-02 23:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(501678, 48057, 12902, '<td valign="top">Excellent! I love the feeling I get looking at this photo. Painted with light maybe? 10!!!</td>', 'Excellent! I love the feeling I get looking at this photo. Painted with light maybe? 10!!!', '2003-12-02 23:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(501679, 48154, 12902, '<td valign="top">Very good choice. One of the best pictures. I am sure will do good. No much time until I find out anyway. 10 from me.</td>', 'Very good choice. One of the best pictures. I am sure will do good. No much time until I find out anyway. 10 from me.', '2003-12-02 23:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(501681, 48646, 6008, '<td valign="top">It''s a good clean image and the lighting is good. Only negative is the background. I think ideally the back sheet needed to be farther away or else use one large piece of white paper. The line is fairly noticable, slightly ''dirty'', and seems a tad tilted.</td>', 'It''s a good clean image and the lighting is good. Only negative is the background. I think ideally the back sheet needed to be farther away or else use one large piece of white paper. The line is fairly noticable, slightly ''dirty'', and seems a tad tilted.', '2003-12-02 23:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
