(503242, 47982, 13218, '<td valign="top">Bravo! Biliana</td>', 'Bravo! Biliana', '2003-12-04 05:05:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(503328, 48637, 11096, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great picture.  Both the candle and the evergreen would be filling the room with scents.  If the candle is a cinnamon one it would be a Christmas scent filled room.  I think I would like it if there was a little, only a little bit less on the left side and the top.  The way it is now is just a little bit too dark to balance out the light on the right side.  But thats just my opinion.  ;)</td>', 'I think this is a great picture.  Both the candle and the evergreen would be filling the room with scents.  If the candle is a cinnamon one it would be a Christmas scent filled room.  I think I would like it if there was a little, only a little bit less on the left side and the top.  The way it is now is just a little bit too dark to balance out the light on the right side.  But thats just my opinion.  ;)', '2003-12-04 08:40:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(503552, 48299, 10785, '<td valign="top">Very nice job on this shot. You have come a long way quickly.<br/> <br/>Before you print this, I would spot edit those 4 white dots in the foreground. (Two in each corner) And possibly the little light brown spot on the comb handle in the second dark brown stripe from the left.</td>', 'Very nice job on this shot. You have come a long way quickly. Before you print this, I would spot edit those 4 white dots in the foreground. (Two in each corner) And possibly the little light brown spot on the comb handle in the second dark brown stripe from the left.', '2003-12-04 13:01:19.000000', NULL, 0),
