(508283, 48550, 9889, '<td valign="top">Congrats for the excellent capture.<br/> <br/>"I used the built-in flash on the camera that I tilted sideways to minimize overexposure in the center and thought the blue background might look good for showing the steam." <br/> <br/>How did you manage to tilt sideways the built-in flash of an F717?</td>', 'Congrats for the excellent capture. "I used the built-in flash on the camera that I tilted sideways to minimize overexposure in the center and thought the blue background might look good for showing the steam."  How did you manage to tilt sideways the built-in flash of an F717?', '2003-12-09 19:31:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(508421, 48317, 772, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club...<br/> <br/>Hi Matt...<br/> <br/>This photo, to me, is a bit weak.  It doesn''t not do a good job of conveying a sense of scent or aroma.  The perspective from which you made this shot is not particularly intersting, nor is the light.  It doesn''t inspire me in any way.  Having no personal tie with this cat, the photo is just another snapshot to me.<br/></td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club... Hi Matt... This photo, to me, is a bit weak.  It doesn''t not do a good job of conveying a sense of scent or aroma.  The perspective from which you made this shot is not particularly intersting, nor is the light.  It doesn''t inspire me in any way.  Having no personal tie with this cat, the photo is just another snapshot to me.', '2003-12-09 22:45:17.000000', NULL, 0),
