(537059, 48647, 14043, '<td valign="top">Yes, the water is actual dew.  Yes, I shouldn''t have cropped so tightly and offset it one way or the other.  And yes, the DOF, well could everyone please decide?  I liked it, apparently many didn''t.  It''s the best I could do with a fully automatic camera.  I have to force it into macro mode to get any DOF, so, there you go.<br/> <br/>Thank you to whoever gave me the 7s, 8s, 9s, and 10!!<br/>~Ami~</td>', 'Yes, the water is actual dew.  Yes, I shouldn''t have cropped so tightly and offset it one way or the other.  And yes, the DOF, well could everyone please decide?  I liked it, apparently many didn''t.  It''s the best I could do with a fully automatic camera.  I have to force it into macro mode to get any DOF, so, there you go. Thank you to whoever gave me the 7s, 8s, 9s, and 10!!~Ami~', '2004-01-09 02:44:49.000000', NULL, 0),
