(1982573, 48585, 50199, '<td valign="top">Some people are scared off by a little cleavage or bra, eh? Nice shot, and I''m especially pleased you didn''t show any brand on the perfume. It''s current look is more generic allowing us to see the photo as something besides a great advertisement. <br/> <br/>I wouldn''t have shifted your frame at all, as some others have suggested. The sexy mystique is one of the primary elements that the shot is so good. Without that sex appeal, the image would be very much devalued, would be all about the lighting and timing, and would lose some of the storyline behind it.<br/> <br/>Great shot - keep up the good work :)</td>', 'Some people are scared off by a little cleavage or bra, eh? Nice shot, and I''m especially pleased you didn''t show any brand on the perfume. It''s current look is more generic allowing us to see the photo as something besides a great advertisement.  I wouldn''t have shifted your frame at all, as some others have suggested. The sexy mystique is one of the primary elements that the shot is so good. Without that sex appeal, the image would be very much devalued, would be all about the lighting and timing, and would lose some of the storyline behind it. Great shot - keep up the good work :)', '2005-12-28 06:32:05.000000', NULL, 0),
